<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1SA" style="id">- pogoro Bible version</book>
  <para style="h">1 Samueli</para>
  <para style="toc1">Shitabu sha kwanja sha Samueli</para>
  <para style="toc2">Samueli</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Sam</para>
  <para style="mt1">Shitabu sha kwanja sha</para>
  <para style="imt2">1 Samueli</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGULERU</para>
  <para style="ip">Pa kwanja vitabu avi 1 Samueli na vya 2 Samueli shiweriti ndo shitabu shimu hera shikulu shimanikiti handa shitabu sha Samueli, kwa mala ya kwanja shitabu ashi shibagulitwi na kuwera vitabu viwili mulitolewu lya Biblia lyawalishemiti, (Septuaginta). Ali liweriti lipatanu ligona muutakulu wa Shiebrania lyalilembitwi kwa Shiyunani. Shisoweru ashi Septuaginta shilanguziya lipatanu ali ligona Mushiyunani shilembitwi na wasomi sabini ama sabini na mbili Washiyawudi. Mumalembu ga Shiyunani, 1 Samueli na 2 Samueli vishemitwi 1 ufalumi na 2 ufalumi shakapanu mulitolewu lya Biblia muutakulu wa Shilatini vishemitwi 1 Wafalumi na 2 Wafalumi aku vitabu vya ufalumi vyeni vishemwa 3 Wafalumi na 4 Wafalumi. Vitabu vya Samueli gwa kwanja na Samueli gwa pili vipapa malawiru ga historia ya makaliru ga Samueli yakaweriti mbuyi gwa Mlungu na mfalumi Sauli na mfalumi Dawudi, Samueli kaweriti ndo mlonguziya gwa upeleru, shaka isi ya Israeli payigalambukiti kulawa kukolwamlima na Watoza na kukolamlima na Wafalumi. Samueli ndo yakawaswagiti lipaki Sauli na Dawudi kuwera wafalumi wawili wa kwanja wa Israeli. Vitabu avi 1 Samueli na 2 Samueli vitakulira kwa mngati historia ya Israeli kwa shaka ashi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kwahera yakavimaniti gaa ndo yakavilembiti vitabu vya Samueli gwa kwanja na gwa pili. Muntu yakalembiti kalikanda ndiri muvitabu avi kumbiti iranguziya kaweriti mkomu mushipindi sha upeleru wa mfalumi Dawudi ama nentu ya panu, viraa kaweriti na uwezu wa kuwona na kusoma vitabu vimonga vya matakuliru ga sauli na samueli. Toziya ya bada yayiweriti kwa walemba wa vitabu avi viravi vimanikana ndiri vilembitwi ndii ama koshi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yagawera amu</para>
  <para style="io">Kwiwuka na kushemuwa kwa Samueli yakaweriti ntumintumi gwa Mlungu. Mushipandi sha 1 mpaka sha 3</para>
  <para style="io">Mushitabu ashi ilanguziya Lisandiku lya Lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu litolwa na Wafilisti na kutenda isi ya Wafilisti kwagamira. Mushipandi sha 4 mpaka sha 7</para>
  <para style="io">Waisraeli wafira mfalumi na Samueli kamlumika Sauli kaweri mfalumi gwa kwanja kumbiti shakapanu Mlungu kamlema Sauli. Mushipandi sha 8 mpaka sha 15</para>
  <para style="io">Shakapanu tumwona Samueli kankumlumika Dawudi kuwera mfalumi badala ya Sauli mushipandi sha 16 mpaka sha 31</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1SA 1" />
  <para style="s">Elikana na kaya yakuyi aku Shilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 1:1" />Paweriti na muntu yumu gwa lushi lwa Rama, gwa isi ya vigongu vya Efraimu, litawu lyakuyi Elikana, mwana gwa Yeruhamu, yakaweriti mzukulu gwa Elihu, yakaweriti mweni gwa Tohu, kaweriti mwana gwa Sufu, likabila lyakuyi liweriti Mwefraimu. <verse eid="1SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 1:2" />Elikana kaweriti na wadala wawili, yumu wamshemiti Hana na gwa pili Penina. Penina kaweriti na wana, kumbiti Hana kaweriti ndiri na wana. <verse eid="1SA 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 1:3" />Kila shinja Elikana kagenditi mwanja kulawa Rama kugenda Kuguwira na kumtambikira Mtuwa Mlungu yakana likaka kulii Shilu. Aku, wana wawili wapalu wa Eli, Hofini na Finehasi, waweriti watambika wa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1SA 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 1:4" />Kila shaka Elikana pakalaviyiti tambiku kampananiti mdala gwakuyi Penina lifungu limu lya shinofu lya tambiku na lifungu limulimu kwa wana wakuyi wapalu na wadala. <verse eid="1SA 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 1:5" />Tembera Elikana kampananiti Hana lifunga likulu nentu toziya kaweriti kamfira nentu, Mtuwa Mlungu kampananiti ndiri mwana. <verse eid="1SA 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 1:6" />Kumbiti Penina kamsoziya Hana, mashaka goseri kaweriti pakamkalaziya nentu Hana toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kampanana ndiri wana. <verse eid="1SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 1:7" />Vitwatira avi vyendereyiti shinja mpaka shinja. Kila mala Hana pakagenditi kunumba ya Mtuwa Mlungu, Penina kamkalaziyiti mpaka iwera Hana kankulira na kulema kuliya shoseri shirii. <verse eid="1SA 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 1:8" />Elikana, mpalu gwakuyi, kila mala kamkosiyiti, “Gulira shishi? Hashi gulema kuliya? Ntambu gaa gwana kwinginika mumoyu mwaku? Hashi, neni nfaa ndiri kwa gwenga kuliku wana lilongu wapalu?”<verse eid="1SA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hana na Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 1:9" />Lishaka limu, pawaweriti wamalira kuliya na kulanda mnumba ya Mtuwa Mlungu aku Shilu, Hana kagoloka na kuluwa kwa Mlungu. Shaka ashi, mtambika Eli kaweriti kalikala kushiti pakwegera na mpanda ya Numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1SA 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 1:10" />Hana kaweriti na hinginika nentu na pakaweriti kankumluwa Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti kankulira kwa hinginika. <verse eid="1SA 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 1:11" />Yomberi katula nazili pakalonga, “Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu yakana likakala, handa pagulola kutabika kwa neni ntumintumi gwaku, gumpanani neni ntumintumi gwaku, mwana mpalu, ntakula hanikupanani gwenga Mtuwa Mlungu mwana ayu mpalu kaweri gwaku makaliru gakuyi goseri, hapeni kamogwi vili nakamu toziya katurwa kwa Mtuwa.” <verse eid="1SA 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 1:12" />Hana kendereyiti kumluwa Mtuwa Mlungu kwa shaka shitali, na mtambika Eli kawera kankulola miromu yakuyi. <verse eid="1SA 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 1:13" />Hana kaweriti kankuluwa shimoyumoyu, na miromu yakuyi iweriti yankuvinavina, ira liziwu lyakuyi lipikinirika ndiri. Hangu Eli kaliholiti handa Hana kalowera. <verse eid="1SA 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 1:14" />Hangu Eli kamgambira, “Hagwendereyi kulowera mpaka ndii? Guleki kulanda divayi” <verse eid="1SA 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 1:15" />Kumbiti Hana kamwankula, “Ndala mtuwa gwangu, neni ndo mdala yantabika nentu. Neni nanda ndiri divayi pota shiloweru shikalipa, ila nweriti nankumlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu yagawera mumoyu mwangu. <verse eid="1SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 1:16" />Naguholera kuwera neni ndo mdala yakafaa ndiri shintu. Kwa shaka shoseri ashi nweriti panduwa panonga nankutakula magaziya gangu na ntabika ya neni.” <verse eid="1SA 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 1:17" />Eli kamgambira, “Gugendi kwa ponga, na Mlungu gwa Israeli kakupanani shirii shaguluwa.” <verse eid="1SA 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 1:18" />Hana kalonga, “Nduwa neni ntumintumi gwaku guholeri weli,” Hana kagenda zakuyi, kaliya shiboga na kaweriti ndiri kayi na hinginika.<verse eid="1SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwiwuka na kutulwa kulongolu kwa mtuwa kwa Samueli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 1:19" />Shirawu yakuyi mandawira, Elikana na walongu wakuyi wimukiti mandawira putiputi, na pakumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu, kawuyiti ukaya Rama. Elikana kagonja na mdala gwakuyi Hana, Mtuwa Mlungu kawankula kuluwa kwakuyi Hana. <verse eid="1SA 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 1:20" />Hangu Hana kapata yinda, kamlera mwana mpalu. Hana kamshema mwana ayu Samueli, toziya kalongiti, “Nimluwiti kwa Mtuwa Mlungu.” <verse eid="1SA 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 1:21" />Shakapanu shaka shisoka kayi Elikana na kaya wakuyi woseri wagenda kayi Shilu na kumlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu tambiku ya kila shinja na nazili. <verse eid="1SA 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 1:22" />Kumbiti mwanja agu Hana kagenditi ndiri, toziya kamgambiriti mpalu gwakuyi, “Katepu mwana pawamlekiziyiti konka, hanimjegi su katuluwi kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, kasigali aku mashaka goseri.”<verse eid="1SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 1:23" />Elikana, mpalu gwakuyi, kamwankula, “Gutendi lyaguliwona liherepa. Guheperi mpaka pagumlekiziya mwana konka. Mtuwa Mlungu kayitendi nazili yakuyi kuwera nakaka.” Su, Hana kasigaliti ukaya, kendereya kumlera mwana gwakuyi mpaka pakamlekeziyiti konka.<verse eid="1SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 1:24" />Pakamlekeziyiti konka kamjegiti pamuhera na ng'ombi shipalu gwa mivinja mitatu, mfuku gwa kilu tisa gwa ubumu na shiwiga sha divayi. Hana kamwingiziyiti mwana munumba ya Mtuwa Mlungu aku Shilu, na mwana kaweriti mdidika hera. <verse eid="1SA 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 1:25" />Pawaweriti wamlikitula kala ng'ombi shipalu ulii, wamjegiti mwana kwa mtambika Eli. <verse eid="1SA 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 1:26" />Hana kamgambira, “Ntambu Mtuwa Mlungu kakutenda guweri mkomu hashi guhola, neni ndo mdala ulii yakaweriti kagoloka kulongolu kwaku pakamluwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1SA 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 1:27" />Nimluwiti Mtuwa Mlungu kanupi mwana ayu na yomberi kanupiti shilii shanduwiti. <verse eid="1SA 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 1:28" />Toziya ayi, neni nimpanana Mtuwa Mlungu mwana ayu, shaka shoseri pakawera mkomu, katuluwa kwa Mtuwa Mlungu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 1:28">Shakapanu wamguwira Mtuwa Mlungu aku.<verse eid="1SA 1:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1SA 2" />
  <para style="s">Maluwa ga Hana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 2:1" />Shakapanu Hana kaluwiti pakalonga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:1">“Nimnemelera Mtuwa Mlungu mumoyu mwangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:1">Nimkwisa Mtuwa Mlungu toziya yomberi ndo likakala lyangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:1">Niwaseka wankondu wangu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:1">Toziya niwunemelera ukanka wangu wagumpananiti.”<verse eid="1SA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 2:2" />“Kwahera yakawera mnanagala handa Mtuwa Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:2">kwahera yoseri yakawera handa yomberi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:2">Kwahera Yakawera mlolera handa Mlungu gwetu.<verse eid="1SA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 2:3" />Mleki kulizyuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:3">mleki kulonga visoweru vidoda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:3">Toziya yakavimana Mtuwa Mlungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:3">Yomberi kagatoza matendu gawu goseri.<verse eid="1SA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 2:4" />Mbindi za wana likakala zimegeka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:4">Kumbiti yawahera likakala wendereya kongereka likakala.<verse eid="1SA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 2:5" />Walii makashu waweriti na shiboga shivuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">vinu watenda shibaluwa su wapati shiboga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">Kumbiti yawaweriti na njala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">Vinu wahera njala kayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">Mdala mbendi kalera wana wavuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">kumbiti mawu yakana wana wavuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">vinu wamleka pota mwana.<verse eid="1SA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 2:6" />Mtuwa Mlungu kalaga na kuzyukisiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:6">yomberi kawasulusiya kuisi ya wahowiti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:6">na yomberi kawawuziya kayi.<verse eid="1SA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 2:7" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawatenda wamu waweri wahushu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:7">na wamu wawu walunda. Wamonga kawasulusiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:7">na wamonga kawakweniziya.<verse eid="1SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 2:8" />Kawanyasula wahushu kulawa mumadikudiku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">kuwakweniziya wananfiru kulawa mmalivu, Kawakalaziya pamuhera na wakulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">Na kuwatula pahala pa ligoya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">toziya migeleri ya pasipanu ndo Mtuwa Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">na pampindi pampanda azi kapatula pasipanu.”<verse eid="1SA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 2:9" />“Yomberi kagalolera makaliru ga wantu wakuyi wananagala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:9">Kumbiti makaliru ga wankondu kagalemera kutali kuluwindu. Toziya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:9">muntu kapata ndiri ukanka kwa makakala gakuyi.<verse eid="1SA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 2:10" />Wankondu wa Mtuwa Mlungu hawamegangwi vipandi vipandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">Hakawawungulumiri womberi handa lupanda kulawa kumpindi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">Mtuwa Mlungu hakapatozi pasi panu poseri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">na yomberi hakampanani likakala mfalumi gwakuyi hakamtenderi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">na hakaukulaziyi uwezu wa msyagula gwakuyi.”<verse eid="1SA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 2:11" />Shakapanu, Elikana kawuya ukaya Rama. Kumbiti mwana Samueli kasigala Shilu kumtendera Mtuwa Mlungu pasi pa ulonguziya wa mtambika Eli.<verse eid="1SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wana wa Mtambika Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 2:12" />Wana wapalu wa Eli waweriti wakontola. Wamjimira ndiri Mtuwa Mlungu, <verse eid="1SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 2:13" />ama kwa vintu vyeni wantu vyawafiruwitwi kuwapanana watambika. Kila mala muntu pakaweriti kankumlavilira tambiku yakuyi, ntumintumi gwa mtambika kiziti na kolewu ya menu matatu, na shaka shinofu pashiwera shankutokota, <verse eid="1SA 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 2:14" />ntumintumi ayu kayisoma kolewu ayi mngati mushiwiga, shinofu shoseri shanashilawi amu kwa shikolewu ashi, shiweriti sha mtambika. Waisraeli woseri yawagenditi Shilu kulaviya tambiku zawu watenditwi ntambu ayi. <verse eid="1SA 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 2:15" />Kumbiti, ata pamberi lipaki halyeni lunguziwi, ntumintumi gwa mtambika kiza na kumgambira muntu ulii yakalaviya tambiku, “Gumulaviliri mtambika shinofu sha kubanika toziya yomberi hapeni kanki shinofu shaku shakupwasiya, ila yayiwera mbisi.”<verse eid="1SA 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 2:16" />Na handa muntu ayu pakanankula, “Guheperi uti noshii lipaki shakapanu hagutoli shiyasi shoseri shagufira,” su ntumintumi gwa mtambika hakankuli, “Nema gunupi ulavinu! Pagulema hantoli kwa makakala!”<verse eid="1SA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 2:17" />Vidoda avi vya wantemba awa wa Eli viweriti vikulu nentu kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. Toziya wantemba awa wagatenderiti ndiri ligoya malaviwu ga Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="1SA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samueli aku Shilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 2:18" />Shaka ashi, mntemba Samueli kendereyiti kumtendera Mtuwa Mlungu, pakawera kavala nguwu nfunfu ya gweka yakumtendera Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 2:19" />Kila shinja mawu gwakuyi kamfumiliti lihabiti lididika na kumjegera pakaweriti kankugenda na mpalu gwakuyi kulaviya tambiku ya kila shinja. <verse eid="1SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 2:20" />Eli kawatekeleriti Elikana na mdala gwakuyi, pakalonga, “Mtuwa Mlungu na kakupanani gwenga Elikana wana wamonga kwa mdala ayu su watoli pahala pa ulii yakampananiti Mtuwa Mlungu”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 2:20">Shakapanu womberi wawuya ukaya.<verse eid="1SA 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 2:21" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamwoneriti lusungu Hana na yomberi kampanana wana wapalu watatu na wahinga wawili. Mwana Samueli kendereya kukula kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="1SA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eli na wana wakuyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 2:22" />Shaka ashi Eli kaweriti mzewi nentu. Pakapikiniriti goseri geni wana wakuyi wapalu weriti wankuwatendera Waisraeli, na ntambu yaweriti wagonjiti na wadala yawaweriti wankutendera kuligomi lya Liringu Linanagala. <verse eid="1SA 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 2:23" />Kawakosiyi, “Hashi mtenda vitwatira avi? Mpikinira kulawa kwa wantu woseri vidoda vyamvitenda. <verse eid="1SA 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 2:24" />Namtenda hangu wana wangu, toziya vitwatira avi vyampikiniriti kulawa kwa wantu wa Mtuwa Mlungu kwa mwenga ndo madoda. <verse eid="1SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 2:25" />Muntu pakamtendera vidoda myaguyi, Mlungu kaweza kumlekiziya. Kumbiti muntu pakamtendera vidoda Mtuwa Mlungu gaa yakaweza kumluwira kwa Mlungu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 2:25">Kumbiti wana wakuyi wampikinira ndiri tati gwawu, toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti kafiliti kuwalaga.<verse eid="1SA 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 2:26" />Mwana Samueli kandereya kukula, kandereya kufiruwa na Mtuwa Mlungu na wantu.<verse eid="1SA 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umbuyi kwa kaya ya Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 2:27" />Lishaka limu, mbuyi gwa Mlungu kamgendera Eli, kamgambira, “Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu, nilimanaziyiti kwa kaya ya Aruni, wazewi waku, pawaweriti wamanda wa Farao muisi ya Misri. <verse eid="1SA 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 2:28" />Pakati pa makabila goseri ga Israeli nimsyaguliti Aruni na walongu wakuyi kuwera mtambika gwangu, wantenderi pashitalawanda, watumiziyi ubani na kuvala nguwu ya kugibiki pashifuwa kulongolu kwaneni niwapanani walongu wa wazewi waku tambika zyangu zyeni Waisraeli wandaviliti kwa motu. <verse eid="1SA 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 2:29" />Ntambu gaa su, guziwonera weya tambiku zyanuwagambiziyiti wantu wanjegeri? Gwenga guwafira wana waku kuliku neni kwa kulinenepiziya maweni mwenga kwa kuliya seemu ziherepa za tambiku zyeni wantu wa neni wa Israeli wandavilira! <verse eid="1SA 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 2:30" />Hangu, Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, kalonga hangu, ntakuliti handa kaya yaku na kaya ya wazewi waku hamwizi kulongolu kwa neni kuntendera mashaka goseri. Kumbiti vinu Mtuwa Mlungu kakubwelera hangu, mlandu agu guweri kutali na neni. Haniwapanani ligoya yawampanana ligoya na walii yawampanana ndiri ligoya haniwapanani ndiri ligoya. <verse eid="1SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 2:31" />Guloli mashaka gakwiza hanikulagi gwenga na wantemba waku woseri wapalu muwalongu waku na mulukolu lwaku, ata hapeni kuweri na mpalu yoseri hakalikali kaweri mzewi nentu. <verse eid="1SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 2:32" />Haguweri na lyoga na haguwawoneri wayagu weya kwa ntekelera zaniwapanani wantu wa Israeli kumbiti kwahera muntu muwalongu waku hakalikali na kuwera Mzewi nentu. <verse eid="1SA 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 2:33" />Muntu gwaku mweni hapeni numlemi kulawa pashitalawanda shangu hakaweri kaponeka su hanimtosoli masu gakuyi, na yomberi hakatwezuki na walera waku hawalaguwi pota lusungu. <verse eid="1SA 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 2:34" />Na lyalifirakuwapata wana waku wawili wapalu, Hofini na Finehasi, ndo ali woseri wawili hawahowi lishaka limu. Ali haliweri ndo lilangaliru kwaku. <verse eid="1SA 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 2:35" />Shakapanu, hanilisyaguliri mtambika gwingi mwaminika yakafira kutenda kulinganira na galii ganimfira katendi. Hanimpanani wiwuka weni hawatenderwi mashaka goseri kulongolu kwa mfalumi yanimsyaguliti. <verse eid="1SA 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 2:36" />Yoseri yakasigala muwiwuka waku hakamgenderi mtambika ayu na kumluwa shipandi sha mpiya ama libumunda, na kumgambira, na kuluwa kajimiluwi kapananwa lihengu lya kuwatanga watambika, su mezi kupata shiboga sha kuliya.”<verse eid="1SA 2:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1SA 3" />
  <para style="s">Mtuwa kankumlawira Samueli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 3:1" />Shaka ashi, muntemba Samueli pakaweriti kankumtendera Mtuwa Mlungu pasi pa ulolera wa Eli, ulagilagi kulawa kwa Mtuwa Mlungu uweriti uvuwa ndiri, ata na maonu kulawa kwakuyi gaweriti gavuwa ndiri. <verse eid="1SA 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 3:2" />Lishaka limu pashiru, shaka ashi Eli masu gakuyi gaweriti gawona ndiri toziya ya uzewi, kaweriti kagonja mushumba shakuyi. <verse eid="1SA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 3:3" />Samueli na yomberi kaweriti kagonja mngati mnumba nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu pakwegera na Lisandiku lya Lipatanu lya Mlungu. Taa ya Mtuwa Mlungu iweriti yankali yakwaka toziya kuweriti hakweni langali. <verse eid="1SA 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 3:4" />Mtuwa Mlungu ndo kamshema Samueli. Na yomberi Samueli, kitika, “Yina!” <verse eid="1SA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 3:5" />Shakapanu, Samueli kamgendera Eli kalongola, kamgambira, “Niza toziya gunshema.” Kumbiti Eli kamgambira, “Neni nikushema ndiri. Gugendi gwakagonji.” Samueli kawuya na kugonja.<verse eid="1SA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 3:6" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamshema kayi, “Samueli!” Samueli kimuka, kamgendera Eli na kumgambira, “Niza, toziya gushema.” Kumbiti Eli kamgambira, “Nikushema ndiri mwanagwangu, kagonji kayi.” <verse eid="1SA 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 3:7" />Samueli kaweriti hakanilipikinili liziwu lywa Mtuwa Mlungu, pota ulagilagi wa Mtuwa Mlungu uweriti haweni gubutulwi kwakuyi. <verse eid="1SA 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 3:8" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamshema Samueli mala ya ntatu na yomberi kamgendera Eli na kumgambira, “Niza, toziya gushema.” Panu ndo Eli pakayambula kuwera Mtuwa Mlungu ndo yakamshemiti Samueli. <verse eid="1SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 3:9" />Hangu Eli kamgambira Samueli, “Gugendi gukagonji na pakakushema kayi gulongi, gutakuli neni ntumintumi gwaku mpikinira.” Hangu Samueli kawuya na kugonja pahala pakuyi. <verse eid="1SA 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 3:10" />Su Mtuwa Mlungu kiza na kugoloka palii, kamshema Samueli handa kwanja, “Samueli! Samueli!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:10">Samueli kalonga, “Gulongi, toziya neni ntumintumi gwaku mpikanira.”<verse eid="1SA 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 3:11" />Shakapanu, Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira Samueli, “Guloli, nfira kutenda mlandu tunga Muisraeli gweni kila yakapikanira hakalilimuki. <verse eid="1SA 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 3:12" />Lishaka ali, hantendi goseri galii gantakuliti kwanjira kwanja mpaka upeleru kuusu Eli na kaya yakuyi. <verse eid="1SA 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 3:13" />Nimgambira kala kuwera haniyikomangi kaya yakuyi mashaka goseri, kwa makontola gakagamana toziya wana wakuyi wapalu wanigiranga neni na kawabera ndiri. <verse eid="1SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 3:14" />Hangu nililapa kuusu kaya ya Eli handa ukondola wawu hapeni uwusiwi nakamu kwa tambiku ya kulunguziwa pota malaviwu goseri.”<verse eid="1SA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 3:15" />Samueli kagonja palii mpaka mandawira, shakapanu kimuka na kuvugula ligomi lya numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu. Kumbiti Samueli katiliti kumgambira Eli shakamgambiriti Mlungu. <verse eid="1SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 3:16" />Ata hangu, Eli kamshemiti Samueli, kamgambira, “Mwana gwangu Samueli.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:16">Samueli kitika, “Yina!”<verse eid="1SA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 3:17" />Eli kamkosiya, “Hashi, Mtuwa Mlungu kakugambiriti shishi? Nagunfifa shakakugambiriti. Payiwera hagunfifi shakakugariti, Mlungu hakakomangi nentu.” <verse eid="1SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 3:18" />Su, Samueli kamgambira Eli goseri gakagambilitwi, pota kumfifa shoseri. Eli ndo kalonga, “Yomberi ndo Mtuwa Mlungu, na katendi shakawona ndo shiherepa kwakuyi.”<verse eid="1SA 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 3:19" />Samueli kendereya kukula na Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti pamuhera na yomberi, na goseri galii gakatakuliti kwahera ata shimu shashitendekiti ndiri. <verse eid="1SA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 3:20" />Wantu woseri koseri kuisi ya Israeli kulawa Dani, uwega wa kushana, mpaka Beeri Sheba, uwega wa kusika, wavimana kuwera Samueli kaweriti mtambika nakaka gwa Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="1SA 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 3:21" />Mtuwa Mlungu kongeriti kulilanguziya aku Shilu, toziya kamlawiriti Samueli na kuyowera nayu. Na Samueli pakapikiniriti shintu, Waisraeli woseri wampikiniriti.<verse eid="1SA 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1SA 4" />
  <para style="s">Wafilisti wankulitola Lisandiku lya lipatanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 4:1" />Shaka ashi, Wafilisti waliwona pamuhera, walikomangi na Waisraeli. Waisraeli wanyawiti malingu gawu aku Ebenezeri na Wafilisti wanyawa malingu gawu aku Afeka. <verse eid="1SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 4:2" />Wafilisti wawakomangiti Waisraeli na pa makomangu makulu, Waisraeli wasinditi. Waisraeli elufu msheshi walaguwitwi kuluwaga lwa makomangu. <verse eid="1SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 4:3" />Wamashonta wa Israeli yawaponikiti pawasokiti mungonjeru, wazewi wa Israeli walongiti, “Ntambu gaa Mtuwa Mlungu kawaleka Wafilisti watukanki leru? Tugendeni tulijegi Lisandiku lya Lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu kulawa Shilu, su kawezi kugenda na twenga kunkondu na kutulopola kulawa wankondu wetu.” <verse eid="1SA 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 4:4" />Hangu, wawatumiti wantumintumi aku Shilu, na womberi wajegiti Lisandiku lya Lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu yakana makakala, mweni kalikala shifalumi pampindi pa viwumbi vyana mbapatiru yawashemwa Makerubi. Na wana wawili wapalu wa Eli, Hofini na Finehasi wiziti pamuhera na Lisandiku lilii lya lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1SA 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 4:5" />Lisandiku lya lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu palisokiti mungonjeru Waisraeli woseri wabotangiti pawanemelera kwa manemu, mpaka isi yoseri itikinyika. <verse eid="1SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 4:6" />Wafilisti pawapikiniriti liziwu ali lya nemeleru walongiti “Mashowanganu goseri aga kungonjeru ga Waeburaniya gana mana gaa?” Pawavimaniti handa Lisandiku lya Lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu liweriti lisoka kungonjeru zawu, <verse eid="1SA 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 4:7" />Wafilisti watiriti walonga, “Toziya wamlungu wiza kungonjeru yawu! Shondi twenga! Shitwatila handa ashi hasheni lawiri! <verse eid="1SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 4:8" />Shondi twenga! Ndo gaa yakafira kutulopola kulawa kwa wamlungu awa yawana makakala? Awa ndo wamlungu yawawalagiti Wamisri kwa kila ntambu ya makomangu kushiwala. <verse eid="1SA 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 4:9" />Vinu, mwenga Wafilisti, mlipananani moyu. Muweri, wagangamala namwiza kuwera wamanda wa Shiebrania handa womberi ntambu yawaweriti wamanda wa twenga. Muweri wagangamala handa wapalu na kulikomanga.” <verse eid="1SA 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 4:10" />Su Wafilisti walikomanga nkondu na Waisraeli wasinditi na kutira kila muntu ukaya kwakuyi. Lishaka ali kuweriti na malaga makulu toziya mashonta elufu selasini yawagenda kwa magulu wa Israeli walagitwi. <verse eid="1SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 4:11" />Lisandiku lya lipatanu lya Mlungu litolitwi na Wafilisti kwa makakala na wana wawili wapalu wa Eli, Hofini na Finehasi walaguwa.<verse eid="1SA 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhowa kwa Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 4:12" />Lishaka liraali, muntu yumu gwa likabila lya Benjamini katugiti kulawa kulongolu gwa makomangu mpaka Shilu agawu nguwu zakuyi paziwera zidegekanga na pakawera na lidikudiku pamtuyi gwakuyi kulanguziya hinginika yakaweriti nayi. <verse eid="1SA 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 4:13" />Eli, kaweriti na lyoga mumoyu kuusu Lisandiku lya Mtuwa Mlungu, kaweriti kalikala mushiti shakuyi, kumpeku mwa njira pakalola. Muntu ulii pakasokiti kumjini na kutakula visoweru avi, wantu woseri wa mji agu waliliti kwa kubotanga. <verse eid="1SA 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 4:14" />Eli pakapikiniriti liziwu lya kulila, kakosiya, “Umatu awu wa shishi?” Muntu ulii kagenda kalongola kwa Eli su kumgambira visoweru avi. <verse eid="1SA 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 4:15" />Shaka ashi, Eli kaweriti na vinja tisini na nani na masu gakuyi gaweriti gana lwisi. <verse eid="1SA 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 4:16" />Muntu ulii kamgambira Eli, “Ntuga kulawa munkondu leru.” Eli kamkosiya, “Mwana gwangu, vitwatira viweriti vyahashi aku?” <verse eid="1SA 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 4:17" />Uli yakajegiti visoweru kalonga, “Waisraeli wawatira Wafilisti. Kuwera na malaga makulu muwamu mwa Waisraeli. Nentu ga goseri, wana waku wawili, Hofini na Finehasi, walaguwa, na Lisandiku lya Lipatanu lya Mlungu litolwa kwa makakala.”<verse eid="1SA 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 4:18" />Muntu ayu pakakantiti Lisandiku lya Mlungu, Eli kaguwiti lugali kulawa kushiti shakuyi kumbeku kuligomi likulu. Eli pakaguwiti singu yakuyi imegekiti toziya kaweriti Mzewi na kanenepiti, na yomberi kahowa. Eli kaweriti mtoza gwa Israeli kwa shaka sha mivinja alubaini.<verse eid="1SA 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhowa kwa mkenja gwa Finehasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 4:19" />Kayi ilawiriti hangu, mganafu gwakuyi Eli, mdala gwa Finehasi, shaka ashi kaweriti kana yinda, na shaka shakuyi sha kulera shiweriti sha pakwegera. Pakapikiniriti handa Lisandiku lya Lipatanu litolwa kwa makakala na handa mganafu gwakuyi, na mpalu gwakuyi kahowa, mala yimu utama umwanjiti, na kulera kumbiti utama uweriti ukalipa. <verse eid="1SA 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 4:20" />Su, pakaweriti kankuhowa, wadala yawaweriti wankumtanga wamgambiriti, “Nagutira, toziya gulera mwana mpalu.” Kumbiti yomberi kankula ndiri shintu, pota kuwapikinira. <verse eid="1SA 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 4:21" />Yomberi kamshema mwana gwakuyi Ikabodi, mana yakuyi, “Uweru wa Mlungu uwuka Israeli,” pakawera na mana handa Lisandiku lya Lipatanu liweriti litoluwa kwa makakala, kayi mganafu gwakuyi na mpalu gwakuyi, woseri wahowa. <verse eid="1SA 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 4:22" />Kalonga, “Uweru wa Mlungu uwuka Israeli toziya Lisandiku lya Lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu litoluwa kwa makakala.”<verse eid="1SA 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1SA 5" />
  <para style="s">Lisandiku lya lipatanu pakati pa Wafilisti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 5:1" />Pa Wafilisti kulitola kwa makakala Lisandiku lya Mlungu, walipapiti kulawa mji Ebenezeri mpaka mji gwawu gwa Ashidodi. <verse eid="1SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 5:2" />Shakapanu wajega Lisandiku lya Mlungu kunumba ya mlungu gwawu Dagoni na kulitula pakwegera na yomberi. <verse eid="1SA 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 5:3" />Shirawu yakuyi mandawira, wantu wa mji gwa Ashidodi pawimukiti wawoniti shinyagu sha Dagoni shiguwa makukama kulongolu kwa Lisandiku lya Mlungu. Washigolosiya kayi shinyagu sha Dagoni na kushitula kayi pahala pakuyi. <verse eid="1SA 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 5:4" />Kumbiti, shirawu yakuyi pawimukiti, wawoniti kuwera shinyagu sha Dagoni shiguwa makukama kulongolu kulisandiku lya Mtuwa Mlungu, mtuyi, magulu na mawoku ga shinyagu ashi, vyoseri viweriti vidumuka, viwera vigonja pasi pa pashizingiti sha ligomi. Nshimba yakuyi ndo yayiweriti isigala. <verse eid="1SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 5:5" />Toziya watambika wa Dagoni na woseri yawagenda Ashidodi, pawingira kumguwira Dagoni watimba ndiri shizingiti sha numba ya Dagoni mpaka leru. <verse eid="1SA 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 5:6" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawajegera makomangu nentu na kuwatiriziya wantu wa Ashidodi. Kawakomanga, ata na wantu yawaweriti wapakwegera nawa, kwa kuwajegera ulweri wa malipu. <verse eid="1SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 5:7" />Wenikaya wa Ashidodi pawawoniti mirandu yayiwapatiti, walonga, “Mlungu gwa Israeli Katukomanga nentu twenga pamuhera na mlungu gwetu Dagoni. Lisandiku lya Lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu hapeni liwezi kulikala kwa twenga” <verse eid="1SA 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 5:8" />Watumiti walagilagi na kuwajojonira walonguziya woseri wamuhanu wa Wafilisti na kuwakosiya, “Hatutendi hashi na Lisandiku ali lya Mlungu gwa Israeli?” Wakulu wawu wankula, “Lisandiku ali lya Mlungu gwa Israeli mlijegeri Gati.” Su walijegera aku. <verse eid="1SA 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 5:9" />Kumbiti pa kulijega aku Gati, Mtuwa Mlungu kagukomanga mji agu, pakajega lyoga likulu kumjini na kawakomanga wapalu wa mji agu wantemba kwa wazewi, kwa kuwajegera malipu. <verse eid="1SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 5:10" />Su, walijega Lisandiku ali lya Mlungu kumji gwa Ekroni. Kumbiti Lisandiku ali lya Mlungu palisokiti aku, wantu wa mji agu washowanganiti, “Watujegera Lisandiku lya Mlungu gwa Israeli su kutulaga twenga twawoseri.” <verse eid="1SA 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 5:11" />Shakapanu walagalira ulagilagi na kujojonira wakulu wa Wafiristi na kuwagambira, “Mliwuziyi Lisandiku lya Mlungu gwa Israeli pahala pakuyi, su nalitulaga twenga pamuhera na wantu wetu.”Watenditi hangu toziya kuweriti na lyoga likulu koseri, toziya Mlungu kawakomangiti nentu. <verse eid="1SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 5:12" />Na walii yawahowiti ndiri wapatiti malipu, ata walira kwa mlungu gwawu watangwi.<verse eid="1SA 5:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1SA 6" />
  <para style="s">Lisandiku lya lipatanu lyakuwuziwa Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 6:1" />Pa Lisandiku lya Mtuwa Mlungu kuwera muisi ya Wafilisti kwa shaka sha miyezi saba, <verse eid="1SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 6:2" />Wafilisti wawashemiti watambika na watunga wawu na kuwakosiya, “Tutendi hashi na Lisandiku ali lya Mtuwa Mlungu? Mtugambiri tuliwuziyi na shintu gaa pahala pakuyi.” <verse eid="1SA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 6:3" />Womberi wawagambira, “Pamuliwuziya Lisandiku lya Mlungu gwa Israeli, namuliwuziya mawoku hera. Kumbiti kwa ntambu yoseri ilii pamuliwuziya mjegi na tambiku ya kuwusiya ukondola wenu. Pamtenda hangu hamponeki, na mwenga hamuvimani kwa ntambu gaa kaweriti kankuwakomanga magenda.” <verse eid="1SA 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 6:4" />Wantu wakosiya, “Hatumjegeri tambiku gaa ya kuwusiya vidoda?” Womberi wawankula “Vinyagu vyamhanu vya zahabu vyaviwera mfanu gwa malipu, na vinyagu vyamhanu vya zahabu paviwera mfanu gwa mbewa, kila shimu pashilanguziya ukulu wumu wa Wafilisti, toziya tawuni yaitumitwi kwa mwenga ndo irailii yaitumitwi kwa wakulu wenu. <verse eid="1SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 6:5" />Mpaka mtendi vinyagu vyavilifana vya malipu na vinyagu vya wambewa wenu, vintu vyeni vyagamiziya isi yenu. Ndo mpaka mumupi ligoya Mlungu gwa Israeli. Pamonga hakaleki kuwakomanga maweni mwenga na wamlungu wenu na isi yenu. <verse eid="1SA 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 6:6" />Ntambu gaa muwera mwana mtiti handa Wamisri na Farao? Hashi, Mlungu pakamaliliti kuwakomanga nentu Wamisri, wawaleka ndiri Waisraeli wawuki, na womberi wawuka? <verse eid="1SA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 6:7" />Su, mtandi mbutuka ya kukwegwa yasyayi na ng'ombi wawili yawakamwa weni hawenitawalirwi shimpingampinga; muwatawi mumbutuka ya kukwega na ng'ombi kumbiti wana wa ng'ombi wawu nawagenda pamuhera na womberi, ila wasigali mulizizi. <verse eid="1SA 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 6:8" />Mlitoli Lisandiku lya Mtuwa Mlungu na kulitula mumbutuka ayi. Kumbeku ya Lisandiku mtuli vilaa vinyagu vya zahabu yeni mmujegeri handa tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda vyenu. Shakapanu mlileki ligendi kwalifira kugenda. <verse eid="1SA 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 6:9" />Su myiloli, handa mbutuka ayi igenda longulongu kugenda isi yakuyi kumji gwa Beti Shemeshi, su, hatuvimani kuwera yakatujegeriti tawuni ayi ndo Mlungu gwa Israeli. Kumbiti handa ligenda ndiri aku, su, hatuvimani kuwera liwoku lyakuyi ndiri lyalitukomiti ila madoda aga galawira hera.” <verse eid="1SA 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 6:10" />Watenditi ntambu yawagambiritwi wawatoli ng'ombi wawili yawakamitwi na kuwatawa mumbutuka na wana wa ng'ombi wawatawi mulizizi. <verse eid="1SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 6:11" />Lisandiku lilii lya Mtuwa Mlungu walitula mumbutuka ilii pamuhera na majamanda gana vinyagu vya wambewa na virii vya malipu. <verse eid="1SA 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 6:12" />Wang'ombi wagenditi magenda kugenda mji gwa Beti Shemeshi pota kugenda kumshigi ama kumliwu na waweriti wankubota pawaweriti wankugenda. Wafalumi walii mhanu wa Wafilisti wawafatiti mpaka mumbaka mwa Beti Shemeshi. <verse eid="1SA 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 6:13" />Wantu wa Beti Shemeshi waweriti wankubenanga nganu kululalanda. Pawaloliti pampindi na kuliwona Lisandiku lya Mtuwa Mlungu, wanemelera nentu. <verse eid="1SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 6:14" />Mbutuka ayi igenditi kulilambu lya Yoshuwa, mwenikaya gwa Beti Shemeshi. Palisokiti aku ligoloka pakwegera na libuwi likulu. Wantu wabomolanga mbutuka ilii, mbawu zakuyi watendera kuwalunguziya wamg'ombi awa wawalaviyiti handa tambiku ya kulunguziya kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 6:15" />Pamberi pa aga Walawi waweriti wasulusiya Lisandiku lya Mtuwa Mlungu na lijamanda lilii lyana vinyagu vya zahabu na kuvitula kulibuwi lilii likulu. Su, lishaka ali wantu wa Beti Shemeshi walaviyiti tambiku za kulunguziya, na kumlavilira tambiku zimonga Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1SA 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 6:16" />Wakulu wamhanu walii wa Wafilisti pawawoniti aga, wawuyiti Ekroni, lishaka liraali. <verse eid="1SA 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 6:17" />Wafilisti wavijegiti vinyagu mhanu vya zahabu na vya malipu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu viwera tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda vyawu, shinyagu shimu kwa mji agu gwa Ashidodi na Gaza, na Ashikeloni, na Gati na gwa Ekroni. <verse eid="1SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 6:18" />Wajegiti viraa vinyagu vyamhanu vya zahabu vya wambewa kulinganira na walanga ya miji yoseri ya Wafilisti yaikolitwimlima na wakulu wa Wafilisti. Miji ayi iweriti yana maboma na vijiji vyavizyengetitwi ndiri shibambaza. Libuwi likulu lilii kulilambu lya Yoshuwa gwa Beti Shemeshi, pahala peni pawalijegiti Lisandiku lya Mtuwa Mlungu, ndo ukapitawu wa lilawiru ali mpaka leru. <verse eid="1SA 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 6:19" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawalagiti wenikaya sabini wa mji gwa Beti Shemeshi, toziya waloliti mngati mwa Lisandiku Lipatanu lyakuyi. Wantu wadayiti toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti kawalaga wavuwa muwamu mwawu.<verse eid="1SA 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lisandiku lya lipatanu lya Kiriati Yearimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 6:20" />Shakapanu, mwenikaya gwa mji gwa Beti Shemeshi walonga. “Gaa yakaweza kugoloka kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, ayu Mlungu mnanagala? Hakagendi kwa gaa su kawuki kwa twenga?” <verse eid="1SA 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 6:21" />Watumiti walagilagi kugenda kwa wenikaya wa mji gwa Kiriati Yearimu, Walongi. “Wafilisti wawuziya Lisandiku lya Mtuwa Mlungu, mwizi mlitoli.”<verse eid="1SA 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1SA 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 7:1" />Shakapanu, wantu wa Kiriati Yearimu wagenda na kulitola Lisandiku lya Mtuwa Mlungu, walijega ukaya kwa Abinadabu, yakalikaliti kumigongu. Wamlumika mwana gwakuyi mpalu yawamshemiti Eleazari su kaliloleri Lisandiku ali.<verse eid="1SA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samueli kankukolamlima Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 7:2" />Kwanjira Lisandiku lya Mtuwa Mlungu lijegwi kumjini Kiriati Yearimu shaka shitali shipititi, handa mivinja ishilini hangu. Shaka ashi Waisraeli woseri wamliliriti Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1SA 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 7:3" />Samueli kawagambira Waisraeli, “Handa mwankumuwuyira Mtuwa Mlungu kwa moyu gwenu goseri, ndo mpaka muwusiyi pakati penu wamlungu wa shihenga na vinyagu vya Ashitaroti mmugenderi Mtuwa Mlungu kwa moyu goseri, na kumtendera yomberi gweka yakuyi na yomberi hakawalopoli kulawa muukolamlima na Wafilisti, wamtenderi Mtuwa Mlungu gweka yakuyi.” <verse eid="1SA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 7:4" />Hangu, Waisraeli wasira kutali vinyagu vya Mabaali na Maashitaroti, wamtendera Mtuwa Mlungu gweka yakuyi. <verse eid="1SA 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 7:5" />Samueli kalonga, “Guwajojoniri Waisraeli woseri aku Mizipa, niwaluwiri kwa Mtuwa Mlungu.” <verse eid="1SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 7:6" />Hangu, Waisraeli woseri wajojonika aku Mizipa. Wadidibula mashi na kugamiminira Kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu handa tambika, woya kuliya lishaka lilii lyoseri na kulonga, “Tutenda Vidoda kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu.” Samueli kaweriti mtoza gwa Waisraeli aku Mizipa. <verse eid="1SA 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 7:7" />Shaka Wafilisti pawapikiniriti kuwera Waisraeli wajojonika aku Mizipa, wakulu wamhanu wa Wafilisti wagenda kuwakomanga. Waisraeli pawapikiniriti mlandu agu wawatiriti Wafilisti. <verse eid="1SA 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 7:8" />Su, wamgambira Samueli, “Naguleka kumlilira Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwetu, kwajili ya twenga. Su katulopuziyi kulawa kwa Wafilisti.” <verse eid="1SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 7:9" />Hangu Samueli katoliti mwana kondolu yakonka kamlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu tambiku ya kuluguziwa nakamu. Shakapanu Samueli kamlilira Mtuwa Mlungu kwajili ya Israeli, na yomberi kankula kuluwa kwawu. <verse eid="1SA 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 7:10" />Samueli Pakaweriti kankulaviya tambiku ilii ya kulunguziya, Wafilisti wasegeleriti kuwakomanga Waisraeli. Kumbiti lishaka ali Mtuwa Mlungu kalaviya liziwu likulu lya kulindimira kwa Wafilisti na kuwavuluvusiya na kuwapalasiya Wafilisti, na womberi wawingwa kulongolu kwa Waisraeli. <verse eid="1SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 7:11" />Waisraeli walawiti Mizipa na kuwafata Wafilisti mpaka pakwegera na mji gwa Beti Kari, wawalaga. <verse eid="1SA 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 7:12" />Shakapanu, Samueli katoliti libuwi na kuligolisiya pakati pa mizipa na Sheni, kalishema libuwi lilii Ebenezeri ina mana, “Mtuwa Mlungu katutanga mpaka vinu.” <verse eid="1SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 7:13" />Lishaka ali Wafilisti wasinditi na Mtuwa Mlungu kawalewelera Wafilisti kuyikangala isi ya Israeli shaka shoseri Samueli pakaweriti mkomu. <verse eid="1SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 7:14" />Miji yoseri ya Waisraeli yeni Wafilisti wayilopoliti pakati pa Ekroni na Gati iwuziwitwi kwa Waisraeli, na womberi wayikombola isi yawu kulawa kwa Wafilisti. Viraa kuweriti na ponga pakati pa Waisraeli na Waamori. <verse eid="1SA 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 7:15" />Samueli kendereyiti kuwera mkolamlima gwa Israeli mashaka gakuyi goseri ga ukomu. <verse eid="1SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 7:16" />Kila shinja Samueli katyangiliti Beteli na Giligali na Mizipa na kuwamulira mirandu yawu Waisraeli mumiji ayi yoseri. <verse eid="1SA 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 7:17" />Shakapanu, kaweriti pakawuya Rama, toziya aku kuweriti ukaya kwakuyi, kawamliriti Waisraeli mirandu yawu aku na kumnyawira Mtuwa Mlungu shitalawanda sha kutambikira.<verse eid="1SA 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1SA 8" />
  <para style="s">Wantu waluwa waweri na Mfalumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 8:1" />Samueli pakaweriti mzewi, kawatenditi wana wakuyi wapalu kuwera wakolamlima wa Israeli. <verse eid="1SA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 8:2" />Mwana gwakuyi gwa kwanja mpalu kashemitwi Yoeli, na gwa pili yawamshemiti Abiya. Woseri wawili waweriti wakolamlima aku Beeri Sheba. <verse eid="1SA 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 8:3" />Kumbiti wana awa wafata ndiri mugenderu gwa tati gwawu. Su wanjiti kulisakulira mota. Wajega swinda na kukolamlima ntambu yayifiruwa ndiri. <verse eid="1SA 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 8:4" />Su, wakolamlima woseri wa Israeli wajojonikiti pamuhera, na kumgendera Samueli kumjini Rama, <verse eid="1SA 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 8:5" />wamgambira Guloli, gwenga vinu ndo mzewi na wana waku wafata ndiri mgenderanu gwaku, “Hangu, gutusyaguliri mfalumi gwa kutukolamlima ntambu yagawera maisi gamonga.” <verse eid="1SA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 8:6" />“Kumbiti shitwatira sha Waisraeli kufira wapananwi mfalumi gwa kuwakolamlima, limfiliziya ndiri Samueli. Na yomberi kamluwa Mtuwa Mlungu.” <verse eid="1SA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 8:7" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira, “Gupikinili kila shintu wantu shawakugambira, toziya haweni kulemi gwenga, su wanema neni kuwera mfalumi. <verse eid="1SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 8:8" />Kwanjira panuwalaviyiti misri, wandeka neni, wawera wankuwatendera wamlungu wamonga mpaka leru. Vinu matendu gawantendiriti neni ndo gawakutendera na gwenga. <verse eid="1SA 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 8:9" />Su, guwapikiniri, kumbiti guwaberiziyi na guwagambiri pota kufifa mirandu yeni mfalumi yakakolamlima hakagafiri kulawa kwa mwenga.” <verse eid="1SA 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 8:10" />Hangu, Samueli kawagambira wantu walii yawaweriti waluwa wapananwi mfalumi visoweru vyoseri vya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1SA 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 8:11" />Samueli kawagambira, “Hangu ndo mfalumi gwenu ntambu hakawatenderi. Wana wenu wapalu hakawatendi waendeshi mbutuka zakuyi zyakwegwa farasi, na wamonga kuwera wakwena farasi wakuyi na wamonga watuga mbiru kulongolu kwa mbutuka zakuyi azi toziya ya kumlolera. <verse eid="1SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 8:12" />Hakalisyaguliri wamonga waweri wakulu wa vipinga vya mashonta vyakuyi maelufu na wamonga waweri wakulu wa vipinga vya wantu hamsinihamsini. Hakawatendi wamonga wamlimili lirambu lyakuyi na kubenga viboga vyakuyi. Akawatendi wamonga viraa wamnyawiri vintu vya kulikomangira nkondu, na wamonga wamnyawiri vipuli vya mbutuka yakuyi. <verse eid="1SA 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 8:13" />Wahinga wenu hakawatoli kuwera wanyawa utuli, wamonga watereka na wamonga wabanika mabumunda. <verse eid="1SA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 8:14" />Hakatoli malambu genu maherepa ga viboga na malambu gaherepa ga mizeyituni na malambu gaherepa ga mizabibu na kuwapanana wantumintumi wakuyi. <verse eid="1SA 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 8:15" />Hakatoli kila lifingu limu pakati pa mafungu lilongu ga viboga vyenu na vya zabibu zyenu na kuwapanana wakulu wakuyi na wantumintumi wakuyi. <verse eid="1SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 8:16" />Hakatoli wantumintumi wenu wapalu na wadala na ng'ombi wenu waherepa na punda wenu waherepa na kuwatenda wamtenderi mahengu gakuyi. <verse eid="1SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 8:17" />Hakatoli lifungu limu lya mafungu lilongu lya kondolu na mbuzi. Na maweni mwenga hamuweri wamanda wakuyi. <verse eid="1SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 8:18" />Shaka ashi, mwenga hamliri toziya ya ntabiku yamupata kulawa kwa mfalumi gwenu mweni mlisyagulira maweni mwenga. Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu hapeni kawankuli.” <verse eid="1SA 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 8:19" />Ata hangu wantu walemiti kumpikinira Samueli, walonga, “Ndala! Twenga tufira mfalumi gwetu, <verse eid="1SA 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 8:20" />su na twenga viraa tuweri handa maisi gamonga. Mfalumi gwetu, hakatutozi, hakatulongoziyi na kutukomangira nkondu zyetu.” <verse eid="1SA 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 8:21" />Samueli pakamaliliti kuwapikinira kila shintu shawatakuliti, kagenda na kumgambira Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1SA 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 8:22" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira Samueli, “Guwapikiniri na guwasyaguliri mfalumi.” Shakapanu Samueli kawagambira Waisraeli wawuyi ukaya, kila muntu kawuya ukaya kwakuyi.<verse eid="1SA 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1SA 9" />
  <para style="s">Sauli kankuliwona na Samueli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 9:1" />Kuweriti na muntu yumu gwa likabila lya benjamini litawu lyakuyi Kishi, mwana gwa Abieli mzukulu gwa Zero, mwana gwa Bekorati na mwana gwa Afya, muntu mgangamala na kana makakala. <verse eid="1SA 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 9:2" />Shakapanu kaweriti na mwana mpalu yawamshemiti Sauli kaweriti mndemba kaherepa, na kwahera muntu muisraeli yakalinganiti na Sauli kwa kuherepa. Sauli kaweriti mtali nentu kuliku muntu muisi ya Israeli, wantu woseri wamshinkuliti mumawega. <verse eid="1SA 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 9:3" />Lishaka limu, punda gwa Kishi, tati gwakuyi Sauli, wagamiliti. Hangu Kishi kamgambira Sauli, “Gumtoli yumu gwa wantumintumi, gugendi kusakula punda.” <verse eid="1SA 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 9:4" />Wawasakula kumigongu ya Efraimu na enewu lya Shalisha, kumbiti wawawona ndiri aku. Kayi wasoka Shalimu, na aku wawawona ndiri. Wawasakula muisi ya Benjamini, ata hangu wawapata ndiri. <verse eid="1SA 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 9:5" />Wasokiti muisi ya Sufu, Sauli kamgambiriti ntumintumi gwakuyi, “Tuwuyi ukaya, hera hangu tati gwangu hapenikaleki kuholera punda, na badala yakuyi hakaweri na lyoga na twenga.” <verse eid="1SA 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 9:6" />Ntumintumi Ulii kamgambira, “Guheperi shididini, mji agu kwana muntu gwa Mlungu mweni wampanana nentu ligoya, kila shintu shakatakula shiwera nakaka. Vinu tumgenderi, pamonga kaweza kutugambira mwanja gwetu ntambu yagufira kuwera.” <verse eid="1SA 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 9:7" />Sauli kamkosiya, “Kumbiti patumgendera, hatumpanani shishi? Guloli, shiboga mumihaku yetu ipera na kwahera shoseri sha kumpanana ayu muntu gwa Mlungu. Twana Shishi?” <verse eid="1SA 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 9:8" />Ntumintumi ulii kamwankula Sauli, “Guloli, neni nana shipandi shididini sha madini ga feza. Hanimpanani muntu ayu gwa Mlungu su katugambili kuusu mwanja gwetu.” <verse eid="1SA 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 9:9" />Pa kwanja Muisraeli handa muntu pakafira kumluwa Mlungu shisoweru, kalongiti, “Yina, gwizi, tugendi kwa mlola. Toziya muntu yakashemwa mbuyi mashaka aga gapititi wamshemiti mlola.” <verse eid="1SA 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 9:10" />Sauli kamwankula, “Ashi ndo shitwatira shiheri, yina, tugendi.” Hangu, wagenda kumji yakaweriti kalikala muntu ulii gwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1SA 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 9:11" />Pawaweriti wankukwena lugongu kugenda kumji, waliwona na wahinga yawaweriti wankugenda kudidibula mashi. Wawakosiyiti wahinga awa, “Hashi, mlola kakumjini?” <verse eid="1SA 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 9:12" />Wahinga walii wawankula, “Yina, kakulaaku. Kayi kakulongolu kwenu, pamtenda kalongola hamumuwoni. Kingira hera kumjini leru, toziya leru wantu hawalaviyi litambiku pahala poseri. <verse eid="1SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 9:13" />Katepu pamwingira kumjini, hamumuwoni hakenigendi pahala pa kutambikira su kaliyi. Toziya wantu hapeni walii mpaka uti yomberi katekeleri tambiku. Shakapanu walii yawashemiritwi waliii. Hangu mgendi kalongola, hamliwoni na yomberi.” <verse eid="1SA 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 9:14" />Hangu Sauli na ntumintumi gwakuyi wagenditi kumjini. Pawaweriti wakwingira kumjini, wamwoniti Samueli pakalawa kumjini, na kankugenda pahala patambikira.<verse eid="1SA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 9:15" />Lishaka pamberi pa lishaka ali, pamberi Sauli hakenisoki kumjini, Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti kamgambira hangu Samueli. <verse eid="1SA 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 9:16" />“Shirawu, shaka handa ashi, hanikujegeri muntu kulawa isi ya likabila lya Benjamini, na gwenga hagumtyeremeki lipaki kuwera mkolamlima gwa wantu waneni Israeli. Yomberi hakawalopoli wantu wa neni kulawa kwa Wafilisti, toziya nikuwona kutabika kwa wantu wa neni na mpikinira kulira kwawu kwa kuluwa utanga.” <verse eid="1SA 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 9:17" />Samueli pakamwoniti Sauli, Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira, “Ayu ndo ulii muntu yanikugambiriti. Yomberi ndo hakawakolimlima wantu wa neni.” <verse eid="1SA 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 9:18" />Panu Sauli kamgendera Samueli yakaweriti pakwegera na ligomi likulu lya mji na kumkosiya, “Nikuluwa gunanguziyi numba ya mlola.” <verse eid="1SA 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 9:19" />Samueli kankula, “Neni ndo namlola. Mlongoleri kugenda pahala pakuguwira toziya leru hamliyi pamuhera na neni. Shirawu mandawira makosiwu goseri gamuweriti naga hanagankuli. <verse eid="1SA 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 9:20" />Na punda waku walii yawagamiliti mashaka matatu yagapititi, na muwera na lyoga kwajili yawu, wawoneka kala. Kumbiti ndo ga ulii mweni Waisraeli wamfira nentu? Hashi, ndo gwenga nawalongu woseri wa tati gwaku?” <verse eid="1SA 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 9:21" />Sauli kankula, “Neni ndo gwa likabila lya Benjamini, likabila lididika kuliku makabila goseri ga Israeli. Na makabila goseri ga Benjamini kaya yangu ndo ndidika nakamu. Tambu gaa gung'ambira hangu?” <verse eid="1SA 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 9:22" />Shakapanu Samueli kamjega Sauli na ntumintumi gwakuyi pamdamu mkulu, kawapanana pahala pa ligoya, kweni wahenga yawashemiluwitwi waweriti walikala. Kuweriti na wahenga selasini. <verse eid="1SA 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 9:23" />Samueli kamgambira mtereka, “Gujegi seemu ilii yanakupananiti, nikugambiriti guyituli kumbwega.” <verse eid="1SA 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 9:24" />Mtereka ulii kagenda kajega liwondu na seemu ya kumbeli yayiweriti uwega wa kumpindi wa liwondu ali na kuvitula kulongolu kwa Sauli. Samueli ndo kamgambira Sauli, “Guloli shilii shagutuliwitwi, vinu shituluwa kulongolu kwaku. Vinu gulii toziya shituluwa kwajili ya gwenga su gupati kuliya pamuhera na wahenga.” <verse eid="1SA 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 9:25" />Pawawuyiti kumjini kulawa pahala pampindi pakuguwira, Sauli katandikilitwi pahala pa kugonja kumpindi, kagonja aku.<verse eid="1SA 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samueli kankumlumika Sauli kuwera mfalumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 9:26" />Mandawira putiputi, Samueli kamshema Sauli kulawa kulitala. “Gwimuki, su nikupeleki guwuyi ukaya.” Sauli kimukiti na woseri wawili, yomberi na Samueli, kawuka na kugenda kunjira. <verse eid="1SA 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 9:27" />Pawasokiti upeleru wa mji, Samueli kamgambira Sauli, “Gumgambiri ntumintumi gwa kalongoleri.” Ntumintumi pakawukiti kala, Samueli kendereya kulonga, “Guheperi shididini na neni hanikugambiri galii gakalongiti Mlungu.”<verse eid="1SA 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1SA 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 10:1" />Samueli ndo katola supa ndidika ya lipaki lya mizeyituni kamwitira Sauli kumtuyi, kamkisikira na kumgambira, “Mtuwa Mlungu kakulekera lipaki guweri mkolamlima gwa wantu wakuyi. <verse eid="1SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 10:2" />Leru patulekana, haguliwoni na wantu wawili pakwegera na lisembi lya Raheli aku Selisa muisi ya Benjamini. Awa hawakugambili kuwera punda walii yaguweriti guwasakula wawoneka kala. Tati gwaku kaleka kulihola punda, ila kana lyoga kwa gwenga, pakalikosiya kila mala, hantendi hashi kwa mwana gwangu? <verse eid="1SA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 10:3" />Kulawa panu hagugendi mpaka kumtera mkulu aku Tabori, pahala peni haguliwoni na wapalu watatu munjira kugenda kumlavilira Mlungu tambiku aku Beteli, gwa kwanja gwawu kana wanambuzi watatu na gwa pili hakaweri katola mabumunda matatu na gwa tatu hakaweri kajega shiwiga sha likuli sha divayi. <verse eid="1SA 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 10:4" />Hawakulamsiyi na kukupanana mabumunda mawili, na gwenga hagwanki. <verse eid="1SA 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 10:5" />Shakapanu, pagusoka pahala pakulavilira tambiku Gibea ya Mlungu, pahala pana ng'onjeru ya wamashonta wa Wafilisti panu, paguwera gwapakwegera na mji, haguliwoni na shipinga sha wambuyi wa Mlungu. Wambuyi wa Mlungu awa walawa pahala pakuguwira agawu pawagomba vinubi na ng'oma ndidika na filimbi na zezi na hawaweri wankutunga. <verse eid="1SA 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 10:6" />Rohu gwa Mtuwa Mlungu hayikwizili kwa likakala, na gwenga hagwanji kutunga pamuhera na womberi na kugalambuka kuwera muntu gwingi. <verse eid="1SA 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 10:7" />Shaka mirandu ayi payilawira, shoseri shaguweza kutenda gushitendi, toziya Mlungu kapamuhera na gwenga. <verse eid="1SA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 10:8" />Hagunongoleri kugenda kumjini Giligali, pahala peni hanikuwoni na kulaviya tambiku ya kulunguziwa na tambiku za ponga. Haguheperi panu kwa shaka sha mashaka saba mpaka nizi na kukulanguziya sha kutenda.” <verse eid="1SA 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 10:9" />Sauli pakagalambukiti su kumleka Samueli, Mlungu kagalambula moyu gwa Sauli. Na goseri galii gakagambilitwi na Samueli galawiliti lishaka ali. <verse eid="1SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 10:10" />Sauli na ntumintumi gwakuyi pawasokiti aku Gibea, kankitwi na shipinga sha wambuyi wa Mlungu. Rohu gwa Mlungu imwiziliti kwa likakala, na Sauli kanja kutunga pamuhera na wambuyi wa Mlungu awa. <verse eid="1SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 10:11" />Wantu yawamjimiliti Sauli pakwanja, pawamwoniti kankutunga, walikosiyana, “Shintu gaa shimkola mwana gwa Kishi? Hashi, ata Sauli ndo yumu gwa wambuyi wa Mlungu?” <verse eid="1SA 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 10:12" />Muntu tunga, mweni kaya gwa pahala panu, kalonga, “Hashi, tati gwawu ndo gaa?” Hangu kulawira mtakulu, “Hashi, ata Sauli ndo yumu gwa wambuyi gwa Mlungu?” <verse eid="1SA 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 10:13" />Sauli pakamaliliti kutunga, kagenditi pahala pa kutambikira. <verse eid="1SA 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 10:14" />Tati mpusu gwa Sauli pakawawoniti Sauli na ntumintumi, kawakosiya, “Muweriti koshi?” Sauli kamuwankula, “Tugenditi kuwasakula punda na patuwoniti wawoneka ndiri tugenditi kumlola Samueli” <verse eid="1SA 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 10:15" />Tati mpusu uli gwa Sauli kamgambira, “Shondi, gung'ambili shilii shakakugambiriti Samueli.” <verse eid="1SA 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 10:16" />Sauli kankula, “Katugambiriti pota kufifa kuwera punda wawoneka.” Kumbiti Sauli kamgambira ndiri tati gwakuyi mpusu handa Samueli kamgambiriti kuwera mekaweri mfalumi.<verse eid="1SA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli kabweruwa kuwera mfalumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 10:17" />Samueli kawashemiti wantu woseri wajojoniki kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu aku Mizipa. <verse eid="1SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 10:18" />Pawasokiti kawagambira, “Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, kalonga hangu, niwalaviyiti Waisraeli muisi ya Misri, niwalopuziya mwenga kulawa kwa Wamisri na falumi zyamonga zyaziwayoniriti. <verse eid="1SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 10:19" />Kumbiti leru ayi mnema neni Mlungu gwenu yaniwalopoliti kulawa muntabika na kwinginika kwenu na mwenga mlonga, ndala, gututuliri mfalumi kwa twenga. Vinu, su, mlitakasiyi mawoseli kulongolu kwa neni pamuhera mumakabila genu na kwa maelufi genu.” <verse eid="1SA 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 10:20" />Shakapanu Samueli kagajega pakwegera makabila goseri ga Israeli, likabila lya Benjamini lisagulwa kwa kugalambula simbi. <verse eid="1SA 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 10:21" />Kalijega kulongolu likabila lya Benjamini, kulinganira na nkolu zawu na lukolu lwa Matiri lusyaguluwa kwa kugalambula simbi. Upeleru wakuyi kalujega kulongolu lukolu lwa Matiri, na Sauli mwana gwa Kishi kasyagulwa kwa kugalambula simbi. Kumbiti pawamsakuliti wamwona ndiri. <verse eid="1SA 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 10:22" />Wamkosiya kayi Mtuwa Mlungu, “Hashi, muntu ayu kiza kala panu?” Mtuwa Mlungu kankula Sauli, “Kalififa kuvisanka.” <verse eid="1SA 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 10:23" />Su, wagenditi mbiru, wamsakula Sauli na kumjega. Sauli pakagolokiti muwamu mwa wantu kaweriti mtali kuliku wantu woseri, kwanjira mumawega. <verse eid="1SA 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 10:24" />Samueli kawagambira wantu woseri, “Ayu ndo muntu yakasyagulitwi na Mtuwa Mlungu muwantu woseri, kwahera yoseri yakawera handa yomberi.” Wantu woseri washowangana. “Mfalumi Kalikali mashaka goseri” <verse eid="1SA 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 10:25" />Shakapanu Samueli kawagambiriti wantu kuusu mahengu ga ufalumi, kagalemba mushitabu na kashituliti kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. Shakapanu, Samueli kawagambiriti wantu woseri galii gakafiruwa kupata, kila muntu kagendi ukaya kwakuyi. <verse eid="1SA 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 10:26" />Viraa, Sauli pamuhera na wantu wana makakala weni Mlungu kashinkuliti miyoyu yawu, wagenditi pamuhera na yomberi ukaya kwakuyi aku Gibea. <verse eid="1SA 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 10:27" />Kumbiti wantu wamonga yawafaa ndiri shintu, walongiti, “Hashi, muntu ayu kaweza kutulopola?” Wampanana ndiri ligoya Sauli na wampananiti ndiri lifupu lyoseri. Kumbiti yomberi keniti ndiri maya.<verse eid="1SA 10:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1SA 11" />
  <para style="s">Sauli kankuwakanka Waamoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 11:1" />Pa mwezi gumu kupita mfalumi Nahashi gwa Amoni kagenditi na mashonta wakuyi, na kuguzyengeta mji gwa Yabeshi Gileadi. Wenikaya wa mji gwa Yabeshi Gileadi wamgambira Nahashi, “Gutendi lipatanu na twenga, na twenga hatukutenderi.” <verse eid="1SA 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 11:2" />Kumbiti kawagambira, “Hantendi majimiranu na mwenga handa pamjimira. Handa hanimwipi kila yumu gwenu lisu lyakuyi lya kumliwu, hangu haniwasoniziyi Waisraeli woseri kulongolu kwa maisi gamonga.” <verse eid="1SA 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 11:3" />Wakulu wa Yabeshi wamgambira, “Gutupanani shipindi sha mashaka saba su tuwatumi walagilagi muisi yoseri ya Israeli. Handa kwahera muntu yoseri gwa kutulopola, hatulilaviyi twaweni kwa gwenga.” <verse eid="1SA 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 11:4" />Shaka walagilagi walii pawasoki kumjini Gibea, kwakalikaliti Sauli, watakula visoweru avi na wantu woseri wanja kulira kwa kubotanga.<verse eid="1SA 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 11:5" />Vinu, Sauli kaweriti kankulawa kulilambu pakawera na ng'ombi wakuyi, kakosiya, “Wantu wana shishi? Toziya gaa walira?” Wamgambira visoweru vyawajegiti walagilagi kulawa Yabeshi. <verse eid="1SA 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 11:6" />Mala, Sauli pakapikiniriti visoweru avi, Rohu ya Mlungu imwizira kwa likakala na yomberi kakalala nentu. <verse eid="1SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 11:7" />Katola wang'ombi washipalu wawili kawahanjangahanjanga vipandivipandi, kawalagalira walagilagi wavipitiziyi kila pahala muisi ya Israeli pawalonga, “Muntu yoseri yakalema kumfata Sauli na Samueli munkondu, wang'ombi wa shipalu wakuyi hawatendwi hangu.” Lyoga liwingira Wasraeli toziya ya Mtuwa Mlungu mekawezi kutenda. Hangu woseri walawiti kwa pamuhera. <verse eid="1SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 11:8" />Sauli pakawajojoniriti Waisraeli aku Bezeki kaweriti na wantu laki tatu kulawa Israeli na elufu selasini kulawa Yuda. <verse eid="1SA 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 11:9" />“Wawagambira walagilagi walii yawalawiti kulawa Yabeshi, Muwagambiri hangu wantu wa Yabeshi Gileadi. Shirawu, shaka mshenji paguwera gukalipa, hamuweri mlopuluwa.” Wantu wa Yabeshi pawapatiti visoweru avi wanemeleliti nentu. <verse eid="1SA 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 11:10" />Hangu, wamjongera Nahashi pawamgambira, “Shirawu hatulilaviyi kwa gwenga na gwenga hagututenderi shoseri shaguwona ndo shiheri.” <verse eid="1SA 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 11:11" />Pashiru palii, Sauli kawabagula wantu muvipinga vitatu. Mandawira putiputi, wingira mungonjeru ya wankondu, na kuwakangala Wamoni. Kusoka paluwala wankondu wavuwa waweriti walikituluwa kutali. Walii yawaponikiti wapalasika vuluvulu, kila muntu katugira kwakuyi.<verse eid="1SA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 11:12" />Waisraeli ndo wamgambira Samueli, “Wa koshi wantu walii yawatakuliti Sauli nakawera mfalumi pampindi petu? Gutujegeri wantu awa, tuwalagi.”<verse eid="1SA 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 11:13" />Kumbiti Sauli kawagambira, “Kwahera muntu yoseri hakawalagi leru, toziya mulishaka ali, Mtuwa Mlungu kayilopuziya Israeli.” <verse eid="1SA 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 11:14" />Samueli kawagambira, “Tugendeni woseri Giligali na tutendi majimiranu ga syayi tumbweri kayi Sauli kuwera mfalumi.” <verse eid="1SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 11:15" />Wantu woseri wagenda Giligali na pawasokiti aku, watenda majimiranu handa Sauli kaweri mfalumi kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. Na Sauli pamuhera na wantu woseri wa Israeli wanemelera Nentu.<verse eid="1SA 11:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1SA 12" />
  <para style="s">Samueli kawagambira kwahere Waisraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 12:1" />Samueli kawagambira Waisraeli woseri, goseri gamng'ambiriti, nigapikinira, “Nimlumika mfalumi kwajili ya mwenga. <verse eid="1SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 12:2" />Vinu, mwanayu mfalumi gwa kuwalonguziya. Neni ndo mzewi nentu na wana wa neni wapalu wa pamuhera na mwenga. Nwera mkolamlima gwenu kwanjira panweriti mntemba mpaka vinu. <verse eid="1SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 12:3" />Na panu na handa ntenda mlandu goseri gulii gudoda, su mlaviyi ukapitawu kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu na kulongolu kwa mfalumi gwakuyi msyagulwa. Hashi, mboka ng'ombi shipalu ama punda gwa muntu yoseri? Hashi, nimpunja muntu yoseri? Hashi, nimyonera muntu yoseri? Hashi, nanga swinda kwa muntu yoseri su kugonyia masu gangu? Na neni hanimuwuziliri shoseri shilii.” <verse eid="1SA 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 12:4" />Wantu wamwankula, “Nakaka kazyanga ndiri, gunyonera ndiri, pota kutola swinda kulawa kwa muntu yoseri.” <verse eid="1SA 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 12:5" />Samueli kankula, “Mtuwa Mlungu ndo kapitawu kwa mwenga, na mfalumi gwakuyi msyagulwa leru ndo kapitawu kuwera mumona nahera likosa.” Womberi wamwankula. “Yomberi ndo ukapitawu.” <verse eid="1SA 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 12:6" />Samueli kawagambira, “Mtuwa Mlungu ndo yakamsyaguliti Musa na Aruni kuwalaviya wambuyi wenu muisi ya Misri. <verse eid="1SA 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 12:7" />Mgoloki palapanu na neni haniwalanguziyi kwa ukapitawu niwaholuziyi mirandu mikulu yakatenda Mtuwa Mlungu na neni Haniwabweleri kuusu matendu gakuyi ga kulikangasha geni kagatenditi su kuwalopola mwenga na wambuyi wenu.<verse eid="1SA 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 12:8" />Yakobu na walongu wakuyi pawagenditi Misri, na Wamisri pawawayoniriti, wambuyi wenu wamliliriti Mtuwa Mlungu na kawalagalira Musa na Aruni weni wawawusiyiti wambuyi wenu muisi ya Misri na kuwatenda mlikali muisi ayi. <verse eid="1SA 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 12:9" />Kumbiti womberi wamwaluwiti Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwawu na yomberi kawatenda wasindi na Sisera, mkulu gwa lishonta lya Hazori na mumawoku mwa Wafilisti na mumawoku mwa mfalumi gwa Mowabu. Maisi aga galikomanga na wambuyi wenu na kuwakanga. <verse eid="1SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 12:10" />Wambuyi wenu wamlilira Mtuwa Mlungu, pawalonga, tutenda vidoda toziya tukuleka gwenga Mtuwa Mlungu, kwa kuwatendera Mabaali na Maashitaroti. Kumbiti vinu gutulopuziyi kulawa mumawoku mwa wankondu wetu na twenga hatukutenderi’. <verse eid="1SA 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 12:11" />Mtuwa Mlungu ndo pakamtumiti Yerubaali na shakapanu kamtuma Bedani, shakapanu Yefuta na upeleru kantuma neni Samueli. Kila yumu gwetu kawalopuziya kulawa kwa wankondu wenu yawawazyengetiti, mwenga mlikala kwa ponga. <verse eid="1SA 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 12:12" />Kumbiti pamumwoniti mfalumi Nahashi gwa Waamoni kiza kuwakomanga, mumulema Mtuwa Mlungu mweni ndo mfalumi gwenu, mng'ambira, ndala! Mfalumi ndo yakafira kutukolamlima. <verse eid="1SA 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 12:13" />Vinu, mfalumi yamlisyaguliriti ndo ayu panu. Mmuluwiti Mtuwa Mlungu kawapanani mfalumi na yomberi kawapanana. <verse eid="1SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 12:14" />Handa pamumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu, na kumtendera, na kupikinira liziwu lyakuyi pota kulema lagiru zakuwi, handa mwenga maweni pamuhera na mfalumi yakawakolamlima pamumfata Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu, su hamuweri na mpatiru. <verse eid="1SA 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 12:15" />Kumbiti handa hapeni mlipikiniri liziwu lya Mtuwa Mlungu, mlema lagiru zakuyi, su yomberi hakalikomangi na mwenga pamuhera na mfalumi gwenu. <verse eid="1SA 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 12:16" />Hangu su, mlikali na kugulola mlandu agu mkulu gweni Mtuwa Mlungu hakatendi kulongolu kwa mwenga. <verse eid="1SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 12:17" />Hashi vinu shaka ndiri sha kubenanga nganu shaka ashi shiweriti shaka sha shiyangazi? Kumbiti neni hanimluwi Mtuwa Mlungu kajegi lupanda na mvula, na mwenga hamuvimani na kuuwona ukondola wenu wamtenditi kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu kwa kulifilira mfalumi, ndo mkulu.”<verse eid="1SA 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 12:18" />Su, Samueli kamluwa Mtuwa Mlungu, na yomberi katuma lupanda na mvula mulishaka ali. Wantu woseri wamtira nentu Mtuwa Mlungu na Samueli. <verse eid="1SA 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 12:19" />Hangu wamgambira Samueli, “Shondi gutuluwiri twenga wantumintumi waku kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwaku, su natulaguwa, toziya tongera vidoda vyetu kwa ukondola awu wa kulifilira twaweni mfalumi.” <verse eid="1SA 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 12:20" />Samueli kawankula, “Namtira, tembera mtenda ukondola awu, namleka kumfata Mtuwa Mlungu, ila mmutenderi kwa moyu gwenu goseri. <verse eid="1SA 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 12:21" />Namfata wamlungu yawafaa ndiri yayiweza ndiri kuwatanga pota kuwalopola. <verse eid="1SA 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 12:22" />Kwa ligoya lya litawu lyaku likulu, Mtuwa Mlungu hapeni kawasi wantu wakuyi toziya kafira kuwatenda mwenga kuwera wantu wakuyi. <verse eid="1SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 12:23" />Nakaka hapeni ndeki kuwaluwira kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, kutenda hangu hayiweri kumtendera vidoda Mtuwa Mlungu. Hanendereyi kuwafunda njira heri na ya kumfiriziya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1SA 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 12:24" />Su, mmuguwili Mtuwa Mlungu na kumtendera kwa waminika kwa moyu gwenu goseri. Mliholi mirandu ilii mikulu yakawatenderiti. <verse eid="1SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 12:25" />Kumbiti handa pamwendereya kutenda makontola, hamwagamiri mwenga maweni pamuhera na mfalumi gwenu.”<verse eid="1SA 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1SA 13" />
  <para style="s">Waisraeli wankulikomanga na Wafilisti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 13:1" />Shakapanu kaweriti na mivinja selasini pakanjiti kukolamlima. Na kakolitimlima Israeli kwa shaka sha mivinja alubaini na mbili <verse eid="1SA 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 13:2" />Sauli kawasyaguliti Waisraeli elufu tatu. Pakati pawu, elufu mbili kaweriti nawa aku Mikimashi muisi ya migongu ya Beteli. Elufu yimu waweriti na Yonatani aku Gibea ya Benjamini. Wantu wamonga woseri yawasigaliti kawawuziyiti, kila muntu ukaya kwakuyi. <verse eid="1SA 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 13:3" />“Yonatani kayikankala ng'onjeru ya mashonta ga Wafilisti aku Gibea, na Wafilisti woseri wapikiniriti visoweru avi. Hangu Sauli kawagambiriti ntumintumi wagombi lipenga muisi yoseri kuwashema Waebraniya.” <verse eid="1SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 13:4" />Waisraeli woseri pawapikiniriti handa Sauli kaweriti kalikomanga liboma lya mashonta lya Wafilisti, na Walifilisti wawakalaliriti nentu Waisraeli, su wantu washemitwi kugenda kuwera pamuhera na Sauli aku Giligali. <verse eid="1SA 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 13:5" />Wafilisti walijojoniriti kugenda kulikomanga na Waisraeli, pawawera na mbutuka za nkondu elufu tatu, mashonta elufu sita yawendesha mbutuka za nkondu na vipinga vya wamashonta wa magulu wavuwa handa mhanga gwa kumpwani, woseri wakweniti pampindi na kunyawa ng'onjeru yawu aku Mikimashi, uwega wagulawa mshenji mwa Beta Aveni. <verse eid="1SA 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 13:6" />Waisraeli pawawoniti wankutabika toziya waweriti wankulikomagwa nentu, wanjiti kulififa. Wamonga walififiti mumpanga, wamonga mumalindi, wamonga pakati mumatalawu, wamonga mumasembi na wamonga mumanegu gahera mashi. <verse eid="1SA 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 13:7" />Wamonga walokiti lushemba Yoridani mpaka muisi ya Gadi na isi ya Gileadi. Kumbiti Sauli kaweriti kankali aku Giligali na wantu woseri wamfatiti agawu pawalendemera. <verse eid="1SA 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 13:8" />Sauli kamheperiti Samueli kwa mashaka saba, handa Samueli ntambu yakalongiti. Kumbiti Samueli kiziti ndiri aku Giligali na wantu wanjiti kumleka Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 13:9" />Su, Sauli kawagambira wantu, “Munjegeri tambiku yenu ya kulunguziwa tolosu na zilii za ponga.” Na yomberi kalaviya tambiku ya kulunguziya tolosu. <verse eid="1SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 13:10" />Katepu pakaweriti kamalira kulaviya tambiku ya kulunguziwa tolosu, Samueli kasokiti. Sauli kagenda kumwanka Samueli na kumlamsiya. <verse eid="1SA 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 13:11" />Samueli kamkosiya, “Gutenda shishi?” Sauli kamwankula, “pamoniti wantu wandeka na gwenga gwiza ndiri, mushaka shagutakuliti gwankwiza na kayi pamoniti Wafilisti walipanga kala kwa nkondu aku Mikimashi, <verse eid="1SA 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 13:12" />nilihola handa Wafilisti hawizi kunkomanga aku Giligali. Kayi weriti nankali haneniluwi utanga wa Mtuwa Mlungu. Ndo mana mwona ndaviyi namweni tambiku ya kulunguziya.” <verse eid="1SA 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 13:13" />Samueli kamwankula Sauli, “Gutenda shinkalimahala. Gujimira ndiri gakakugambiziyiti Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwaku. Handa megujimiri, Mtuwa Mlungu mekautuli mashaka goseri ufalumi waku pampindi pa Israeli. <verse eid="1SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 13:14" />Kumbiti vinu ufalumi waku hapeni ulikali, toziya lagiru lyakakugambiriti Mtuwa Mlungu gujimira ndiri. Mtuwa Mlungu kalisakulira muntu yumonga mweni hakamjimiri kwa moyu gwakuyi goseri na ayu ndo yakamsaguliti kuwera mkolamlima gwa wantu woseri.” <verse eid="1SA 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 13:15" />Samueli kawuka kulawa Giligali na kugenda Gibea muisi ya Benjamini. Na Sauli pakawalangiti wantu wa kaweriti nawa, kawoniti wantu miya sita hera. <verse eid="1SA 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 13:16" />Sauli na mwana gwakuyi Yonatani pamuhera na wantu yawaweriti pamuhera na yomberi, walikaliti aku Gibea muisi ya Benjamini na Wafilisti wagolosiya ng'onjeru aku Mikimashi. <verse eid="1SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 13:17" />Wafilisti wawukiti mungonjeru zawu kugenda kuwakomanga pawawera na vipinga vitatu. Shipinga shimu shiloliti Ofura muisi ya Shuali. <verse eid="1SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 13:18" />Shipinga shimonga shigenditi Beti Horoni na shimonga shigenda mbaka yayigenda lulalanda lwa Seboimu, kugendera kushiwala.<verse eid="1SA 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 13:19" />“Shaka ashi kwaheriti kuwambala vyuma muisi yoseri ya Israeli, toziya Wafilisti wafiriti kuwalewalera Waebulaniya na walitendera magumba ama misali.” <verse eid="1SA 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 13:20" />Kila Muisraeli kafiliziwiti kuwagendera Wafilisti kukuwa magembi ga kulimira kwa ng'ombi ama sululu ama liwagu ama hengu. <verse eid="1SA 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 13:21" />Waisraeli waweriti walipa vipandi viwili kwa kukuwira magembi ga kulimira kwa ng'ombi na shipandi shimu sha madini ga feza kwa kukuwira plawu na sululu. Na beyi ya kukuwa liwagu ama msomeru iweriti shipandi shimu sha shekeli <verse eid="1SA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 13:22" />Hangu lishaka lya nkondu kwahera muntu muwamu mwawu yakaweriti pamuhera Sauli na Yonatani yakaweriti na ligumba ama mgoha ira hera Sauli na Yonatani mwana gwakuyi. <verse eid="1SA 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 13:23" />Wafilisti waperekiti shipinga sha mashonta kugenda kulolera shibokera sha Mikimashi.<verse eid="1SA 13:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1SA 14" />
  <para style="s">Ugangamala wa Yonatani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 14:1" />Lishaka limu, Yonatani mwana gwa mfalumi Sauli kamgambiriti mntemba yakajegiti vintu vya kulikomangira, “Gwizi, tugendi kumwambu kuliboma lya Wafilisti”. Kumbiti Yonatani kamgambira ndiri tati gwakuyi <verse eid="1SA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 14:2" />Sauli, kaweriti kanyawa malingu pasi pa mkomamanga aku Migironi, kunja kwa mji gwa Gibea, pakawera na wantu miya sita. <verse eid="1SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 14:3" />Ahiya mwana gwa Ahitubu mlongu gwakuyi Ikabodi mwana gwa Finehasi, Ahiya mzukulu gwa Eli, mtambika gwa Mtuwa Mlungu kumjini Shilu, kaweriti ndo yakavaliti nguwu yagibikira pashifuwa sha mtambika. Wantu wavimaniti ndiri handa Yonatani kawukiti kala.<verse eid="1SA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 14:4" />Pahala pashibokeri Yonatani kapitiri su kasoki kuliboma lwa Wafilisti, kuweriti na matalawu mawili yagasongokiti, uwega awu na uwega umonga. Litalawu limu lishemitwi Bosesi na limonga lishemitwi Sene. <verse eid="1SA 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 14:5" />Litalawu limu liweriti kushana mwa mji gwa Mikimashi na limonga liweriti kusika pakwegera na mji gwa Gibea.<verse eid="1SA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 14:6" />Yonatani kamgambira mntemba ulii yakamjegeriti vintu vya kulikomangira, “Gwizi, tugendi uwega wa pili kuliboma lya wantu awa yawingiziwa ndiri jandu. Pamonga Mtuwa Mlungu hakatutangi, toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kalopuziya ndiri kwa kutumbira wantu wavuwa ama wadidini.” <verse eid="1SA 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 14:7" />Mtemba ulii yakajegiti vintu vya kulikomangira, Kamgambira, “Gutendi shoseri shagufira kutenda. Neni na pamuhera na gwenga toziya liholu lyaku ndo liholu lyangu.” <verse eid="1SA 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 14:8" />Yonatani kawagambira, “Hatuloki kuwagendera wantu walii su wawezi kutulola. <verse eid="1SA 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 14:9" />Handa pawatugambira tuwahepi, panu patuweriti, su hatugoloki palaa panu pota kuwagendera. <verse eid="1SA 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 14:10" />Kumbiti pawalonga tuwagenderi su hatuwagendeli toziya ali ndo lilangaliru kuwera Mtuwa Mlungu katutenda tuwakangi.” <verse eid="1SA 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 14:11" />Su, walilangaziya kwa Wafilisti. Shakapanu Wafilisti walonga, “Mloli Waeburaniya walii wankulawa kumalindi kwawaweriti walififa.” <verse eid="1SA 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 14:12" />Wafilisti yawaweriti kuliboma wamshema Yonatani na mntemba yakajegiti vintu vya kulikomangira, “Mwizi, na twenga hatuwalangaziyi shintu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:12">Yonatani kamgambira mntemba yakamjegiriti vintu vya kulikomangira, “Gumfati, Mtuwa Mlungu katutenda tuwakangi.” <verse eid="1SA 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 14:13" />Su,Yonatani kakwena kwa magulu na mawoku na mntemba uliya kamfata.Yonatani kawakomanga Wafilisti pakawagusiya pasi agawu mntemba ulii kafata kumbeli pakawalaga. <verse eid="1SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 14:14" />Mu makomangu aga ga kwanja Yonatani pakawera na mntemba gwakuyi yakampapiriti vintu vya kulikomangira, kawalagiti wantu handa ishilini mushipandi sha nusu heka. <verse eid="1SA 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 14:15" />Muisi yoseri ya Wafilisti, wantu woseri wanja kushashatika, wamashonta kungonjeru, wantu yawawera mumalambu, yawawera kuliboma na wakomanga walendemeriti, isi ilendemeriti na kuweriti na lyonga likulu.<verse eid="1SA 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusinda kwa Wafilisti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 14:16" />Walolalola wa Sauli aku Gibea muisi ya Benjamini, wawawoniti wantu watangala pawatuga aku na aku. <verse eid="1SA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 14:17" />Sauli kawagambira wantu yakaweriti nawa, “Muliwalangi su tuvimani wagaa watupota.” Pawawalangiti, wavimaniti handa Yonatani na mntemba yakampapiriti vintu vya kulikomangira kwahera. <verse eid="1SA 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 14:18" />Sauli kamgambira mtambika Ahiya, “Gulijegi panu Lisandiku lya Mlungu.” Shaka ashi Lisandiku lya Lipatanu lya Mlungu liweriti pamuhera na Waisraeli. <verse eid="1SA 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 14:19" />Sauli pakaweriti kankali kuyowera na mtambika, mumahengu ga Wafilisti ndewu zongereka nentu. Hangu Sauli kamgambira mtambika, “Guleki nagulijega kayi Lisandiku lya Lipatanu.” <verse eid="1SA 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 14:20" />Hangu, Sauli na wantu wakuyi walipanga na kwingira mumakomangu na Wafilisti. Kumbiti Wafilisti wanjiti kulikomanga weni kwa weni kwa ndewu nkulu. <verse eid="1SA 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 14:21" />Waebulaniya yawaweriti kwa Wafilisti, na yawagenditi nawa mumalingu, wagalambuka na kuwera pamuhera na Waisraeli yawaweriti na Sauli na Yonatani. <verse eid="1SA 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 14:22" />Ata Waisraeli wamonga yawaweriti walififa mu isi ya migongu ya Efraimu, pawapikiniriti handa Wafilisti waweriti wankutuga na womberi wawafata na kuwakomanga. <verse eid="1SA 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 14:23" />Hangu Mtuwa Mlungu kawapananiti Waisraeli ukanka.<verse eid="1SA 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malawiru pa nkondu kupera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 14:24" />Lishaka lilii, Waisraeli waweriti watoka nentu, toziya Sauli kawalapira wantu, “Muntu yoseri yanakalii shiboga pamberi pa mshenji kuzyeta na pamberi haneniwawuziliri wankondu wangu na kapangiluwi.” Hangu kwahera muntu yakalawaliriti shintu shoseri lishaka ali. <verse eid="1SA 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 14:25" />Wantu woseri pawasokiti pantundu wawoniti lwashi kila pahala. <verse eid="1SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 14:26" />Kumbiti wantu pawawoniti lwashi kila pahala lwakusumangana, kwahera muntu yakajeriti kuliya lwashi alu, toziya watiriti mpangaliru yawagambiritwi na Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 14:27" />Kumbiti Yonatani kapikiniriti ndiri shakawapangaliriti wantu. Hangu katalipisiya luhonga lwakaweriti nalu, kingiziya mulisega lya lwashi, kaliya lwashi alu. Su kaliwona kana makakala. <verse eid="1SA 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 14:28" />Muntu yumu kamgambira, “Tati gwaku kawalapira wantu pakalonga, muntu yoseri yanakaliyi shiboga leru na kapangiruwi.” Na wantu waweriti watoka kwa njala<verse eid="1SA 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 14:29" />Yonatani kamwankula, “Tati gwangu kawashenyiya wantu. Guloli ntambu yanana makakala toziya ndiya shididini lwashi. <verse eid="1SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 14:30" />Handa wanjagira watwenga pawaliya shididini kulawa mu vintu vyawalopoliti kwa wankondu wawu, metupati makakala, na Wafilisti wavuwa nentu mewalaguwi.” <verse eid="1SA 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 14:31" />Lishaka lilii Waisraeli wawakomiti Wafilisti, kwanjira Mikimashi mpaka Aiyaloni. Shaka ashi Waisraeli waweriti watoka nentu. <verse eid="1SA 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 14:32" />Su watugiriti vintu vyawalopoliti, wawatola wankondolu, ng'ombi na mwana gwa ng'ombi wawalikitula waliya vinofu na mwazi. <verse eid="1SA 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 14:33" />Wantu wamonga wamgambira Sauli, “Guloli wankutenda vidoda kwa Mtuwa Mlungu kwa kuliya vinofu yana mwazi.” Sauli kawagambira wantu, “Womberi wamgalambuka Mtuwa Mlungu. Mubilingisiyi libuwi likulu paneni panu. <verse eid="1SA 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 14:34" />Kawagambira, Mgendi mwakawagambiri wantu woseri, kila muntu kajegi ng'ombi ama kondolu gwakuyi panu, wawalikituli na kuwaliya panu. Nawatenda vidoda kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, kwa kuliya vinofu vyana mwazi.” Hangu, pashiru palii woseri wawajegiti wang'ombi wawu na kuwalikitula palapalii. <verse eid="1SA 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 14:35" />Su, Sauli kamnyawira Mtuwa Mlungu shitalawanda shashinyawitwi kwa mabuwi. Panu paweriti pakutambikira pa kwanja Sauli kamnyawiliti Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="1SA 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 14:36" />Shakapanu Sauli kawagambira wantu, “Tugendeni twakawafati Wafilisti pashiru, twakawakankali na kukwepula lunda zawu mpaka mandawira, hapeni tumleki muntu yoseri mkomu.” Wantu wamgambira, “Gutendi shaguwona shiherepa kwa gwenga.” Kumbiti mtambika kawagambira, “Kwanja tumkosiyi Mtuwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="1SA 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 14:37" />Hangu, Sauli kamkosiya Mlungu, “Hashi, ng'endi kuwakomanga Wafilisti? Hashi, haguwatendi Waisraeli wawakanki?” Kumbiti Mlungu kankula ndiri shintu lishaka ali. <verse eid="1SA 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 14:38" />Sauli kalonga, “Mwizi panu mwenga wakulu wa wantu, tuvimani ndo vidoda gaa tutenda leru. <verse eid="1SA 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 14:39" />Nililapa kwa Mtuwa Mlungu yakawera mkomu na mweni kayilopola Israeli, ata handa ndo mwana gwangu Yonatani, mpaka kalaguwi.” Kumbiti kwahera muntu yakalongiti shisoweru. <verse eid="1SA 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 14:40" />Hangu, Sauli kawagambira, “Mwawoseri mwenga mgoloki uwega ulii, shakapanu neni Yonatani mwana gwangu hatugoloki uwega awu.” Womberi wankula, “Gutendi shoseri shaguwona shiherepa.” <verse eid="1SA 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 14:41" />Sauli kalonga, “Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu gwa Israeli, ntambu gaa hagweni nankuli neni ntumintumi gwaku? Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu gwa Israeli, payiwera likosa lya kwaneni ama kwa Yonatani mwana gwangu, su, gwamuwi kwa libuwi lya Ulimu kukosilira nfiru yaku. Kumbiti payiwera likosa ali lya kwa wantu waku wa Israeli, gwamuwi kwa litalawu lya Tumimu kukosilira nfiru yaku.” Yonatani na Sauli wapatikaniti kuwera na likosa, kumbiti wantu wawonikaniti wahera likosa. <verse eid="1SA 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 14:42" />Sauli kalonga, “Mgalambuli simbi kwa kugalambula Urimu na Tumimu pakati pangu na mwana gwangu Yonatani.” Yonatani kawoneka kuwera na likosa. <verse eid="1SA 14:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 14:43" />Sauli kamgambira Yonatani, “Gung'ambili shagutenditi.” Yonatani kankula, “Ndiyiti lwashi shididini kwa kutendera luhonga. Na panu na nakala kuhowa.” <verse eid="1SA 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 14:44" />“Sauli kalonga, Mlungu na kankomangi neni ntambu iraa na nentu handa Yonatani pagulaguwa ndiri.”<verse eid="1SA 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 14:45" />Kumbiti wantu wamgambira Sauli, “Yonatani yakaijegeriti Israeli ukanka mkulu handa awu, ntambu gaa kalaguwi? Shitwatira ashi shiweri kutali. Tulilapa kwa Mtuwa Mlungu yakawera mkomu, ata viri za mtuyi gwakuyi hapeni zituluki pasi. Shakatenditi leru, kashitenda kwa utanga wa Mtuwa Mlungu. Hangu, wantu wamponiziya Yonatani na yomberi kalaguwa ndiri.”<verse eid="1SA 14:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 14:46" />Shakapanu Sauli kalekiti kuwafata Wafilisti na womberi Wafilisti wawuya mukaya mwawu.<verse eid="1SA 14:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukolamlima wa Sauli na kaya yakuyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 14:47" />Pa Sauli kuwera mfalumi gwa Israeli, kalikomangiti na wankondu wakuyi kila uwega: Wamowabu na Waamoni na Waedomu na wafalumi wa Soba na Wafilisti. Kila pawalikomangiti nkondu, kawakangiti. <verse eid="1SA 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 14:48" />Kalikomangiti kwa ugangamala, wawakanka Wamaleki. Kawalopuziyiti Waisraeli kulawa kwa wantu woseri yawaweriti wankuwakomanga.<verse eid="1SA 14:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 14:49" />Wana wapalu wa Sauli waweriti Yonatani, na Ishivi na Maliki Shua. Wahinga wakuyi wawili, mwiwuka gwa kwanja kashemitwi Merabu na mpusu kashemitwi Mikali. <verse eid="1SA 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 14:50" />Mdala gwakuyi Sauli kashemitwi Ahinoamu mhinga gwa Ahimaasi. Mkulu gwa shonta lya Sauli wamshemiti Abineri, mwana gwa Neri, yakaweriti mjomba gwa Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 14:51" />Tati gwa Sauli kaweriti Kishi na tati gwa Abineri kaweriti Neri, waweriti wana gwa Abieli.<verse eid="1SA 14:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 14:52" />Kuweriti na makomangu makulu pakati pa Israeli na Wafilisti shaka shoseri Sauli pakaweriti mfalumi na kila mala Sauli pakampatiti muntu kana likakala ama shikambaku kamtoliti kaweri pamuhera na shonta lyakuyi.<verse eid="1SA 14:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1SA 15" />
  <para style="s">Nkondu kwa wameleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 15:1" />Samueli kamgambira Sauli, “Mtuwa Mlungu kantumiti nikulumiki guweri mfalumi gwa wantu wakuyi wa Israeli. Vinu gupikinili visoweru vya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 15:2" />Mtuwa Mlungu yakana makakala kalonga hangu, haniwakomangi Waamaleki toziya wawakomangiti Waisraeli pawaweriti wankulawa Misri. <verse eid="1SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 15:3" />Vinu, gugendi gwakawakomangi na kwagamiziya vintu vyoseri vyawawera navi. Naguwaleka wakomu, ila guwalagi woseri. Wapalu kwa wadala, wana na wanonu, wang'ombi, wakondolu, ngamiya na wapunda.”<verse eid="1SA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 15:4" />Sauli kalishemiti shonta lyakuyi, kalilolalola weri aku mji gwa Telaimu. Kuweriti na shonta laki mbili kulawa israeli na elufu lilongu kulawa Yuda. <verse eid="1SA 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 15:5" />Shakapanu yomberi na wantu wakuyi wagenditi kumji gwa Amaleki, wawera pawagwadira kululalanda. <verse eid="1SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 15:6" />Sauli kawagambira Wakeni, “Muwuki! Muwamu mwa Waameleki, hera hangu, haniwalagi pamuhera na womberi. Muwuki toziya mwenga muwatendiriti maheri Waisraeli pawalawiti Misri.” Su, Wakeni wawuka muwamu mwa Waamaleki.<verse eid="1SA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 15:7" />Sauli kawakankiti Waamaleki kwanjira Havila mpaka Shuri, kwagulawa mshenji mwa Misri. <verse eid="1SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 15:8" />Kamlopoliti mfalumi Agagi gwa Waamaleki pakawera mkomu. Kawalaga wantu kwa ukola wa ligumba. <verse eid="1SA 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 15:9" />Kumbiti Sauli na wantu wakuyi wamlagiti ndiri Agagi, pota kondolu waherepa nentu, wang'ombi waherepa, mwana gwa ng'ombi, wakondolu na shoseri shilii shashiweriti shiherepa washilaga ndiri. Kumbiti vintu vyoseri vidoda na vyaviweriti vifaa ndiri wavyagamisiya.<verse eid="1SA 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli kalemwa kuwera mfalumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 15:10" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira Samueli, <verse eid="1SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 15:11" />“Njuta toziya nimtenda Sauli kuwera mfalumi. Yomberi kaleka kunfata neni na kajimira ndiri malagalira gangu.” Samueli kakalaliti, kamlilira Mtuwa Mlungu pashiru poseri. <verse eid="1SA 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 15:12" />“Samueli kapikiniriti handa Sauli kaweriti kiza aku Karimeli na kagolosiya shitwalingu sha uholuziya wakuyi, na kagenda Giligali. Hangu shirawu yakuyi, Samueli. Kimukiti mandawira putiputi kagenda kuliwona na Sauli.” <verse eid="1SA 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 15:13" />Samueli pakamsokiti Sauli, Sauli kamgambira Samueli, “Mtuwa Mlungu na kakutekeleri! Ntenda lagiru lya Mtuwa Mlungu lyakandagaliriti ntendi.”<verse eid="1SA 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 15:14" />Samueli kamgambira, “Mbona mpikinira mliru gwa wakondolu na wang'ombi?” <verse eid="1SA 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 15:15" />Sauli kankula, “Wantu wawalekiti kondolu na ng'ombi waherepa yawawatoliti kwa Waamaleki su kumtambikira Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwaku, kumbiti wamonga woseri tuwalagiti.”<verse eid="1SA 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 15:16" />Samueli kambera Sauli, “Gunyamali! Hanikugambiri shakang'ambiriti Mtuwa Mlungu leru pashiru.” Sauli kalonga, “Gung'ambili.”<verse eid="1SA 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 15:17" />Samueli kamgambira, “Tembera guliwoniti kuwera gwenga gumanika ndiri, Hashi, gwenga guweriti ndiri mlonguziya gwa makabila ga Israeli? Mtuwa Mlungu kakulumika kwa lipaki guweri mfalumi kwa Israeli. <verse eid="1SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 15:18" />Mtuwa Mlungu pakakutumiti kakugambira, gugendi guwalagi Waamaleki woseri toziya watenda vidoda! <verse eid="1SA 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 15:19" />Ntambu gaa, gulijimira ndiri liziwu lya Mtuwa Mlungu? Ntambu gaa mtugira lopola na hangu kutenda mlandu gudoda kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu?”<verse eid="1SA 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 15:20" />Sauli kankula, “Njimiriti liziwu lya Mtuwa Mlungu. Ng'enditi kulii kwakantumiti Mtuwa Mlungu, nimujega Agagi mfalumi gwa Waamaleki, na niwalagiti woseri Waamaleki. <verse eid="1SA 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 15:21" />Kumbiti wantu watoliti lopola, kondolu na mbuzi na ng'ombi na vintu vyoseri viherepa vyavilaviwitwi vyagamiziwi su kumtambikira Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwaku, aku Giligali.”<verse eid="1SA 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 15:22" />Samueli kamgambira, “Hashi, Mtuwa Mlungu kasekelera nentu tambiku ya kulunguziwa na malaviwu, teratera kujimira liziwu lyakuyi? Guloli, kumjimira yomberi ndo kuherepa kuliku malaviwu na kumpikinira kuherepa kuliku kutambikira lipaki lya kondolu mpalu. <verse eid="1SA 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 15:23" />Toziya kumgalambuka Mtuwa ndo ukondola handa uhawi, na mtiti ndo handa ukondola na kuguwira vinyagu. Toziya gulilema lagiru lya Mtuwa Mlungu, na yomberi kakulema kuwera mfalumi,”<verse eid="1SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 15:24" />Sauli kamgambira Samueli, “Ntenda vidoda. Mega lagiru lya Mtuwa Mlungu na lagiru lyaku, toziya niwatiriti wantu wangu, ntenda vyawafiriti. <verse eid="1SA 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 15:25" />Kumbiti vinu nikuluwa, gunekiziyi vidoda vyangu. Gunjimiri mbuyi pamuhera na gwenga su nwezi kumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="1SA 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 15:26" />Samueli kamwankula. “Nakaka, mbeza ndiri kuwuya pamuhera na gwenga. Gwenga gulilema lagiru lya Mtuwa Mlungu na yomberi kakulema kuwera mfalumi gwa Israeli.” <verse eid="1SA 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 15:27" />Samueli pakagalambukiti su kagendi zakuyi, Sauli kakola nguwu yakuyi, nalweni lupapuka. <verse eid="1SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 15:28" />Samueli ndo kamgambiriti Sauli, “Kwanjira leru Mtuwa Mlungu kaulaviya ufalumi wa Israeli kulawa kwa Gwenga na hakampanani muntu gwingi muwamu mwa wapakwegera waku yakawera kaherepa kuliku gwenga. <verse eid="1SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 15:29" />Mlungu gwa Israeli gwa mashaka goseri kapayira ndiri na kagalambula ndiri liholu lyakuyi. Yomberi muntu ndiri ata kagalambuli maholu.” <verse eid="1SA 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 15:30" />Sauli kankula, “Ntenda vidoda. Kumbiti nagunsoniziya kulongolu kwa wazewi na wantu wa neni na Waisraeli. Gunjimiri mbuyi pamuhera na gwenga su nimguwiri Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwaku.”<verse eid="1SA 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 15:31" />Su, Samueli kawuya pamuhera na yomberi na Sauli kamguwira Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1SA 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 15:32" />Shakapanu Samueli kalonga, “Munjegeri panu Agagi mfalumi gwa Waameleki.” Agagi kamgendera Samueli pakawera mukunemelera su kaliholiti, “Mponeka hapeni wantagi.” <verse eid="1SA 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 15:33" />Samueli kalonga, “Toziya ligumba lyaku liwalaga ashina mawu wavuwa nawawera na wana na mawu gwaku ntambu yakawera pota mwana muwamu mwa ashina mawu.” Kamuhanjangahanjanga Agagi vipandivipandi kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu aku Giligali.<verse eid="1SA 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 15:34" />Shakapanu, Samueli kagenda Rama na mfalumi Sauli kawuya ukaya kwakuyi aku Gibea. <verse eid="1SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 15:35" />Kwanjira lishaka ali, Samueli kamwona ndiri Sauli, mpaka lishaka pakahowiti. Ata hangu Samueli kamliliriti Sauli na Mtuwa Mlungu kahinginikiti handa kaweriti kamlumika Sauli mfalumi gwa Israeli.<verse eid="1SA 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1SA 16" />
  <para style="s">Dawudi kankulumikwa kwa lipaki kuwera mfalumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 16:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira Samueli, “Hagumliliri Sauli mpaka ndii? Gwenga guvimana kuwera neni nimulema kuwera mfalumi kwa Israeli. Vinu gutoli lipaki gumemiziyi ligoli, guwuki. Hanikulagaliri kwa Yese gwa mji gwa Betilehemu. Toziya nilipanana mfalumi muwamu mwa wana wakuyi.” <verse eid="1SA 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 16:2" />Samueli kalonga, “hambezi hashi kugenda? Handa Sauli pakapikinira visoweru avi, hakantagi!” Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira, “Gutoli ng'ombi shidala hakeni leri pamuhera na gwenga na pagusoka gulongi, niza kumlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu tambiku. <verse eid="1SA 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 16:3" />Gumshemeri Yese kutambiku ayi na neni hanikulanguziyi sha kutenda. Hagumswagi lipaki kwajili ya neni muntu ulii yanikukantiliti.” <verse eid="1SA 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 16:4" />Samueli katenda ntambu yakagambiziwitwi na Mtuwa Mlungu, kagenda Betilehemu. Wazewi wa mji walawa kumwanka pawawera wankulendemera, wamkosiya, “Hashi, gwiza kwa ponga?” <verse eid="1SA 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 16:5" />Samueli kawagambira, “Niza kwa ponga. Niza kumlavilira tambiku Mtuwa Mlungu. Mlipungi maweni shakapanu tugendi kulaviya tambiku.” Ntambu iraa Samueli kamgambira Yese pamuhera na wana wakuyi na kawashemera kutambiku. <verse eid="1SA 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 16:6" />Pawasokiti, na Samueli pakamwoniti Eliabu, kalitakuziyiti mumoyu mwakuyi, “Nakaka, mswagwa lipaki gwa Mtuwa Mlungu ndo ayu kakulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu!” <verse eid="1SA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 16:7" />Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Samueli, “Nagulola sheni shakuyi na utali wakuyi. Neni nimulema toziya ndola ndiri ntambu ya kalola muntu. Muntu kalola kwa kunja, kumbiti neni ndola kumoyu.” <verse eid="1SA 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 16:8" />Shakapanu, Yese kamshema mwana gwakuyi Abinadabu na kumjega kulongolu kwa Samueli. Kumbiti Samueli kalonga, “Ndala ayu kasyagulwa ndiri na Mtuwa Mlungu.” <verse eid="1SA 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 16:9" />Yese kamjega Shama. Samueli kalonga, “Ndala ayu kasyaguluwa ndiri na Mtuwa Mlungu.” <verse eid="1SA 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 16:10" />Yese pakawapitiziyiti wana wakuyi woseri saba kulongolu kwa Samueli kumbiti Samueli kawagambira, “Mtuwa Mlungu kamsyagula ndiri yoseri pakati pa awa.” <verse eid="1SA 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 16:11" />Shakapanu kamgambira, “Hashi, wanawaku woseri wapanu?” Yese kankula, “Kankali yumu mpusu, kumbiti kagenda kulolera kondolu.” Samueli kamgambira, “Gumlagaliri muntu kamjegi, twenga hapeni tulikali pasi kuliya, mpaka pakiza panu.” <verse eid="1SA 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 16:12" />Hangu, Yese kamlagalira muntu, kagendi kumshema na kamjega mntemba ulii yakaweriti kana nshimba, kana masu galangala na gakufiriziya. Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira Samueli, “Yinaa, ayu ndo mweni, gugoloki gumswagi lipaki.” <verse eid="1SA 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 16:13" />Samueli katola ligoli lyakuyi lilii. Kamswaga lipaki kulongolu kwa walongu wakuyi katepu rohu ya Mtuwa Mlungu imwizira Dawudi kwa likakala, ilikala kwanjira lishaka lilii na kwendeleya. Shakapanu Samueli kawuyu kumjini Rama.<verse eid="1SA 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dawudi kuligeleri lya numba ya Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 16:14" />Shakapanu rohu ya Mtuwa Mlungu imleka Sauli na rohu kontola kuyilagaliritwi na Mtuwa Mlungu yanja kumgaziya. <verse eid="1SA 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 16:15" />Wantumintumi wakuyi Sauli wamgambira, “Tuvimana handa rohu kontola yayilagaliritwi na Mlungu ikugaziya. <verse eid="1SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 16:16" />Vinu, gwee mtuwa gwetu, guwagambiziyi wantumintumi waku yawakutendera wamsakuli muntu yakavimana kugomba shinubi na rohu ayi ya ukontola payikwizira muntu ayu hakagombi lugombugombu na gwenga haguweri mbaka.” <verse eid="1SA 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 16:17" />Sauli kawagambira wantumintumi wakuyi, “Munsakuliri muntu yakaweza kugomba lugombugombu weri, munjegeri.” <verse eid="1SA 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 16:18" />Mntemba yumu gwa wantumintumi wakuyi kalonga, “Nimwona mntemba yumu gwa Yese, gwa mji gwa Betilehemu. Mntemba ayu kamana kugomba lugombugombu. Mntemba ayu ndo shikambaku, kagangamala kwa kulikomanga kunkondu, kana luhala mukulonga na kaherepa nentu, Mtuwa Mlungu kapamuhera na yomberi.” <verse eid="1SA 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 16:19" />Hangu, Sauli kamtumiti muntu kwa Yese na kulonga, “Gunjegeri mwana gwaku Dawudi, mweni kankulolera kondolu.” <verse eid="1SA 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 16:20" />Yese kamtuma Dawudi kwa Sauli pamuhera na punda yakajegiti mabumunda, mhaku gwa likuli yaguweriti na divayi na kondolu na mbuzi. <verse eid="1SA 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 16:21" />Dawudi pakasokiti kanja kumtendera Sauli. Sauli kamfiriti nentu, ata kamtenda yakamjegera vintu vya kulikomangira kunkondu. <verse eid="1SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 16:22" />Sahakapanu Sauli kamtuma muntu kwa Yese na kulonga, “Nimfira Dawudi, gumleki kalikali panu kantenderi.” <verse eid="1SA 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 16:23" />Kila mala, rohu ulii mkontola yayilagalirwa na Mlungu pakamwiziliti Sauli, Dawudi katoliti shinubi shakuyi na kwanja kugomba na rohu ayu kamleka Sauli na yomberi kalekiziwa na kuwera mbaka.<verse eid="1SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1SA 17" />
  <para style="s1">Goliyati kankuwajongera Waisraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 17:1" />Shaka ashi Wafilisti wajojoniliti mashonta gawu aku Soku, mji yaguwera Muyuda, wawera kala kwa nkondu. Wanyawiti ng'onjeru zawu seemu yimu wayishema Efesi Damimu pakati pa Soku na Azeka. <verse eid="1SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 17:2" />Sauli pamuhera na Waisraeli walijojoniriti na kunyawa ng'onjeru kushidunda shashilola mululalanda lwa Ela. Walitula kala kwa kulikomanga na Wafilisti. <verse eid="1SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 17:3" />Wafilisti wagolokiti mlugongu uwega wumu na Waisraeli wagolokiti kulugongu uwega umonga, pakati pawu kuweriti na libokera. <verse eid="1SA 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 17:4" />Kulawa kulugonjeru lwa Wafilisti, kalilaviyiti shikambaku yumu yawamshema Goliyati, mwenikaya gwa mji gwa Gati. Utali wakuyi uweriti handa mita ntatu. <verse eid="1SA 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 17:5" />Pamtuyi kavaliti kofia ya shaba na likoti lyalinyawitwi kwa shaba pashifuwa shana utopa wa kilu amusini na saba. <verse eid="1SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 17:6" />Magulu gakuyi viraa gaweriti na shinga ya shaba na mumawega gakuyi kapapiti mgowa gwa shaba. <verse eid="1SA 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 17:7" />Mhanya gwa mgoha gwakuyi guweriti handa mtera gwa mtugambewa na mtuwi gwa mgoha agu, guweriti na kilu saba ngawu yakuyi ijegitwi na muntu gwingi yakamlongoleriti. <verse eid="1SA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 17:8" />Goliyati kagolokiti na kuwabotangira wamashonta wa israeli, pakalonga, “Mwankutenda shishi panu? Hashi mwiza kulikomanga nkondu? Neni ndo Mfilisti, mwenga ndo wamanda wa Sauli. Msyaguli muntu yumu gwenu kizi kulikomanga na neni. <verse eid="1SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 17:9" />Handa pakalikomanga na neni pakankanga na kuntaga, twenga hatuweri wamanda wenu. Kumbiti panimkanka na kumlaga su, mwenga hamuweri wamanda wa twenga na kututendera.” <verse eid="1SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 17:10" />Shakapanu Mfilisti ulii kendereyiti kulonga kwa kulitumba, “Niwafira wamashonta wa Israeli leru kumlaviya muntu yumu kizi kulimkomanga na neni.” <verse eid="1SA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 17:11" />Sauli pamuhera na wamashonta woseri wa Israeli pawavipikiniriti visoweru avi vya Mfilisti ayu, winginikiti na kutira nentu.<verse eid="1SA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawudi kung'onjeru ya Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 17:12" />Dawudi kaweriti mwana gwa Yese, lukolu lwa Efrati kulawa Betilehemu Muyuda. Yese kaweriti na wana wanani wapalu. Shaka ashi Sauli pakaweriti mfalumi, Yese kaweriti kala mzewi, muntu kana vinja vivuwa. <verse eid="1SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 17:13" />Wana wakulu watatu wa Yese, Eliabu mwiwuka gwa kwanja, Abinadabu yakafatiti na Shama gwa tatu, yawaweriti wagenda pamuhera na Sauli mnkondu. <verse eid="1SA 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 17:14" />Dawudi kaweriti ndo mdidika gwa woseri. Wana walii watatu wakulu waweriti wagenda na Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 17:15" />Tembera Dawudi mala kwa mala kagenditi kwa Sauli, kumbiti kawuyiti ukaya Betilehemu kulolera kondolu wa tati gwakuyi.<verse eid="1SA 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 17:16" />Kwa mashaka alubayini, mandawira na pamiyi, Mfilisti ulii Goliyati kalilaviyiti paweru, kagoloka na kuwajongera wamashonta wa Israeli.<verse eid="1SA 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 17:17" />Lishaka limu, Yese kamgambiriti mwana gwakuyi Dawudi, “Guwajegeri wakulu waku ntutu kilu lilongu na mabumunda lilongu. Guwajegeri kalongola aku kung'onjeru. <verse eid="1SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 17:18" />Na mkulu gwawu ulii gwa shipinga sha wamashonta elufu gumjegeri vipandi vya samuli yayiyumizitwi. Kawaloli wakaka waku handa wendeleya weri na shakapanu gunjegeri visoweru vyawu.” <verse eid="1SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 17:19" />Shaka ashi mfalumi Sauli, wakulu wakuyi Dawudi na wamashonta woseri wa Israeli waweriti kululalanda lwa Ela, wankulikomanga na Wafilisti.<verse eid="1SA 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 17:20" />Shirawu yakuyi, Dawudi kimukiti mandawira putiputi, na kondolu kamlekera muntu gwingi kawaloleri. Katoliti shiboga na kugenda ntambu yakalagaliritwi na tati gwakuyi Yese. Pakasokiti kung'onjeru ya Waisraeli, wawoniti wankulipanga kuseemu yawu ya nkondu na wankushowangana umatu wa nkondu. <verse eid="1SA 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 17:21" />Mashonta ga Waisraeli na ga Wafilisti walipangiti kala kulikomanga nkondu, pawalilolana, <verse eid="1SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 17:22" />Dawudi kampananiti shiboga muntu yakatuliti weri visanka, kawatugira wamashonta, kagenda kwa walongu wakuyi na kawalamusiya. <verse eid="1SA 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 17:23" />Pakaweriti kankuyowera na womberi, Goliyati ulii mgangamala gwa Wafilisti kulawa Gati kalilaviya kumbeli kwa wamashonta wa Israeli ntambu yakazoweleriti. Na Dawudi kampikinira weri. <verse eid="1SA 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 17:24" />Waisraeli pawamwoniti Goliyati, wamtiriti na kutuga. <verse eid="1SA 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 17:25" />Waligambirana, “Hashi, mmumwona muntu ulii yakalilaviyiti? Ama nakaka, kalilaviya kuwajongera Waisraeli. Mfalumi Sauli kalonga muntu yoseri yakamlagi muntu ayu hanimpanani ulunda uvuwa. Nentu ya goseri, hakamyugiziyi mhinga gwakuyi. Kayi, wantu wa walongu wa tati gwakuyi hawaweri lekeru, Hapeni walipi kodi.”<verse eid="1SA 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 17:26" />Dawudi kawakosiya walii yawaweriti pakwegera na yomberi, “Hashi, muntu yakamlaga Mfilisti ayu na kuyikombola Israeli kulawirana na soni ayi hakatenderwi shishi? Mfilisti ayu yakingiziwa ndiri jandu kaliwona ndo gaa mpaka kagahigiranga mashonta ga Mlungu yakawera mkomu?” <verse eid="1SA 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 17:27" />“Wantu wamgambira Dawudi ntambu yawatakuliti pakwanja galii hakatenderwi muntu yakamlaga Goliyati.”<verse eid="1SA 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 17:28" />Kumbiti Eliyabu, kaka mkulu gwa Dawudi pakampikiniriti Dawudi pakayowera na wantu, kamkalalira Dawudi, kalonga, “Ntambu gaa gwiza? Hashi, wakondolu wadidini gumlekera gaa kundundu kulii? Nugumana mtiti gwaku na ukondola waku. Gwiza hera kulola nkondu.”<verse eid="1SA 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 17:29" />Dawudi kamwankula, “Vinu ntenda shishi? Hashi, meza ndiri ata kukosiya?” <verse eid="1SA 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 17:30" />Dawudi kamgalambukira muntu gwingi kamkosiya likosiyu liraali; na kila pakakosiyiti, kapata shisoweru shiraashi.<verse eid="1SA 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 17:31" />Wantu tunga weni wampikiniriti Dawudi ntambu yakalongiti, wagenditi kumgambira Sauli. Na Sauli kalagalira wamshemi. <verse eid="1SA 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 17:32" />Dawudi kamgambira Sauli, Muntu yoseri nakatiriziwa mumoyu mwakuyi na “Mfilisti ayu. Neni ntumintumi gwaku hang'endi kulikomanga na yomberi.” <verse eid="1SA 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 17:33" />Sauli kamgambira Dawudi, “Gwenga guweza ndiri kulikomanga na Mfilisti ulii. Gwenga ndo mndemba hera, kumbiti muntu ayu kaweriti kulikomanga mnkondu kwanjira untemba wakuyi.” <verse eid="1SA 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 17:34" />Dawudi kalonga, “Neni ntumintumi gwaku nzowelera kulolera kondolu wa tati gwangu. Kila shaka simba ama dubu pakiza na kukamla mwanakondolu <verse eid="1SA 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 17:35" />neni nimfata na kumkomanga, nimlopola mwanakondolu mmulomu mwakuyi. Handa simba ama dubu pakankangala, neni nimkola ndevu zakuyi, nimgusiya na kumlaga. <verse eid="1SA 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 17:36" />Neni ntumintumi gwaku ndaga kala simba wavuwa na dubu wavuwa. Vinu, ata Mfilisti uli yakingiziwa ndiri jandu, mweni kagigiranga mashonta wa Mlungu yakawera mkomu, hakaweri handa awa. <verse eid="1SA 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 17:37" />Mtuwa Mlungu mweni kanopuziya mndoli mwa simba na dubu, hakanopoli kulawa kwa Mfilisti ayu.” Sauli kamgambira, “Gugendi na Mtuwa Mlungu kaweri pamuhera na gwenga.” <verse eid="1SA 17:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 17:38" />Sauli katola nguwu zakuyi za nkondu kamvalasiya Dawudi, kamvalasiya kofia yakuyi ya shaba kumtuwi gwakuyi na likoti lya kulishinga pashifuwa. <verse eid="1SA 17:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 17:39" />Dawudi kalitawa ligumba lya Sauli, kajera kutyanga, kumbiti kasinda toziya kazowelera ndiri mavalu handa aga. Kamgambira Sauli, “Meza ndiri kugenda kunkondu pawera nvala mavalu aga, toziya neni haneni zoweleri.” Kwa aga, kugavula. <verse eid="1SA 17:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 17:40" />Dawudi katola fimbu yakuyi mmawoku, kalisyagulira mabuwi mhanu gaherepa kulawa kulushemba, kagalekera mumuhaku gwakuyi gwa kulololera. Vombelo lyakuyi liweriti kala mumawoku mwakuyi, kanja kumgendera Goliyati Mfilisti.<verse eid="1SA 17:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawudi kankumkanga Goliyati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 17:41" />Mfilisti ulii, yomberi kanja kumgendera Dawudi, na ulii yakatoliti ngawu yakuyi pakawera kulongolu kwakuyi. <verse eid="1SA 17:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 17:42" />Mfilisti ulii pakaloliti na kumwona weri Dawudi, kamzalawu, toziya Dawudi kaweriti mntemba hera, kana nshimba na gwa kufiriziya. <verse eid="1SA 17:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 17:43" />Goliyati kamgosiya Dawudi, “Vinu, fimbu ayu ndo ya shishi? Guhola neni ndo ng'ang'a ata gunizili kwa fimbu?” Goliyati kampangira Dawudi kwa wamlungu wakuyi wa Shifilisti. <verse eid="1SA 17:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 17:44" />Mfilisti kamgambira Dawudi, “Gwizi kwa neni! Nshimba yaku haniwapanani wampongu wa kuliyera na wankanyama wa kuntundu!”<verse eid="1SA 17:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 17:45" />Kumbiti Dawudi kamgambira Goliyati, “Gwenga gunizira kwa ligumba, mgoha na shimagi shikulu shikola kuwili. Kumbiti neni nikwizira kwa litawu lya Mtuwa Mlungu kana likakala, Mlungu kana likakala gwa israeli, mweni gwenga gumwigira. <verse eid="1SA 17:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 17:46" />Lishaka lya leru, Mtuwa Mlungu hakakutuli mmakakala mwangu. Hanikugusiyi pasi, hanikulikituli mtuwi gwaku na nshimba za wamashonta wa Wafilisti haniwapanani wampongu wa kuliyera na wankanyama wa kuntundu. Ndo pasipanu poseri hapamani kuwera kwana Mlungu Muisraeli. <verse eid="1SA 17:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 17:47" />Wantu woseri yawajojonikiti panu leru, hawamani kuwera Mtuwa Mlungu kafira ndiri mgoha pota shimagi shikulu shikola kuwili. Ayi ndo nkondu ya Mtuwa Mlungu na yomberi hakawatendi tuwakanki.”<verse eid="1SA 17:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 17:48" />Goliyati kanja kayi kumgendera Dawudi. Dawudi katuga mbiru kugenda kulikomanga na Goliyati. <verse eid="1SA 17:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 17:49" />Katula liwoku lyakuyi mmuhaku mwakuyi, kalaviya libuwi limu, kaliguma na vombelo lyakuyi, kamguma nali Goliyati na kupena mnkati mwa sheni shakuyi, libuwi lipanditi sheni sha Goliyati na kupena mkati. Goliyati kaguwa pasi makukama. <verse eid="1SA 17:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 17:50" />Hangu ndo ntambu Dawudi kamkankiti Goliyati kwa vombelo lyakuyi na libuwi. Dawudi kaweriti ndiri na ligumba lyoseri mumawoku mwakuyi. <verse eid="1SA 17:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 17:51" />Su, kagenda mbiru, kagoloka pampindi pa Goliyati na kasomola ligumba lya Goliyati mumhaku gwakuyi na kulikitula mtuwi gwakuyi. Wafilisti pawawoniti kuwera shikambaku gwawu kalaguwa, watira na kutuga mbiru. <verse eid="1SA 17:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 17:52" />Ndo wantu wa israeli na wantu wa Yuda, pawanjiti kushowangana kwa ukanka, wawafata Wafilisti mpaka Gati, kuligomi likulu lya Ekroni, ata Wafilisti yawalagitwi kukondu wamemiti mnjira kwanjira Shaarimu mpaka Gati na Ekroni. <verse eid="1SA 17:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1SA 17:53" />Waisraeli pawawuyiti kuwafata Wafilisti, walopuliti ng'onjeru za Wafilisti. <verse eid="1SA 17:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1SA 17:54" />Dawudi kagutoliti mtuwi gwa Goliyati ulii, Mfilisti, kagujega mjini Yerusalemu. Kumbiti vintu vya kulikomangira vya Goliyati kavitula mulilingu lyakuyi.<verse eid="1SA 17:54" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dawudi kankujegwa kwa Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1SA 17:55" />Sauli pakamwoniti Dawudi kagenda kumsegelera Mfilisti ulii Goliyati, kamkosiya Abineri, mkulu gwa shonta lyakuyi, “Abineri, ayu mndemba gwa gaa?” Abineri kankula, “Mfalumi, ntambu yagulikala, neni nivimana ndiri.” <verse eid="1SA 17:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="1SA 17:56" />Mfalumi Sauli kamgambira, “Su, gumkosiyi yomberi ntemba gwa gaa.”<verse eid="1SA 17:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="1SA 17:57" />Katepu hera Dawudi pakawuyiti kulugonjeru pa kumlaga Goliyati, Abineri kamtoliti na kumjega kwa Sauli. Shaka ashi Dawudi kaweriti kakali kankujega mtuwi gwa Goliyati mumawuku mwakuyi. <verse eid="1SA 17:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1SA 17:58" />Sauli kamkosiya Dawudi, “Mndemba, gwenga ndo mwana gwa gaa?” Dawudi kankula, “Neni ndo mwana gwa ntumintumi gwaku Yese, kulawa Betilehemu.”<verse eid="1SA 17:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1SA 18" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 18:1" />Sauli pakamaliliti kuyowera na Dawudi, Yonatani mwana gwa Sauli, kakwegitwi nentu na Dawudi, kamfira kwa moyu gwakuyi goseri ntambu yakalifiriti mweni. <verse eid="1SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 18:2" />Kwanjira lishaka ali, Sauli kamtola Dawudi ukaya kwakuyi, kamjimira ndiri kuwuya ukaya kwa tati gwakuyi. <verse eid="1SA 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 18:3" />Toziya Yonatani kamfiriti Dawudi handa rohu yakuyi, katenditi lipatanu na yomberi. <verse eid="1SA 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 18:4" />Kavuliti likoti lyakavaliti na kumpanana Dawudi pamuhera na vintu vyakuyi vya kulikomangira, ata ligumba, upindi na mkanda gwakuyi. <verse eid="1SA 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 18:5" />Koseri Dawudi kwakatumitwi na Sauli, Dawudi kapata ukanka. Hangu, Sauli kamtenda kuwera mkulu gwa mashonta. Mlandu agu guwanemiziya wantu woseri ata wantumintumi wa Sauli.<verse eid="1SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli kawera na weya na Dawudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 18:6" />Mashonta pawaweriti wankuwuya ukaya, pamuhera na Dawudi pa kumlaga Mfilisti ulii, wadala kulawa kila mji Muisraeli walawa kugenda kumwanka mfalumi Sauli. Wadala na womberi waweriti wankwimba nyimbu za nemeleru, pawagomba ng'oma na vinubi. <verse eid="1SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 18:7" />Viraa waweriti wankuvina na kwimba nyimbu za kwitikira hangu, “Sauli kalaga maelufu gakuyi na Dawudi kalaga malongu elufu gakuyi.” <verse eid="1SA 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 18:8" />Sauli kafiliziwa ndiri na visoweru vya lwimbu alu, hangu kakalala nentu. Kalonga, “Wampanana Dawudi malongu elufu, kumbiti neni wanupa maelufu hera. Lyalisigaliti ndo kumpanana Dawudi ufalumi.” <verse eid="1SA 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 18:9" />Kwanjira lishaka ali, Sauli kawera kamjimira kayi ndiri Dawudi. <verse eid="1SA 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 18:10" />Shirawu yakuyi, rohu mkondola yayitumitwi na Mlungu, kamkankala Sauli kwa vumu, kawera kankubotabota handa kana lukwali ukaya kwakuyi. Dawudi kaweriti kankugomba shinubi ntambu yakatenditi mashaka goseri. Sauli kaweriti na mgowa mmawoku mwakuyi, <verse eid="1SA 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 18:11" />“Su kaliholiti, kamwasiliti Dawudi mgoha mala mbili, hanimyoneri Dawudi mushibambaza. Kumbiti Dawudi kakwepiti mala zoseri mbili.” <verse eid="1SA 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 18:12" />Sauli kaweriti kamtira Dawudi toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti pamuhera na yomberi, kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti kamleka Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 18:13" />Hangu, Sauli kamwusiya kaya kwakuyi na kumtenda mlonguziya gwa mashonta elufu yimu. Na Dawudi kawalonguziya weri kunkondu. <verse eid="1SA 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 18:14" />Dawudi kakankiti mukila shintu shakatenditi, toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti pamuhera na yomberi. <verse eid="1SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 18:15" />Sauli pakawoniti kukanka kwa Dawudi, kawera kamtira. <verse eid="1SA 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 18:16" />Kumbiti wantu woseri wa Israeli na Yuda wamfiriti Dawudi, toziya kawalonguziya weri munkondu na kuwawuziya kwa ukanka.<verse eid="1SA 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dawudi kankumyuga mhinga gwa Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 18:17" />Sauli kamgambira Dawudi, “Ayu ndo Merabu, mhinga gwakuyi mkulu, hanikuyugiziyi kaweri mdala gwaku guweri shonta gwangu mgangamala na mjimira, gulikomangi nkondu za Mtuwa Mlungu.” Sauli kaliholiti kwanjira ayi Wafilisti hawamlagi Dawudi, su shitwatira ashi nakashitenda mweni. <verse eid="1SA 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 18:18" />Dawudi kamgambira Sauli, “Neni ndo gaa ata mfalumi kaweri mganafu gwangu? Lukolu lwangu namweni na ata wantu wa tati gwangu ndo wamanika ndiri Muisraeli.” <verse eid="1SA 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 18:19" />Kumbiti, shaka shilii Merabu mhinga gwakuyi Sauli mekayugiziwi kwa Dawudi, kayugiziwa kwa Adirieli kulawa mji gwa Mehola. <verse eid="1SA 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 18:20" />Ata hangu, Mikali mhinga yumonga gwa Sauli kamfiriti Dawudi. Sauli pawamgambiriti kanemelera nentu. <verse eid="1SA 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 18:21" />Sauli kaliholiti, “Guleki nimyugiziyi ayu su kaweri mgomiziwu kwakuyi. Na pota shashatika Wafilisti hawamlagi.” Hangu Sauli kamgambira kawili vinu haweri mganafu gwaku. <verse eid="1SA 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 18:22" />Shakapanu Sauli kawagambiziya wantumintumi wakuyi pakalonga “Guyoweri pagweka na Dawudi na kumgambira, mfalumi kafiliziwa nentu na gwenga, ata wantumintumi waku viraa woseri wakufira nentu gwenga. Hangu, vinu gujimiri kuwera mganafu gwakuyi mfalumi.” <verse eid="1SA 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 18:23" />Su, wantumintumi wa Sauli wamgambiriti Dawudi visoweru avi pagweka na yomberi kawagambira, “Neni ndo muntu muhushu na gwa pasi hamezi hashi kulaviya mahetu. Hashi mlihola kuwera shitwatira ndiri shikamala neni kuwera mganafu gwa mfalumi?” <verse eid="1SA 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 18:24" />Wantumintumi walii wamgambiriti Sauli ntambu yakatakuliti Dawudi. <verse eid="1SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 18:25" />Sauli kawagambira, “mugambiri Dawudi hangu. Shilii shakafiriti mfalumi hangu mahetu ga mhinga gwakuyi ndo vinduli miya vya Wafilisti, su kaliwuziliri kwa wankondu wakuyi.” Hangu ndo ntambu yakapangiti Dawudi kalaguwi na Wafilisti. <verse eid="1SA 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 18:26" />Wantumintumi walii pawamgambiriti Dawudi galii mafiru ga Sauli, Dawudi kanemelera hakaweri mganafu gwakuyi. Pamberi pa lishaka lya ndowa, <verse eid="1SA 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 18:27" />su Dawudi na wantu wakuyi wagenditi, wawalaga Wafilisti miya mbili na kutola vinduli vyawu mpaka kwa mfalumi Sauli. Panu kamwalangira walanga yoseri su mfalumi kaweri mganafu gwakuyi Dawudi. Hangu, Sauli kamyugiziya Dawudi mhinga gwakuyi Mikali kaweri mdala gwakuyi. <verse eid="1SA 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 18:28" />Kumbiti Sauli pakawoniti pota kufifa Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti pamuhera na Dawudi, na kuwera Mika mhinga gwakuyi kamfiriti nentu Dawudi, <verse eid="1SA 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 18:29" />kongeriti kumtira Dawudi. Sauli kawera mnkondu gwa Dawudi mashaka goseri. <verse eid="1SA 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 18:30" />Shonta lya Wafilisti ligenditi kulikomanga na Waisrali, kumbiti kila mala pawalikomangiti nkondu, Dawudi kapatiti ukanka kuliku wantumintumi wa Sauli, hangu litawu lyakuyi Dawudi lizyumwa nentu.<verse eid="1SA 18:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1SA 19" />
  <para style="s">Sauli kankufira kumlaga Dawudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 19:1" />Sauli kamgambiriti mwana gwakuyi Yonatani na wakulu wakuyi kuusu mpangu gwakuyi gwa kumlaga Dawudi. Kumbiti Yonatani, mwana gwa Sauli, kamfiriti nentu Dawudi. <verse eid="1SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 19:2" />Hangu, kamgambira Dawudi, “Tati gwangu kafira kakulagi. Hangu guliloleri weri. Shirawu mandawira, gulififi pahala pa bada, gulikali palaa. <verse eid="1SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 19:3" />Neni hanizi na kugoloka pakwegera na tati gwangu aku kulilambu pahala pagufira kuwera gulififa. Hanyoweri nayu kuusu gwenga na shintu shoseri shanishiyambuli kulawa kwakuyi, hanikugambiri.”<verse eid="1SA 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 19:4" />Yonatani kamzyuma Dawudi kulongolu kwa tati gwakuyi, kamgambira, “Nagutenda ukondola kwa ntumintumi gwaku Dawudi toziya yomberi hakeni tendi vidoda vyoseri kwa gwenga, matendu gakuyi goseri gakakutenderiti mashaka goseri gaweriti maheri kwa gwenga. <verse eid="1SA 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 19:5" />Kaweriti kala kugahowiziya makaliru gakuyi palii pakagenditi kumlaga Mfilisti Goliyati na Mtuwa Mlungu kawapananiti Waisraeli ukanka mkulu. Gwenga paguguwoniti mlandu gulii gunemeleriti. Ntambu gaa gufira kutenda vidoda kwa kwita mwazi yaguwera ndiri na shidoda kwa kumlaga Dawudi pota toziya?”<verse eid="1SA 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 19:6" />Sauli kampikiniriti Yonatani, shakapanu, “Nililapa kwa Mtuwa Mlungu yakawera mkomu, hapeni nimlagi Dawudi.” <verse eid="1SA 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 19:7" />Hangu, Yonatani kamshema Dawudi na kumgambira mirandu yoseri ayi. Yonatani kamjega kwa Sauli na Dawudi kamtendera Sauli gambira pakwanja.<verse eid="1SA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 19:8" />Pagapititi aga kuweriti na nkondu pakati pa Wafilisti na Waisraeli. Dawudi kalawa kulikomanga na Wafilisti, kawalaga Wafilisti wavuwa na yawasigaliti wamtira. <verse eid="1SA 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 19:9" />Lishaka limu, rohu idoda yayitumitwi na Mlungu imwizira Sauli pakaweriti kalikala ukaya kwakuyi pakakola mgoha mliwoku, shaka sheni Dawudi kaweriti kankugomba shinubi. <verse eid="1SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 19:10" />Sauli kajeriti kumsoma Dawudi kwa mgowa agu, Kumbiti Dawudi kakwepiti mgoha gwa Sauli na mgoha guguma shibambaza. Dawudi katuga na kutoloka. <verse eid="1SA 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 19:11" />Pashiru pamu, Sauli katumiti wantu ukaya kwa Dawudi mumuloli handa kamlaa su kapati kumlaga mandawira. Kumbiti Mikali, mdala gwa Dawudi kamgambira Dawudi, “Handa pagutoloka ndiri pashiru shirawu mandawira hagulaguwi.” <verse eid="1SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 19:12" />Hangu Mikali kamtangati Dawudi kusuluka kupitira Kulidilisha na yomberi kalawa na kutoloka. <verse eid="1SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 19:13" />Mikali katola shinyagu kashivalasiya mibahira ya mbuzi kumtuwi, shakapanu kashigibikira na nguwu. <verse eid="1SA 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 19:14" />“Sauli pakatumiti wantu kumbata Dawudi, Mikali kawagambira kuwera Dawudi kalwala.” <verse eid="1SA 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 19:15" />Shakapanu Sauli kawalagalira wawuyi kayi aku, kawalagalira kulonga, “Mumujegi kwa neni Dawudi ata pakawera mumashera su kalaguwi.” <verse eid="1SA 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 19:16" />Wantu walii pawingiliti ukaya kwa Dawudi na kushilola shitanda wawoniti mibahira mbuzi kumtuwi. <verse eid="1SA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 19:17" />Shakapanu Sauli kamkosiya Mikali, “Ntambu gaa gumpayira? Gumleka nkondu gwangu katoloki?” Na yomberi Mikali kamwankula Sauli, “kang'ambiriti, Gunteki ng'endi naniza kukulaga.”<verse eid="1SA 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 19:18" />Dawudi pakatolokiti, kagenditi Rama kwa Samueli. Kamgambiriti Samueli mirandu yoseri yakamtenderiti Sauli. Su, Dawudi na Samueli wagenditi na kulikala aku Nayoti iweriti numba ya wambuyi wa Mlungu. <verse eid="1SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 19:19" />“Pamashaka tunga kupita Sauli kagambiluwa kuwera Dawudi kaweriti aku Nayoti mu Rama.” <verse eid="1SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 19:20" />Sauli pakajegiti wantu wambati. Kumbiti pawashiwoniti shipinga sha wambuyi wa Mlungu pashitunga na Samueli pakalilonguziya, Rohu ya Mlungu iwizira wantumintumi wa Sauli na womberi viraa wanja kutunga pawavina na kushowangana. <verse eid="1SA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 19:21" />Sauli pakagambiruwitwi visoweru avi, katuma wantumintumi wamonga, nawomberi viraa wanja kutunga pawavina na kushowangana. Sauli pakatumiti wantumintumi wamonga kwa mala ya tatu, na womberi viraa wanja kutunga. <verse eid="1SA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 19:22" />Mweni ndo kagenda Rama. Pakasokiti palinegu likulu lyaliweriti aku Seku, kamwoniti muntu tunga yomberi kamkosiya, “Samueli na Dawudi wa koshi?” Muntu ayu kamwankula, “Wa Nayoti, mu Rama.” <verse eid="1SA 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 19:23" />Na yomberi Sauli kagenda aku Nayoti mu Rama. Pakasokiti aku, Rohu ya Mlungu imwizira, na yomberi kanja kutunga agawu pakavina na kushowangana pakaweriti munjira mpaka pakasokiti Nayoti mu Rama. <verse eid="1SA 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 19:24" />Kavuliti nguwu yakuyi kawera kankutunga kulongolu kwa Samueli. Kagonja ntambu iraa ayi paliwala na pashiru. Hangu wantu wanjiti kulikosiya, “Hashi, Sauli na yomberi viraa kawera yumu gwa wambuyi?”<verse eid="1SA 19:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1SA 20" />
  <para style="s">Yonatani kankumtanga Dawudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 20:1" />Dawudi katoloka kayi kulawa Nayoti mu Rama, kagenda mpaka kwa Yonatani, kawagambira, ntenda shishi? Likosa lyangu shishi? “Nimtendera tati gwaku shidoda gaa ata kajeri kuntaga?” <verse eid="1SA 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 20:2" />Yonatani kankula, “Ali na liweri kutali na gwenga. Hapeni guhowi. Tati gwangu katenda ndiri mlandu goseri, guweri mkulu ama mdidiki, pota kung'ambira. Ata mlandu agu hapeni kawezi kunfifa. Ntambu yaiwera ndiri ata shididini.” <verse eid="1SA 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 20:3" />Dawudi kalilapa viraa, “Nakaka tati gwaku kavimana weri ntambu yagunfira na kalihola kukufifa kuusu mlandu agu su nagwinginika pakalitenda. Kumbiti, kwa ntambu yoseri ilii, nililapa kwa Mtuwa Mlungu yakawera mkomu, na gwenga yaguwera mkomu, handa pakati pa neni na mtugulu vya pakwegera!” <verse eid="1SA 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 20:4" />Yonatani kamgambira, “Shoseri shagutakula hanikutenderi.” <verse eid="1SA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 20:5" />Dawudi kamgambira, “Shirawu ndo msambu gwa mwezi mwoneka na neni haweri pameza kuliya pamuhera na mfalumi. Kumbiti gundeki, nilififi aku kulilambu mpaka lishaka lya tatu pamihi. <verse eid="1SA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 20:6" />Tati gwaku pakamona ndiri pameza kwa shiboga, pakakosiya visoweru vya neni, su gumgambiri, Dawudi kazyangazyanga nentu nimjimiri su kagendi kumjini kwakuyi Betilehemu, kuwera kutambiku ya kila shinja na walongu wakuyi. <verse eid="1SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 20:7" />Payiwera hakawoni ndo hayiweri hangu, su, guvimani kuwera mirandu ya neni, ntumintumi gwaku, ya ponga. Hera Hangu, nfiru yakuyi kwa neni ndo idoda. <verse eid="1SA 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 20:8" />Hangu guntenderi kwa uheri waku toziya gutenda lipatanu linanagala na neni, neni ntumintumi gwaku, kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. Kumbiti, handa ntenda likosa na guntagi gamweni gwenga, ntambu gaa gunjegi kwa tati gwaku su kantagi?” <verse eid="1SA 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 20:9" />Yonatani kankula, “Liholu ali na liweri kutali na gwenga. Nakaka, handa menivimani kuwera tati gwangu kapanga madoda kwa gwenga menikufifi ndiri.” <verse eid="1SA 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 20:10" />Dawudi kakosiya, “Hanivimani hashi payiwera tati gwaku hakakwankuli kwa ukalipa?” <verse eid="1SA 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 20:11" />Yonatani kamwankula, “Mwizi tugendi kumalambu!” Su, wagenda. <verse eid="1SA 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 20:12" />Yonatani kamgambira Dawudi, “Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli na kaweri kapitawu gwetu. Shirawu ama shirawu imonga, shaka handa ashi hanimkosiyi tati gwangu. Payiwera hakalanguziyi kakufira ndiri ama shisoweru shoseri shidoda hanikugambiri. <verse eid="1SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 20:13" />Handa tati gwangu pakafira kukulaga na neni nikugambira ndiri su Mlungu kandagi, gugendi pahala patali. Mtuwa na kaweri pamuhera na gwenga ntambu yaguweriti na tati gwangu. <verse eid="1SA 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 20:14" />Payiwera hanendereyi kuwera mkomu su, gutuli weri shagulongiti shinanagala na guweri mwaminika handa pamhowa, <verse eid="1SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 20:15" />kayi naguleka kuyitanga kaya ya neni kwa waminika mashaka goseri. Na Mtuwa Mlungu hakawalemi wankondu waku kulawa Pasipanu, <verse eid="1SA 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 20:16" />Kwa kutenda hangu Yonatani kankutenda lipatanu na kaya ya Daudi, pakalonga. Mtuwa na kawagamiziyi wangondu wa Dawudi.” <verse eid="1SA 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 20:17" />Kwa mala imonga kayi, Yonatani kamgambiriti Dawudi kalilapi kulinganira na ufiru waku kwakuyi yomberi Yonatani, toziya kamfiriti Dawudi ntambu yakalifiriti mweni. <verse eid="1SA 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 20:18" />Shakapanu kamgambira Dawudi, “Shirawu ndo msambu gwa lyezi kulawira, wantu hawawoni handa gwahera, toziya shiti shaku hashiweri shahera muntu. <verse eid="1SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 20:19" />Shirawu imonga, wantu hapeni wakuwoni nakamu. Lishaka ali gugendi pahala gulififiti kwanja, gulififiti kumbeli kushidunda sha mabuwi. <verse eid="1SA 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 20:20" />Neni hang'umi misali mitatu kubwegabwega gambira nanguziya kuguma shintu tunga. <verse eid="1SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 20:21" />Hanimtumi ntumintumi gwangu kagendi kuyisakula misali. Handa panimgambira, guloli, misali ayi ya uwega awu waku, guyitoli, ayi inamana handa guponeka na gwenga hagulilaviyi kulawa pahala pagulififiti, toziya nililapa kwa Mtuwa Mlungu yakawera mkomu, handa meguweri guponeka. <verse eid="1SA 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 20:22" />Kumbiti nimgambira, guloli, misali yakulongolu kwaku, panu, guwuki, toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kafira gugendi kutali. <verse eid="1SA 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 20:23" />Kwa mirandu yatupataniti, Mtuwa Mlungu katulola su tuwezi kutula weri shatulilapiti su tushitendi.” <verse eid="1SA 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 20:24" />Su, Dawudi kalififa kulilambu. Shaka sha misambu gwa lyezi kulawira, mfalumi Sauli kalikala pameza kuliya. <verse eid="1SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 20:25" />Handa yaiweriti ntambu yakuyi, mfalumi kalivagiti mshiti shakuyi shashiweriti pakwegera yakuyi kushibambaza. Yonatani kalikala pawalilolana na mfalumi na Abineri walikala pakwegera na mfalumi. Kumbiti pahala pa Dawudi paweriti lupalahera. <verse eid="1SA 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 20:26" />“Lishaka ali, Sauli katakula ndiri shoseri, tembera kaliholiti kuwera pamonga Dawudi kabatwa na shida ama yomberi pamonga kajimiluwa ndiri kulongolu kwa Mlungu kuwera pamuhera mmusambu agu.” <verse eid="1SA 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 20:27" />Lishaka lya pili, lya misambu gwa lyezi kulawa, pahala pa Dawudi pasigala pahera muntu. Sauli kamkosiya mwana gwakuyi Yonatani, kwa ntambu gaa Dawudi mwana gwa Yese, kiza ndiri kushiboga, “lishu na leru?” <verse eid="1SA 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 20:28" />Yonatani kankula, “Kanduwiti nentu nimjimiri kagendi Betilehemu. <verse eid="1SA 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 20:29" />Kang'ambiriti, gunjimiri ng'endi kwa walongu wangu, toziya wankutenda shijungu sha tambiku aku mjini, na mlongu gwangu kanfira ng'endi aku Ndo mana kwahera panu mushiboga sha mfalumi.” <verse eid="1SA 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 20:30" />Panu Sauli kaniti maya kwa Yonatani, kamgambira, “Mwana gwa mdala mjimira ndiri na mkondola gwenga! Nivimana kuwera gulisyagulira mwana gwa Yese kwa Soni zaku gamweni na kumsoniziya mawu gwaku! <verse eid="1SA 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 20:31" />Hashi, guvimana ndiri handa Dawudi pakawera mkomu, gwenga hapeni gupati lupenu lwa kuwera mfalumi gwa isi ayi? Vinu gugendi gukamjegi panu kwa neni, toziya mpaka kalaguwi.” <verse eid="1SA 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 20:32" />Yonatani kamwankula, “Toziya gaa kalaguwi? Katenda shishi?” <verse eid="1SA 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 20:33" />Kumbiti Sauli mala kamwasira Yonatani mgoha su kamlagi. Na Yonatani kavimana kuwera tati gwakuyi kaweriti nakaka kafiliti kumlaga Dawudi. <verse eid="1SA 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 20:34" />Panu Yonatani, agawu pakawera kakalala nentu, kawuka pameza kalongola, pota kuliya shiboga shoseri lishaka ali lya pili lya msambu gwa lyezi kulawa. Yonatani kinginikiti nentu kuusu Dawudi toziya tati gwakuyi kaweriti kamsoniziya. <verse eid="1SA 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 20:35" />Shirawu yakuyi mandawira, Yonatani kagenditi kulilambu kulii, kuliwona na Dawudi ntambu yawaligambiziyaniti. Wagenda aku na mndemba yumu mpalu. <verse eid="1SA 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 20:36" />Pakasokiti aku kamgambiriti mndemba gwakuyi ulii, “Gutugi gwakaisakuli misali yanfira kuguma.” Mndemba ulii pakaweriti patuga, Yonatani kaguma misali kulongolu kwakuyi. <verse eid="1SA 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 20:37" />Mndemba ulii pakasokiti pahala payitulukiriti misali, Yonatani kamshema, “Msali gwakulongolu kwaku. <verse eid="1SA 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 20:38" />Gutendi kalongola na gugoloki hera pahala panu.” Mndemba ulii kayisoliti misali na kumgendera mtuwa gwakuyi. <verse eid="1SA 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 20:39" />Kumbiti mndemba ulii kavimaniti ndiri shoseri kuusu mana ya mlandu agu. Yawavimaniti ndo Yonatani na Dawudi hera. <verse eid="1SA 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 20:40" />Yonatani kampananiti mndemba ulii vintu vya kulikomangira vyakuyi na kumgambira “Guwuyi kumjini.” <verse eid="1SA 20:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 20:41" />Katepu mndemba ulii pakawukiti kala, Dawudi kimuka na kulawa pahala pakalififiti pakwegera na shidunda sha mabuwi. Kang'ong'onala pasi kwa ligoya mala ntatu kulongolu kwa Yonatani. Woseri wawili, Dawudi na Yonatani, walikisikirana na kulira. Dawudi kaweriti na hinginika nentu kuliku Yonatani. <verse eid="1SA 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 20:42" />Shakapanu Yonatani kamgambira Dawudi, “Gugendi kwa ponga. Tulilapa kala woseri kwa litawu lya Mtuwa Mlungu, kuwera Mtuwa Mlungu kalola tutula weri shatulongiti mashaka goseri na pakati pa wiwuka waneni na wiwuka waku mashaka goseri.” Dawudi kagoloka na kugenda zakuyi na yomberi Yonatani kawuya kumjini.<verse eid="1SA 20:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1SA 21" />
  <para style="s">Dawudi katugira aku Nobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 21:1" />Dawudi kagenditi kwa mtambika Ahimeleki aku Nobu. Ahimeleki kalawiti kumwanka aku pakawera kankulendemera, kamkosiya, “Ntambu gaa gwiza panu gwekayaku?” <verse eid="1SA 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 21:2" />Dawudi kamwankula, “Napanu toziya mfalumi kantuma lihengu. Kang'ambiriti nanigambiri muntu yoseri shilii shakantumiti. Tuligambiziyana na wantu wangu handa tuliwoni pahala tunga. <verse eid="1SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 21:3" />Hashi, gwana shintu shoseri shakuya? Nikuluwa mabumunda mhanu ama shoseri shashiwera.” <verse eid="1SA 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 21:4" />Mtambika Ahimeleki kamgambira, “Panu nahera libumunda lya ntambu iraayi. Nanaga mabumunda mananagala. Muweza kupananwa mabumunda aga paiwera wantu waku haweni gonji na wadala pakwegera.” <verse eid="1SA 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 21:5" />Dawudi kamgambira, “Nakaka, mashaka goseri pang'enda kwajili ya lihengu lya gweka, wadala wawera kutali na twenga! Payiwera nshimba za wantemba waneni ndo zinanagala tuweri kulihengu lya ntambu iraa, hashi ndo nentu mulihengu lilii lya gweka?” <verse eid="1SA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 21:6" />Hangu mtambika Ahimeleki kampanana mabumunda mananagala, toziya kwaniti ndiri mabumunda gamonga ila aga yagatulwa kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu kulilingu linanagala, igalambulwa na mabumunda ga syayi na yagalawiti kumotu.<verse eid="1SA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 21:7" />Su kaweriti panu lishaka ali ntumintumi yumu gwa Sauli mweni kaweriti kagenda kuguwira kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. Ntumintumi ayu kashemitwi Doegi, kulawa Edomu, mkulu gwa walolera vigongolu wa Sauli.<verse eid="1SA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 21:8" />Su, Dawudi kamgambira Ahimeleki, “Hashi, gwana ligumba ama mgoha guweza kumpanana? Toziya mahengu ga mfalumi gantenda mbuki kalongola na neni mbuka pota ligumba lyangu pota vintu vya kulikomangira vyoseri.” <verse eid="1SA 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 21:9" />Ahimeleki kankula, “Nanali ligumba lya Mfilisti Goliyati yagumlagiti kululalanda lwa Ela, lya panu, litawalilwa mushitambala kumbeli kwa nguwu yakugibikira pashifuwa sha mtambika. Handa pagulifira, gulitoli, kwahera ligumba limonga panu ira ali hera.” Dawudi kalonga, “kwahera ligumba limonga handa ali, gumpanani ali.”<verse eid="1SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 21:10" />Shakapanu Dawudi kawuka kendereya kamtugiti Sauli, kagenda kwa mfalumi Akishi gwa Gati. <verse eid="1SA 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 21:11" />Wantumintumi wa mfalumi wamgambira Akishi, “Ayu Dawudi ndiri? Mfalumi gwa isi ya Israeli? Hashi, ayu ndiri waweriti wankuligambirana mung'oma, pawalonga, Sauli kalaga maelufu ga wantu na Dawudi kalaga malongu elufu ga wantu?”<verse eid="1SA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 21:12" />Visoweru avi Dawudi kaweziti ndiri kulyaluwa, kanja kumtira nentu Akishi mfalumi gwa Gati. <verse eid="1SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 21:13" />Hangu kila pawaweriti pakwegera na yomberi, kagalambula tabiya yakuyi, kalitenda kapunganika, kawera kankukwandangakwandanga kuligomi lya mji, na mata gakuyi kagaleka ganyililiki pandevu zakuyi.<verse eid="1SA 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 21:14" />Akishi kawagambira wantumintumi wakuyi, “Muvimana kuwera muntu ayu ndo kanalukwali, ntambu gaa mumjega kwa neni? <verse eid="1SA 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 21:15" />Hashi, niwafira wanalukwali nentu, muvimana handa muntu ayu ndo kanalukwali kiza kung'aziya nentu? Ntambu gaa munjegera kanalukwali kizi kung'aziya na vitendu vya ulukwali? Hashi, muntu ayu hakingiri ukaya kwa neni?”<verse eid="1SA 21:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1SA 22" />
  <para style="s">Sauli kankuwalaga watambika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 22:1" />Dawudi kawukiti aku katugira kulipanga pakwegera na mji gwa Adulamu. Wakaka wakuyi na walongu wakuyi wamonga pawapikiniriti handa kapanu, wamgenderiti aku kuwera pamuhera na yomberi. <verse eid="1SA 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 22:2" />Wantu woseri yawayonolitwi ama yawaweriti na uwanda, ama walii wajimiriti ndiri wamjojonikiti Dawudi. Walanga yawu waweriti wantu handa miya msheshi na yomberi kawera mlonguziya gwawu. <verse eid="1SA 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 22:3" />Kulawa aku, Dawudi kagenditi mpaka aku Mizipa isi ya Mowabu. Kamgambira mfalumi gwa Mowabu, “Nikuluwa, tati gwangu na mawu gwangu walikali panu kwaku mpaka nivimani Mlungu hakantendi shishi.” <verse eid="1SA 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 22:4" />Su, Dawudi kawalekiti walera wakuyi walikali na mfalumi gwa Mowabu na womberi walikala kwakuyi shaka shoseri Dawudi paweriti kulimpanga. <verse eid="1SA 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 22:5" />Shakapanu mbuyi Gadi kamgambira Dawudi, “Nagulikala panu kulimpanga, guwuki malayimu gugendi muisi ya Yuda.” Su, Dawudi kawuka, kagenda kulidowi lya Hereti. <verse eid="1SA 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 22:6" />Lishaka limu, Sauli kaweriti Gibea, kalikala pasi pa mkwashu, kulugongu, agawu pakawera na mgoha gwakuyi mliwoku na wantumintumi wakuyi waweriti wagoloka kumbwega kwakuyi. Su wamgambira handa Dawudi na wantu wakuyi wawoneka. <verse eid="1SA 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 22:7" />Na Sauli kawagambira wantumintumi wakuyi, “Vinu mwenga wantu wa likabila lya Benjamini mmpikiniri, hashi mlihola Dawudi ayu mwana gwa Yese hakampanani kila yumu gwenu malambu ga viboga na malambu ga mizabibu? Ama hashi, mlihola hakamtendi kila yumu gwenu mkulu gwa maelufu ama mkulu gwa mamiya ga mashonta? <verse eid="1SA 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 22:8" />Ntambu gaa mawoseri mwenga mng'alambuka? Kwahera ata yumu gwenu yakang'ambira handa mwanagwangu kankutenda lipatanu na Dawudi, kayi kwahera ata yumu yakahinika ama kung'ambira handa Dawudi muntu gwangu mweni vinu kankusakula lupenu lwa kundaga agawu mwanagwangu mweni Yonatani kankumsongiziya.” <verse eid="1SA 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 22:9" />Doegi muntu gwa Edomu, mweni kaweriti kagoloka pakwegera na wantumintumi wa Sauli kalonga, “Nimwoniti mwana gwa Yese pakiza Nobu kwa mtambika Ahimeleki mwana gwa Ahitubu. <verse eid="1SA 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 22:10" />Ahimeleki kamluwiriti Dawudi kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, kampanana shiboga na ligumba lya Mfilisti ulii Goliyati.” <verse eid="1SA 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 22:11" />Mfalumi Sauli kawalagalira wantu wagendi wakamshemi mtambika Ahimeleki mwana gwa Ahitubu, pamuhera na wantu woseri wa walongu wa tati gwakuyi weni waweriti watambika aku Nobu washemuwi. Woseri wamgendera mfalumi Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 22:12" />Sauli kalonga, “Vinu gupikinili gwenga mwana gwa Ahitubu.” Ahimeleki kamwankula, “Yina mtuwa gwangu.” <verse eid="1SA 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 22:13" />Sauli kamgambira, Ntambu gaa gwenga na Dawudi mwana gwa Yese, mlipanga kung'alambuka? “Ntambu gaa mmupananiti mabumunda na ligumba, shakapanu gumluwira kwa Mlungu? Toziya ayi, leru kandeka na kansakula kundaga.” <verse eid="1SA 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 22:14" />Ahimeleki kamwangula, “Pakati pa wantumintumi waku, Dawudi ndo mkulu gwa kwaminika kuliku woseri. Yemberi ndo mganafu gwaku gwenga mfalumi mweni, mkulu gwa shipinga shaku sha wantu yawakulolera gwenga na kagoyilirwa kuliku woseri mkaya mwaku. <verse eid="1SA 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 22:15" />Leru, ndo mala ya kwanja ndiri kumluwa Mlungu shakutenda kwajili yakuyi? Mfalumi, nagunholera neni pota muntu yoseri muwalongu wa tati gwangu kulipanga aga. Neni ntumintumi gwaku. Nivimana ndiri shoseri, shiweri shikulu ama shididini mumlandu agu.” <verse eid="1SA 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 22:16" />Kumbiti mfalumi Sauli kamgambira, “Ahimeleki, nakaka hagulaguwi, gwenga na walongu waku woseri wa tati gwaku.” <verse eid="1SA 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 22:17" />“Sauli kawagambira wayamlolera yawaweriti wagoloka kubwegabwega kwakuyi, Mgalambuki na kuwalaga watambika wa Mtuwa Mlungu, toziya womberi wawera pamuhera na Dawudi; wavimaniti handa katutira pota kung'ambira. Kumbiti walolera awa wanyasula ndiri mawoku gawu su kuwalaga watambika wa Mtuwa Mlungu.” <verse eid="1SA 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 22:18" />Hangu, mfalumi Sauli kamgambira Doegi, “Gwenga gugalambuki gwakawalagi watambika.” Doegi, Mwedomu, kagenda na kuwalaga watambika woseri. Lishaka ali, Doegi kalaga watambika semanini na mhanu weni wavala nguwu yayivalwa pashifuwa shitambika sha nguwu nfunfu. <verse eid="1SA 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 22:19" />Shakapanu kawalagiti kwa makola ga ligumba wenikaya woseri wa Nobu, mji gwa watambika, wapalu na wadala, wana wadidini na yawakonga, wang'ombi, punda na kondolu. <verse eid="1SA 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 22:20" />Kumbiti Abiatari, yumu gwa wana wapalu wa Ahimeleki, mwana gwa Ahitubu, kalipotiti katugira kwa Dawudi. <verse eid="1SA 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 22:21" />Abiatari kamgambira Dawudi kuwera Sauli kawalaga watambika wa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="1SA 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 22:22" />Na Dawudi kamgambira Abiatari, “Nivimaniti lupalahera lishaka lilii panimwoniti Doegi Mwedomu, kuwera hakamgambiri Sauli. Hangu, neni ndo ndenda wantu wa kaya tati gwaku walaguwi. <verse eid="1SA 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 22:23" />Gwenga, gulikali pamuhera na neni, pota kutira. Toziya, yakasakula kuntaga neni kasakula ata kukulaga na gwenga viraa. Paguwera pamuhera na neni, haguponeki.”<verse eid="1SA 22:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="1SA 23" />
  <para style="s">Dawudi kankugulopola mji gwa Keila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 23:1" />Shakapanu Dawudi wamgambiriti, “Gupikinili, Wafilisti wagukomanga mji gwa Keila na wakwapula viboga kuluwaga lwa kukomera.” <verse eid="1SA 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 23:2" />Su, Dawudi kamluwa Mtuwa Mlungu shakutenda, “Hashi, ng'endi kuwakomanga Wafilisti awa?” Mtuwa Mlungu kamwankula, “Yina, gugendi gwakawakomangi Wafilisti na kugulopola mji gwa Keila.”<verse eid="1SA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 23:3" />Kumbiti wantu wa Dawudi wamgambira, “Handa patuwera palapanu Yuda twankutira, hayiweri hashi su, patugenda Keila na kuwakonga wamashonta wa Wafilisti?” <verse eid="1SA 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 23:4" />Dawudi kamluwa kayi shakutenda Mtuwa Mlungu, na Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira, “Gugoloki gugendi Keila toziya hanikutendi guwakanki Wafilisti.” <verse eid="1SA 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 23:5" />Su, Dawudi kagenda Keila pamuhera na wantu wakuyi, na aku kalikomanga na Wafilisti, kawalaga Wafilisti wavuwa na kulopola wang'ombi wavuwa. Hangu Dawudi kalopoliti wenikaya wa Keila.<verse eid="1SA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 23:6" />Abiyatali, mwana gwa Ahimeleki, pakatugiliti kwa Dawudi aku Keila, kagenditi na nguwu ya mtambika yakugibikira pashifuwa. <verse eid="1SA 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 23:7" />Sauli pakagambiluwitwi kuwera Dawudi kasoka kala Keila, kalonga, “Mlungu kamtula mumakakala gangu toziya kalitatira mweni kwa kwingira mumji gwana migomi yana gwiligiziwu.” <verse eid="1SA 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 23:8" />Hangu, Sauli kashemiti wamashonta wagendi Keila na kutenda makomangu, su kumzyengeta Dawudi pamuhera na wantu wakuyi. <verse eid="1SA 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 23:9" />Dawudi pakapikiniriti mipangu mikondola ya Sauli kwajili yakuyi, kamgambira mtambika Abiyatali, “Gujegi panu nguwu ya mtambika ya kugibikira shifuwa.” <verse eid="1SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 23:10" />Sahakapanu Dawudi kaluwa, “Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, nakaka neni ntumintumi gwaku, mpikinira handa Sauli kafira kwiza kwagamiziya mji gwa Keila toziya neni na amu. <verse eid="1SA 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 23:11" />Hashi, wenikaya wa Keila wantaviyi kwa Sauli? Hashi, Sauli hakizi nakaka ntambu yampikiniriti neni ntumintumi gwaku? Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, nikuluwa gwankuli neni ntumintumi gwaku.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:11">Mtuwa Mlungu kamwankula, “Sauli hakizi.” <verse eid="1SA 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 23:12" />Dawudi kamkosiya, “Hashi wanikaya wa Keila hawanjegi kwa Sauli, neni pamuhera na wantu wangu?” Mtuwa Mlungu kamwankula, “Hawakulaviyi kwa yomberi.”<verse eid="1SA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 23:13" />Shakapanu, Dawudi na wantu wakuyi weni waweriti handa miya sita, wawukiti na kugenda poseri pawaweziti kugenda. Sauli pakapikiniriti handa Dawudi katira kala kulawa Keila, kazileka mpanga zakuyi zoseri.<verse eid="1SA 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dawudi muisi ya migongu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 23:14" />Su, Dawudi kasigaliti kumafifu kushiwala, muisi ya migongu ya mbuga za Zifu. Sauli kamsakuliti kila lishaka, kumbiti Mlungu kamtula ndiri mumawoku mwa Shauli. <verse eid="1SA 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 23:15" />Lishaka limu Dawudi pakaweriti pakwegera na Horeshi kapikinira handa Sauli kagenditi Zifu kiza su kamlagi. <verse eid="1SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 23:16" />Yonatani mwana gwa Sauli kamfatiti Dawudi aku Horeshi, kampanana moyu handa Mlungu kankumlolera. <verse eid="1SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 23:17" />Yonatani kamgambira, “Nagutira, tati gwangu Sauli hapeni kakupati. Gwenga haguweri mfalumi gwa israeli, neni haweri gwa pili gwaku muukulu. Ata sauli tati gwangu kavimana mlandu agu.” <verse eid="1SA 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 23:18" />Woseri wawili awa, watenda lipatanu kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. Dawudi kasigala kumjini Horeshi na Yonatani kagenda zakuyi ukaya.<verse eid="1SA 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 23:19" />Sauli pakaweriti kankala aku Gibea, wantu wamu kulawa mji gwa Zifu wamgendera na kumgambira, “Dawudi kalififa muisi ya twenga aku Horeshi, kulugongu Hakila, lwaluwera uwega wa kusika mwa Yeshimoni. <verse eid="1SA 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 23:20" />Vinu, mfalumi, gwizi su gutendi yaviwera mumoyu mwaku, na kwa uwega wa twenga, lihengu lya twenga haliweri kukutanga su gumbati Dawudi.”<verse eid="1SA 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 23:21" />Sauli kawawankula, “Mwenga nakaka mumonera lusungu neni, Mtuwa Mlungu na kawatekeleri. <verse eid="1SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 23:22" />Gugendi, mloli kayi, mmani pahala pakalififa, na ndo gaa kamwona pahala panu, toziya ng'ambiruwa handa yomberi ndo mkalamuka nentu. <verse eid="1SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 23:23" />Mloliloli weri kila uwega muvimani pahala pakalififa, shakapanu mnjegeri visoweru vya nakaka. Shakapanu hang'endi pamuhera na mwenga na payiwera kankali kapalapa, su, neni hanimsakuli muwamu mwa maelufu goseri ga wantu wa Yuda.”<verse eid="1SA 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 23:24" />Su, wawuka kugenda Zifu, pakamlongolera Sauli.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:24">Shaka ashi, Dawudi na wantu wakuyi waweriti mundundu ya Maoni mululalanda lwa Araba kusika mwa Yeshimoni. <verse eid="1SA 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 23:25" />Sauli na wantu wakuyi wanja kumsakula Dawudi. Kumbiti Dawudi pakagambilitwi visoweru avi, kagenditi kulififa kumatalawu, yagawera mumbuga za Maoni na kulikala aku. Sauli pakapikiniriti visoweru avi, kamfatiti Dawudi aku kushiwala za Maoni. <verse eid="1SA 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 23:26" />Sauli na wantu wakuyi waweriti uwega wumu wa lugongu lwa litalawu na Dawudi na wantu wakuyi waweriti uwega umonga wa lugongu. Dawudi pakaweriti kankulopokera kutuga, Sauli na yomberi kaweriti kankumsegelera kumbata Dawudi. <verse eid="1SA 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 23:27" />Panu muntu yumu kamgendera Sauli na kumgambira, “Gwizi kalongola, Wafilisti wankuyikomanga isi.” <verse eid="1SA 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 23:28" />Hangu, Sauli kaleka kumfata Dawudi, kagenda kulikomanga na Wafilisti. Ndo mana pahala panu pashemuwa Sera hamilikoti mana yakuyi litalawu lya kubagulana. <verse eid="1SA 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 23:29" />Dawudi kawukiti pahala panu pa kulififa, kagenda kulikala mumafifu ga mji gwa Engedi.<verse eid="1SA 23:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="1SA 24" />
  <para style="s">Dawudi kankuleka kumlaga Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 24:1" />“Sauli pakawuyiti kulawa kalikomanga nkondu na Wafilisti, kagambiluwa kuwera Dawudi kakushiwala sha Engedi.” <verse eid="1SA 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 24:2" />Shakapanu Sauli kawatoliti mashonta elufu tatu wasyagulwa yawaweriti wagangamala nentu muisi yau yoseri ya Israeli, kagenda kumsakula Dawudi na wantu wakuyi mumatalawu ga mbawala. <verse eid="1SA 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 24:3" />Sauli pakaweriti mumwanja, kasokiti kulipanga limu lyaliweriti pakwegera na lizizi lya kondolu, kingira amu kumpanga su kagendi kumihamba. Dawudi na wantu wakuyi waweriti walikala mngati nentu mwa lipanga ali. <verse eid="1SA 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 24:4" />Wantu wa Dawudi wamgambira, “lishaka lilii lyakakugambiriti Mtuwa Mlungu kuwera hakizi kumtula mnkondu gwaku hanikupanani ukanka na gwenga gumtenderi ntambu yaguwona ifaa, leru isoka.” Dawudi ndo pakamgenderiti Sauli mpolimpoli kulawa kumbeli, kalikitula luwiniku lwa nguwu yakuyi. <verse eid="1SA 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 24:5" />Dawudi moyu gumtama toziya kalikitula luseperu lwa nguwu ya Sauli kwa bada. <verse eid="1SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 24:6" />Kawagambira wantu wakuyi, “Mtuwa Mlungu kandeweleri nanimtendera shitendu handa ashi mtuwa gwangu yakasagulitwi kwa kuswagwa lipaki na Mtuwa Mlungu. Nanilitalipisiya liwoku lyangu kwa muntu mweni Mtuwa Mlungu kamswaga lipaki.” <verse eid="1SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 24:7" />Kwa visoweru avi, Dawudi kawazyangazyanga wantu wakuyi nawamtenda Sauli, kawaberiti nawamkomanga. Shakapanu Sauli kagoloka, kalawa kulipanga keganda zakuyi. <verse eid="1SA 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 24:8" />Shakapanu, Dawudi na yomberi kagoloka, kalawa kulipanga na kumshema Sauli, “Mtuwa gwangu mfalumi!” Mfalumi Sauli pakaloliti kumbeli, Dawudi kang'ong'onala mpaka pasi, kampanana ligoya Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 24:9" />Shakapanu kamgambira, “Toziya guwapikinira wantu yawakupikinira, guloli! Dawudi kafira kukulaga? <verse eid="1SA 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 24:10" />Vinu guloli leru, leru guliwonera kwa masu gaku gamweni, paguweriti kulipanga Mtuwa Mlungu kakutuliti mmakakala gangu. Wamu wa wantu wa neni wang'ambiriti nikulagi, kumbiti nikuwoniliti lusungu. Ntakula hapeni ntalipisiyi liwoku lyangu kwa mtuwa gwangu toziya yomberi kasyagulitwi na Mtuwa Mlungu kwa kuswagwa lipaki. <verse eid="1SA 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 24:11" />Tati gwangu, guloli luwiniku lwa nguwu lwaku pota kukulaga, guweza vinu kuvimana kwa nakaka handa neni namkondola ndiri pota ukondola. Neni hanenitendi vidoda kwa gwenga tembera gwenga gunsakula gundagi. <verse eid="1SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 24:12" />Mtuwa Mlungu na kaamuwi pakati pa twenga, na gwenga. Yomberi kakuwuziliri kumbiti neni nakamu hapeni ntalipisiyi liwoku lyangu kwa gwenga. <verse eid="1SA 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 24:13" />Kumbiti wantu wa makashu walongiti, kwa makontola kulawa ukondola, kumbiti hapeni ntalipisiyi liwoku kwa gwenga nukutendi. <verse eid="1SA 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 24:14" />Vinu gwenga mfalumi gwa Israeli guloli muntu yagufira kumlaga! Hashi, gumfata gaa? Gumfata ng'ang'a yakafuwiti ama gumfata mbapani! <verse eid="1SA 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 24:15" />Su, Mtuwa Mlungu na kaweri mwamlira pakati pangu na gwenga. Yomberi na kaguloli mlandu agu, kanteteyi na kanopuziya kulawa kwaku.” <verse eid="1SA 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 24:16" />Dawudi pakamaliliti kulonga, Sauli kalonga, “Hashi, ali ndo liziwu lyaku mwana gwangu Dawudi?” Shauli kalira kwa kubotanga. <verse eid="1SA 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 24:17" />Shakapanu kamgambira Dawudi, “Gwenga gwana lusungu kuliku neni, gundipa maheri, tembera neni nikulipa makontola. <verse eid="1SA 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 24:18" />Leru, gunanguziya ntambu yaguweriti mheri kwa neni. Tembera Mtuwa Mlungu kakupanana lupeni lwa kundaga. <verse eid="1SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 24:19" />Hashi, muntu pakambata mnkondu gwakuyi hakamleki hera hangu? Kwa shilii shagumtenderiti, Mtuwa Mlungu kakutekeleri! <verse eid="1SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 24:20" />Vinu nivimana handa nakaka haguweri mfalumi gwa Israeli na ufalumi wa Israeli haugangamiziwi mumawoku gaku. <verse eid="1SA 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 24:21" />Kumbiti gunapili kwa litawu lya Mtuwa Mlungu handa hapeni gulyaluwi nakamu wiwuka wa neni, su litawu lya neni muwalongu wangu naguliwusiya.” <verse eid="1SA 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 24:22" />Dawudi kamlapira Sauli. Shakapanu Sauli kawuya ukaya kwakuyi, kumbiti Dawudi na wantu wakuyi wagenda kumafifu.<verse eid="1SA 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="1SA 25" />
  <para style="s">Samueli kankuhowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 25:1" />Vinu, Samueli kahowiti, na Waisraeli woseri wajojonika su kumdaya. Wamsira ukaya kwakuyi aku Rama.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="1SA 25:1">Dawudi na Abigaili</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 25:1">Shakapanu Dawudi kagenda zakuyi kundundu Kuparani. <verse eid="1SA 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 25:2" />Kuweriti na muntu yumu aku kumjini Maoni mweni kaweriti mshuuzi gwa kondolu kumjini Karimeli. Aku Karimeli kafugiti kondolu wakuyi na kawamoga mibahila. Kaweriti mlunda mali nentu. Kaweriti na kondolu elufu tatu na mbuzi elufu yimu. <verse eid="1SA 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 25:3" />Muntu ayu wamshemiti Nabali na mdala gwakuyi kashemitwi Abigaili. Abigaili kaweriti mdala kana mahala na kaherepa. Kumbiti Nabali kaweriti muntu gwa shuki na mkondola kayi kaweriti gwa lukolu lwa Karebu.<verse eid="1SA 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 25:4" />Su, Dawudi pakaweriti kundundu aku kapikiniriti handa Nabali kaweriti kankuwamoga kondolu wakuyi mibahira aku Karimeli. <verse eid="1SA 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 25:5" />“Hangu, kawatuma wantemba lilongu, kawagambira, mgendi kwa Nabali aku Karimeli mwakamlamsiyi.” <verse eid="1SA 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 25:6" />Mwakamgambiri hangu, “Dawudi kakulamsiyi. Ponga iweri kwa gwenga, kwa walongu waku na woseri yaguwera nawa. <verse eid="1SA 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 25:7" />Mpikinira handa gwankuwamoga mibahila kondolu waku nfira guvimani handa walolera waku waweriti pamuhera na twenga na twenga hapeni tutendi madoda. Kayi shaka shoseri pawaweriti pamuhera na twenga kumjini Karimeli, wakosa ndiri shoseri. <verse eid="1SA 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 25:8" />Paguwakosiya, hawakugambili. Vinu nikuluwa wantemba wangu awa wapati shibali kulongolu kwaku, toziya tusoka shaka sha msambu. Shondi guwapanani shoseri shaguwera nashi wantumintumi waku awa na neni mwana gwaku Dawudi.” <verse eid="1SA 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 25:9" />Wantemba walii wa Dawudi wagenditi na kumgambira Nabali ntambu yawalagaliritwi na Dawudi. Shakapanu wahepera shidididni. <verse eid="1SA 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 25:10" />Nabali kawankula wantumintumi wa Dawudi, “Dawudi ndo gaa? Mwana gwa Yese ndo gaa? Mashaka aga kwana wantumintumi wavuwa yawawatira watuwa wawu. <verse eid="1SA 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 25:11" />Hashi, ntoli mabumunda gangu, mashi gangu na vinofu vyaniwatuliriti wamoga mibahila ya kondolu wangu na kuwapanana ata mani kwawalawa.”<verse eid="1SA 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 25:12" />Su, wantemba wa Dawudi walii wawuyiti na kumgambira Dawudi ntambu yawagambilitwi. <verse eid="1SA 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 25:13" />Hangu Dawudi kawagambira wantu wakuyi, “Kila muntu na kalitawi ligumba lyakuyi mshunu.” Kila muntu kalitawa ligumba lyakuyi, na Dawudi viraa kalitawa ligumba lyakuyi' wantu miya msheshi wamfata Dawudi na wantu miya mbili wasigala na visanka.<verse eid="1SA 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 25:14" />Mndemba yumu gwa Nabali, kamgambira Abigaili, mdala gwakuyi Nabali, “Dawudi katuma walagilagi kulawa kundundu su kumlamsiya mtuwa gwetu. Kumbiti yomberi kawawigiriliti. <verse eid="1SA 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 25:15" />Kumbiti wantu awa waweriti waheli nentu kwa twenga, watutendera ndiri madoda, na shaka shoseri patuweriti nawa aku kundundu kwahera shoseri shashihowiti. <verse eid="1SA 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 25:16" />Kwa twenga, waweriti walolera pashiru na paliwala shaka shoseri patuweriti twankulolera kondolu. <verse eid="1SA 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 25:17" />Vinu guliholi kuusu mlandu agu na gwamuwi lya kutenda. Mlandu agu guweza kujega vitwatira kwa mtuwa gwentu na walongu wakuyi woseri. Yomberi ndo muntu mndewu na kwahera muntu yakaweza kuyowera na yomberi.”<verse eid="1SA 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 25:18" />Abigaili katenda kalongola, katola mabumunda miya mbili, mihaku yalikuli miwili ya divayi, mikunguwi miya ya zabibu ziyuma, mabumunda ga tini miya mbili, na vintu vyoseri avi kavipapiziya mpunda. <verse eid="1SA 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 25:19" />Kamgambira mndemba gwakuyi ulii, “Gulongoleri! Neni hanikufati.” Kumbiti kamgambira ndiri mpalu gwakuyi shoseri. <verse eid="1SA 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 25:20" />Pakaweriti kankuselera, kakwena punda gwakuyi na kushigwa na lugongu uwega wumu, kaliwona vumu na Dawudi na wantu wakuyi pawawera wankugenda uwega kwakalawiti. <verse eid="1SA 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 25:21" />Dawudi kaweriti kankulihola, “Neni nweriti nankulolera lunda yoseri ya Nabali kundundu pota mota yoseri na kwahera shintu shakuyi shoseri shashihowiti na yomberi kandipa madoda kwa maheri ganimtenderiti. <verse eid="1SA 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 25:22" />Mlungu kandagi neni payiwera shirawu mandawira haneniwalagi wapalu wakuyi woseri.” <verse eid="1SA 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 25:23" />Abigaili pakamwoniti hera Dawudi, kasuluka kalongola kulawa kumpindi kwakuyi na kung'ong'onala kulongolu kwa Dawudi mpaka sheni shakuyi shishingula pasi. <verse eid="1SA 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 25:24" />Kalyasiti pamagulu ga Dawudi na kumgambira, “Mtuwa gwangu, likosa lyoseri liweri kwa neni hera. Nduwa noweri na gwenga neni ntumintumi gwaku. Nikuluwa gupikinili visoweru vya ntumintumi gwaku. <verse eid="1SA 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 25:25" />Nagumholera Nabali mweni ndo muntu mdoda toziya ntambu yaliwera litawu lyakuyi Nabali, ndo ntambu yakawera. Yomberi wamshema Nabali na nakaka yomberi ndo muntu mngali mahala. Mtuwa gwangu, wantemba waku paguwatumiti, neni ntumintumi gwaku nuwawoniti ndiri. <verse eid="1SA 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 25:26" />Su mtuwa gwangu, nililapa kwa Mtuwa Mlungu yakawera Mkomu na ntambu yakawera mkomu, handa toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kakulewelera naguwuzilira kwa kwita mwazi mweni gwenga, guwaleki wankondu waku na woseri walii yawakufilira madoda waweri wahera mahala gambira Nabali. <verse eid="1SA 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 25:27" />Mtuwa gwangu, nikuluwa gutoli lifupu ali lyanakujegeriti na guwapanani wantemba yawakufata. <verse eid="1SA 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 25:28" />Nduwa gunekiziyi neni ntumintumi gwaku. Mtuwa Mlungu hakakutendi guweri mfalumi na wiwuka viraa, gwenga mtuwa gwangu, gwankulikomanga nkondu ya Mtuwa Mlungu, shaka shoseri sha ukomu waku guwoneka na shidoda shoseri. Ama shaka shoseri sha ukomu waku hapeni gutendi shoseri shashiwera shikontola. <verse eid="1SA 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 25:29" />Pawalawira wantu wakufata na kufira kuwagamiziya ukomu waku, Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwaku, hakauponiziyi ukomu waku pamuhera na yawawera wakomu. Kumbiti ukomu wa wankondu waku hauwasiluwi kutali kalongola, handa muntu yakasa libuwi kwa vombelo. <verse eid="1SA 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 25:30" />Pa Mtuwa Mlungu kakutendera maheri goseri gakakugambiliti na kukusyagula kuwera mkolamlima gwa Israeli, <verse eid="1SA 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 25:31" />gwenga mtuwa gwangu, hapeni guweri na toziya ya kujuta pota kulipikinira vidoda kulawirana na kwita mwazi pota toziya ya kuwuzilira. Kumbiti, mtuwa gwangu, Mtuwa Mlungu pakawera kakutendera maheri aga, nikuluwa gunholi neni ntumintumi gwaku.”<verse eid="1SA 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 25:32" />Dawudi kamgambira Abigaili, “Kakwiswi Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, yakakutumiti leru kuliwona na neni. <verse eid="1SA 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 25:33" />Nonga mayagashi Mtuwa Mlungu yakakupananiti luhala kwa kundewelera kuwera na likosa lya kwita mwazi na kuliwuzilira neni namweni. <verse eid="1SA 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 25:34" />Kwa nakaka, Mtuwa Mlungu gwa israeli, kandewelera naniwalaga. Megutendi ndiri kalongola kwiza kuliwona na neni, kwa nakaka, shirawu mandawira kwahera mpalu yoseri gwa Nabali na wantu wakuyi mewasigali wakomu.” <verse eid="1SA 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 25:35" />Shakapanu, Dawudi kanka vintu vyoseri vyeni Abigaili kaweriti kamjegera, kamgambira Abigaili, “Guwuyi ukaya kwaku kwa ponga. Guloli, mpikinira gagutakuliti na kuluwa kwaku nikwanka.”<verse eid="1SA 25:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 25:36" />Abigaili pakawuyiti ukaya, kamwoniti Nabali kankutenda msambu mkulu ukaya kwakuyi handa gwa mfalumi. Nabani kaweriti kalinemiziya nentu mumoyu toziya kaweriti kalowera nentu. Hangu kamgambira ndiri shoseri mpaka mandawira. <verse eid="1SA 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 25:37" />Mandawira, Abigaili pakawoniti mpalu gwakuyi divayi imuwuka, kamgambira mirandu yoseri na palapalii Nabali kalilimuka na kaleweleka, kawera handa libuwi. <verse eid="1SA 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 25:38" />Mashaka lilongu shakapanu, Mtuwa Mlungu kamkomiti Nabali kahowa.<verse eid="1SA 25:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 25:39" />“Dawudi pakapikiniriti handa Nabali kahowa, kalonga, Kakwiswi Mtuwa Mlungu mweni kamwuzilira Nabali kwa kunigiranga na yomberi Mtuwa Mlungu kanewelera neni ntumintumi gwakuyi kutenda makontola. Mtuwa Mlungu kamtoza Nabali kwa ukondola wakuyi. Shakapanu Dawudi katumiti wantu su wamyugiri Abigaili kaweri mdala gwakuyi.” <verse eid="1SA 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 25:40" />Wantumintumi wa Dawudi pawasokiti kwa Abigaili aku Karimeli, wamgambira, “Dawudi katutuma kukutola su guweri mdala gwakuyi.”<verse eid="1SA 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 25:41" />Abigaili kagolokiti na kung'ong'onala kulongolu kwawu mpaka pasi, kalonga, “Neni ndo ntumintumi hera na kala kugulula magulu ga wantumintumi wa mtuwa gwangu.” <verse eid="1SA 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 25:42" />Abigaili katenditi kalongola, kagoloka na kukwena pampindi pa punda gwakuyi, pakalifata na wantumintumi wakuyi wadala mhanu, kagenda na wantumintumi wa Dawudi na yomberi kawera mdala gwa Dawudi.<verse eid="1SA 25:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 25:43" />Kayi Dawudi kaweriti kamyuga Ahinoamu kulawa Yezireeli. Hangu wawili awa wawera wadala wakuyi. <verse eid="1SA 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 25:44" />Shaka ashi, Sauli kaweriti kamyugiziya mhinga gwakuyi mikali, mweni kaweriti mdala gwa Dawudi, kwa Paliti mwana gwa Laishi, kulawa mji gwa Galimu.<verse eid="1SA 25:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="1SA 26" />
  <para style="s">Dawudi kaleka kumlaga kayi Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 26:1" />“Wamu wa wapalu kulawa mji gwa Zifu wamgenderiti Sauli aku Gibea wamgambira handa Dawudi kaweriti kalififa kulugongu Hakila, yayililolana na Yeshimoni.” <verse eid="1SA 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 26:2" />Katepu hera, Sauli kagenditi kundundu ya Zifu kumsakula Dawudi pakawera na mashonta yawawera ndiri na lyoga elufu tatu wa israeli. <verse eid="1SA 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 26:3" />Sauli kagolosiya ngonjeru pampindi pa lugongu Hakila, pakwegera na njira, kwagulawa mshenji mwa Yeshimoni. Kumbiti Dawudi kaweriti kankali kundundu aku. Kavimaniti handa Sauli kaweriti kizi kundundu kumsakula, <verse eid="1SA 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 26:4" />kawatumiti walolalola, wamgambira kuwera handa ndo nakaka kasoka. <verse eid="1SA 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 26:5" />Dawudi kalawa, kagenda pahala Sauli pakagolusiyiti ngonjeru. Kapawona pahala peni Sauli pakagolusiyiti ngonjeru. Kapawoniti pahala Sauli pakaweriti kagonja na Abineri mwana gwa Neri, mkulu gwa Shonta lya Sauli, kaweriti kagonja pakwegera na Sauli. Sauli kaweriti kagonja pakati pangonjeru agawu pakazyengetwa na shonta lyakuyi. <verse eid="1SA 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 26:6" />Dawudi kamgambira Ahimeleki mweni kaweriti Mhiti na Abishai mlongu gwakuyi Yoabu awa mawu gwawu wamshemiti Seruya, “Na gaa hakagendi pamuhera na neni kulugonjeru lya Sauli?” Abishai kamgambira, “Neni hang'endi pamuhera na gwenga.” <verse eid="1SA 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 26:7" />Hangu pashiru, Dawudi na Abishai pawawingiriti jiijii kung'onjeru ya Sauli, wamwona Sauli kagonja pakati pa ng'onjeru ayu na mgoha gwakuyi gusomwa mlitapaka pakwegera na mtuyi gwakuyi. Abineri pamuhera na shonta waweliti wagonja kumzyengeta Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 26:8" />Abishai kamgambira Dawudi, “Leru Mlungu kamtula mumakakala gaku. Su, gundeki nimbabaniki mlitapaka kwa likomangu limu hera lya mgoha, hapeni nimkomi mala mbili.” <verse eid="1SA 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 26:9" />Kumbiti Dawudi kamgambira Abishai, “Nagumlaga, toziya nakaka Mtuwa Mlungu hakamtozi muntu yoseri yakafira kulitalipisiya liwoku lyakuyi kwa msyagulwa gwakuyi yakamswagiti kuwera mfalumi. <verse eid="1SA 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 26:10" />Yina kwa Mtuwa Mlungu yakawera mkomu, Handa Mtuwa Mlungu mweni hakamlagi Sauli, ama lishaka lyakuyi lya kuhowa halisoki, ama hakagendi kungondu na kuhowera aku. <verse eid="1SA 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 26:11" />Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kambera nanjera kumtenda yakamsyagula kwa kuswaga lipaki. Kumbiti tutoli mgoha gwaku yaguwera pakwegera na mtuwi gwakuyi pamuhera na shibuyu shakuyi sha mashi, tugendi zetu.” <verse eid="1SA 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 26:12" />Hangu, Dawudi katoliti mgoha gulii na shibuyu sha mashi pakwegera na mtuwi gwa Sauli na yomberi kaligendera zakuyi. Kumbiti kwahera muntu yakawoniti ama kuvimana shisoweru ashi na kwahera yakimukiti, toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kawajegeriti mpota nkulu. <verse eid="1SA 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 26:13" />Shakapanu, Dawudi kagenda uwega wa pili wa lulalanda alu, kagoloka pampindi kulugongu kutali na shipinga sha Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 26:14" />Kalishema kwa kubota shonta lya Sauli na Abineri mwana gwa Neri pakalonga, “Abineri, Hashi, gumpikinira? Abineri kakosiya, Ndo gaa gwenga yagumshema mfalumi?” <verse eid="1SA 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 26:15" />Dawudi kamwankula, “Hashi, gwenga gwa mpalu ndiri? Gaa yakawera sawa na gwenga Muisraeli? Mbona su, gumlolera ndiri mfalumi gwaku? Muntu tunga kingira palii kumlaga mtuwa gwaku mfalumi! <verse eid="1SA 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 26:16" />Gwagugutenditi ndo mlandu mheri ndiri. Nililapa kwa Mtuwa Mlungu yakawera Mkomu, handa gufiruwa kuhowa, toziya gumlolera ndiri mtuwa gwaku, mweni Mtuwa Mlungu kamswaga lipaki. Vinu su guloli, mgoha gwa mfalumi na shibuyu sha mashi vyaviweriti pakwegera na mtuwi gwakuyi handa vyapala!” <verse eid="1SA 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 26:17" />Sauli kavimaniti liziwu lya Dawudi, kamkosiya, “Hashi, ali ndo liziwu lyaku mwanagwangu Dawudi?” Dawudi kamwankula, “Mtuwa Gwangu, mfalumi, ndo liziwu lyangu.” <verse eid="1SA 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 26:18" />Shakapanu kendereya kulonga, “Kumbiti kwa ntambu gaa, gwenga Mtuwa gwangu, gwendereya gunfati neni ntumintumi gwaku? Ndenda shishi? Nikutendera ukondola gaa? <verse eid="1SA 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 26:19" />Su, vinu mtuwa gwangu mfalumi, gupikinili visoweru vya ntumintumi gwaku. Payiwera Mtuwa Mlungu ndo yakakusongiziyiti gwizi kwa neni, su na kanki tambiku yaifira kumtendera kagalambuli nfiru yakuyi su guleki kunfata. Kumbiti handa ndo wantu, su Mtuwa Mlungu na kawapangili wantu awa toziya wawawinga kulawa muuhala wakatupanananiti Mtuwa Mlungu pawalonga, payiwera wantu pawalonga gugendi gwakawatenderi wamlungu wamonga. <verse eid="1SA 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 26:20" />Nagundeka nfuwi muisi ya wahenga, kutali na Mtuwa Mlungu. Ntambu gaa gwenga mfalumi gwa Israeli gulawa kuusakula ukomu wangu handa muntu yakawinga ngwali mumigongu?” <verse eid="1SA 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 26:21" />Sauli kamwankula, “Neni ndenda makosa. Guwuyi mwanagwangu Dawudi. Hapeni nikutenda kayi toziya leru ukomu wangu uweriti wa mana kulongolu kwaku. Neni nwera mpunginika na nkosa nentu.” <verse eid="1SA 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 26:22" />Dawudi kamwankula, “Gwee mfalumi, mgoha gwaku gwa panu, gumtumi shonta gwaku yumu kizi kagutoli. <verse eid="1SA 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 26:23" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamlolera kila muntu yakatenda yagajimiluwa kulongolu kwakuyi na yakaminika na muntu yakajimilika kulongolu kwa Mlungu. Leru Mtuwa Mlungu kakutuliti mumawoku mwangu, kumbiti njeriti ndiri kukulaga gwenga toziya gwenga gusyagulwa na yomberi kwa kuswagwa lipaki. <verse eid="1SA 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 26:24" />Nakaka niusheriti ukomu waku leru, su Mtuwa Mlungu hakausheri ukomu wa neni na kunopuziya kulawa muntabiku zoseri.” <verse eid="1SA 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 26:25" />Sauli kamgambira Dawudi, “Mlungu na kakutekeleri mwana gwangu Dawudi. Hagutendi vitwatira vikulu na gwenga hagukangi muvyoseri.” Su, Dawudi kagenda zakuyi, Sauli yomberi kawuya ukaya kwakuyi.<verse eid="1SA 26:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="1SA 27" />
  <para style="s">Dawudi kalikala kwa Wafilisti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 27:1" />Dawudi kalitakulira mweni, “Lishaka limu, Sauli hakantagi. Mlandu mheri kwa neni ndo kutugira muisi ya Wafilisti. Sauli hakatwezuki kunsakula mngati mwa mumbaka za isi ya Israeli na neni haweri mboneki.” <verse eid="1SA 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 27:2" />Hangu, Dawudi na wantu wakuyi miya sita wagenda kwa Akishi mwana gwa Maoki, mfalumi gwa Gati. <verse eid="1SA 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 27:3" />Dawudi na wantu wakuyi pamuhera na walongu wakuyi walikala na Akishi aku Gati. Dawudi kaweriti na wadala wawili. Ahinoamu kulawa Yezireeli na Abigaili mdala mkenja gwa Nabali kulawa mji gwa Karimeli. <verse eid="1SA 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 27:4" />Sauli pakapikiniriti handa Dawudi katugira Gati, kamfata ndiri kayi.<verse eid="1SA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 27:5" />Lishaka limu, Dawudi kamgambira Akishi, “Handa pagunjimilira nikuluwa gumpanani mji gumu muisi mwaku su guweri pahala pa neni pa kulikala. Kwahera toziya kwa neni kulikala na gwenga mumji agu yagulikala gwenga mfalumi.” <verse eid="1SA 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 27:6" />Lishaka ali, Akishi kampanana mji gwa Sikilagi. Hangu, kwanjira lishaka ali mji gwa Sikilagi guweriti gwa wafalumi wa Yuda.<verse eid="1SA 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 27:7" />Dawudi kalikaliti muisi ya Wafilisti kwa shinja shimu na miezi msheshi. <verse eid="1SA 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 27:8" />Mulishaka ali, Dawudi na wantu wakuyi wawakomangiti Wageshuri na Wagirizi na Waamaleki, weni waweriti wenikaya wa isi ayi kwanjira makashu. Wawakomangiti muisi yawu mpaka Shuri, mumbaka na Misri. <verse eid="1SA 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 27:9" />Dawudi kapakomangiti mji agu kamleka ndiri mkomu muntu yoseri, kaweri mpalu ama mdala, kalopola kondolu na ng'ombi na punda na ngamiya na nguwu, shakapanu kawuya na kusoka kwa Akishi. <verse eid="1SA 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 27:10" />Akishi pakamkosiyiti Dawudi, “Leru makomangu gaku gaweriti kwa ashina gaa?” Dawudi kampayira kwa kamgambira, “Enewu lya kusika ya Yuda ama kusika ya Wayerameeli ama Kusika ya isi yawalikala Wakeni.” <verse eid="1SA 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 27:11" />Dawudi kamleka ndiri muntu yoseri mkomu kaweri mpalu ama mdala su kajeguwi Gati, kalitakulira mweni, “Waweza kutakulira kwa twenga na kulonga, Dawudi katenda shitendu ashi na shilii.” Hangu ndo Dawudi ntambu yakazoweleriti kutenda shaka shoseri pakalikaliti muisi ya Wafilisti. <verse eid="1SA 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 27:12" />Hangu, Akishi kamjimiriti Dawudi, pakahowa, “Wanalushi wayaguwi Waisraeli wamfira ndiri nakamu, hangu, hakantenderi makaliru gakuyi goseri.”<verse eid="1SA 27:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="1SA 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 28:1" />Pa shaka tunga, Wafilisti wajojoniriti mashonta gawu kala kugenda kulikomanga na Waisraeli. Akishi kamgambira Dawudi, “Guvimani weri handa gwenga na wantu waku mfiruwa kugenda pamuhera na neni kulikomanga nkondu.” <verse eid="1SA 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 28:2" />Dawudi kamwankula Akishi, “Yina! Haguwoni shintu sheni ntumintumi gwaku kaweza kutenda.” Akishi kamgambira, “Na neni hanikutendi kuwera mlolera gwangu namweni gwa muukomu wangu.”<verse eid="1SA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli kagenda kutunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 28:3" />Shaka ashi, Samueli kaweriti kahowiti kala na Waisraeli woseri waweriti wadaya kala na kumfindira kumji gwakuyi gwa Rama. Sauli kaweriti kawawinga kulawa muisi ya watunga na wahawi woseri. <verse eid="1SA 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 28:4" />Wafilisti wajojonikiti na kunyawa ng'onjeru zawu aku Shunemu, na Sauli kawajojoniriti Waisraeli woseri na kunyawa ng'onjeru zawu kulugongu Giliboa. <verse eid="1SA 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 28:5" />Sauli pakawoniti shonta lya Wafilisti kanjiti kutira, kanja kulendemera kwa lyoga lyakaweriti nali mumoyu mwakuyi. <verse eid="1SA 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 28:6" />Ata pakamluwiti Mtuwa Mlungu Shisoweru, Mtuwa Mlungu kamwankula ndiri kwa kulota pota kwa mabuwi ga kukosilira nfiru ya Mlungu yagashemwa Urimu na Tumimu na pota kwa njira ya mambuyi. <verse eid="1SA 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 28:7" />Sauli ndo kawagambira wantumintumi wakuyi, “Munsakuliri mdala mweni yakaweza kutunga su nimgenderi na kumluwa kampanani shisoweru.” Wantumintumi wakuyi wamwankula, “Kwana mtunga yumu aku Endori.” <verse eid="1SA 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 28:8" />Su, Sauli kaligalambula na kuvala nguwu zimonga su nakamanika kuwera ndo mfalumi, kagenda aku pamuhera na wantu wakuyi wawili. Wasoka kwa mdala ayu pashiru, kamgambira, “Guntungili kwa mahoka, gumjegi pasipanu yoseri hanikukandiri.” <verse eid="1SA 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 28:9" />Mdala ulii kamgambira, “Gwenga guvimana nakaka kuwera mfalumi Sauli kawawusiya watunga na wahawi woseri muisi ya Israeli. Vinu ntambu gaa gunyambira su nfuwi?” <verse eid="1SA 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 28:10" />Sauli kamlapira kwa litawu lya Mtuwa Mlungu, pakalonga, “Nililapa kwa Mtuwa Mlungu yakawera mkomu, handa kwahera toza yoseri hayikupati kulawirana na mlandu agu.” <verse eid="1SA 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 28:11" />Mdala ulii kamkosiya, “Hashi, nikujegeri gaa kulawa aku kwawahowiti?” Sauli kankula, “Gunjegeri Samueli.” <verse eid="1SA 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 28:12" />Mdala ulii pakamwoniti Samueli kagutanga, kamgambira Sauli, “Ntambu gaa gumpayira? Gwenga ndo mfalumi Sauli!” <verse eid="1SA 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 28:13" />Mfalumi Sauli kamgambira, Nagutira “Guwona shishi?” Mdala ulii kamwankula, “Nimwona lihoka kankulawa mulitapaka.” <verse eid="1SA 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 28:14" />Sauli kamgambira mdala, “Ndo mfanu gwa shishi?” Mdala ulii kamgambira, “Mpalu mzewi kankukwena pampindi, na yomberi kalizyengetiziya lihabiti.” Panu, Sauli kavimana handa ayu ndo Samueli. Sauli kang'ong'onala mpaka pasi kwa kumpanana ligoya. <verse eid="1SA 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 28:15" />Samueli kamgambira Sauli, Ntambu gaa gung'aziya kwa kunjega pampindi? Sauli kankula, “Neni nankutabika nentu! Wafilisti wankulikomanga nkondu na neni na Mlungu kandeka, kanankula ndiri kayi kwanjira ya wambuyi pota kwa kulota. Ndo mana nikushema gung'ambaziyi ntendi hashi.” <verse eid="1SA 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 28:16" />Samueli kalonga, “Ntambu gaa gunduwa shisoweru sheni Mtuwa Mlungu kakulema na kawera mnkondu gwaku? <verse eid="1SA 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 28:17" />Mtuwa Mlungu kakuntendera shili shakakugambiriti kwa njira ya neni. Mtuwa Mlungu, kautola ufalumi kulawa kwaku na kampanana Dawudi mnkondu gwaku. <verse eid="1SA 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 28:18" />Toziya, gwenga gulijimira ndiri liziwu lya Mtuwa Mlungu, kugatenda ndiri galii Mtuwa Mlungu kakugambiriti kuwalaga Waameleki. Ndo mana leru Mtuwa Mlungu kakutendera mirandu ayi. <verse eid="1SA 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 28:19" />Nentu ya aga, Mtuwa Mlungu hakakulekeri gwenga pamuhera na Waisraeli woseri wasindi na Wafilisti. Shirawu, gwenga na wana waku hamuweri pamuhera na neni, ata shonta lya Israeli Mtuwa Mlungu hakawatendi wasindi na Wafilisti.” <verse eid="1SA 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 28:20" />Vumu, Sauli pakawera na lyoga kulawirana na visoweru vya Samueli, kaguwa makukama, kawera ndiri na likakala lyoseri, toziya kaweriti kaliya ndiri shoseri kwa lishaka lyoseri, pashiru na paliwa. <verse eid="1SA 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 28:21" />“Mdala ulii ndo pakamgenderiti Sauli na kumwona kuwera Sauli kaniti lyoga nentu, kamgambira, ntumintumi gwaku niutuliti ukomu wangu pakwegera na kuhowa kwa kutenda shilii shagung'ambiriti nikutenderi. <verse eid="1SA 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 28:22" />Vinu, gumpikiniri neni ntumintumi gwaku, hanikutandiri shiboga su guliyi na gwenga haguweri na makakala ga kwendeleya na mwanja gwaku.” <verse eid="1SA 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 28:23" />Sauli kalemiti na kulonga, hapeni ndiyi. “Kumbiti wantumintumi pamuhera na mdala ulii, wazyangazyanga kaliyi na yomberi kawapikinira. Hangu kagolokiti kulawa pasi na kalivaga pashitanda.” <verse eid="1SA 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 28:24" />Mdala ulii kaweriti na ng'ombi shididini yakanenipiti yumu ukaya, katenda kalongola kamlikitula, katola ubumu wa nganu, kaukabanga, katenda libumunda lyalilekeluwa ndiri simika. <verse eid="1SA 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 28:25" />Kampanana Sauli, kawapanana viraa na wantumintumi wakuyi na womberi waliya. Shakapanu wawuka na kugenda zawu pashiru panu.<verse eid="1SA 28:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1SA 29" />
  <para style="s">Dawudi kalemwa na Wafilisti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 29:1" />Wafilisti wajojoniliriti mashonta gawu goseri aku Afeka, na Waisraeli wagolosiyiti ng'onjeru kubwiru ya lilalanda lwa Yezireeli. <verse eid="1SA 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 29:2" />Wakulu wamhanu wa Wafilisti pawaweriti wankupita na vipinga vyawu vya mamiya na maelufu, Dawudi na yomberi pakawera na wantu wakuyi pamuhera na Akishi waweriti wankufata uwega wa kumbeli wa shonta ali. <verse eid="1SA 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 29:3" />“Wakulu wa Wafilisti wakosiyiti, Waebraniya awa wankutenda shishi panu? Akishi kawawankula, ayu ndo Dawudi, ntumintumi gwa Sauli mfalumi gwa Israeli na yomberi kawera na neni kwa mivinja miviwa. Kwanjira pakatugiliti kwa neni, hanemwoni na shidoda shoseri.” <verse eid="1SA 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 29:4" />Kumbiti wakulu wa Wafilisti wamkalaliriti nentu Akishi, wamgambira, “Mmuwuziyi kagendi pahala kwagumpanananiti kalikali. Nakaka nakagenda pamuhera na twenga kunkondu, hera hangu shaka sha nkondu hakagalambuki na kuwera mnkondu gwetu. Guwona ndiri handa muntu ayu hakapati njira iherepa ya kupatana na mtuwa gwakuyi shakapanu kuwera mnkondu gwetu kunkondu? <verse eid="1SA 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 29:5" />Hashi Ayu ndo Dawudi ulaulii mweni wadala wimbiti visoweru vyakuyi pawaweriti wankuvina, Sauli kalaga maelufu, kumbiti Dawudi kalaga maelufu lilongu.”<verse eid="1SA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 29:6" />Akishi kamshema Dawudi na kumgambira, “Nililapa kwa Mtuwa Mlungu yakawera mkomu, hangu guwera mwaminika kwaneni. Meguweri mlandu mheri kwa neni tugendi twawoseri munkondu, toziya haneniwoni shoseri shidoda kwa gwenga kwanjira lishaka lilii pagwiziti kwa neni mpaka leru ayi. Ata hangu, wakulu wayangu haweni jimirani na gwenga. <verse eid="1SA 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 29:7" />Hangu vinu, guwuyi ukaya. Gugendi kwa ponga su naguwakalaziya wakulu wa Wafilisti.”<verse eid="1SA 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 29:8" />Dawudi kamgambira Akishi, “Kumbiti ntenda shishi? Gambira ntambu yagulonga kuwera, gumona ndiri na shidoda shoseri kwanjira lishaka lilii pananjiti kukutendera mpaka leru, Ntambu gaa ng'endi ndiri kulikomanga na wankondu wa mtuwa gwangu mfalumi?”<verse eid="1SA 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 29:9" />“Akishi kamgambira, nivimana kuwera gwamheri kulongolu kwa neni handa ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kwa Mlungu. Ata hangu, wakulu wa Wafilisti walonga, nakaka nakagenda pamuhera na twenga kunkondu. <verse eid="1SA 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 29:10" />Vinu, gwenga pamuhera na wantumintumi wa mtuwa gwaku Sauli wawiziti pamuhera na gwenga, shirawu mandawira putiputi, mwimuki na kuwuka katepu pakulangala.”<verse eid="1SA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 29:11" />Hangu, shirawu yakuyi mandawira putiputi, Dawudi pamuhera na wantu wakuyi wawukiti kuwuya muisi ya Wafilisti. Kumbiti Wafilisti awa wagenda Yezireeli.<verse eid="1SA 29:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="1SA 30" />
  <para style="s">Nkondu kwa Waameleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 30:1" />Limashaka lya matatu, Dawudi na wantu wakuyi wawuya Sikilagi. Waamaleki waweriti wagukomanga kala muji gwa Negebu pamuhera na muji gwa Sikilagi na kugulungiziya kwa motu. <verse eid="1SA 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 30:2" />Waweriti walopola wadala na wantu woseri yawaweriti mumiji ayi, wakulu kwa wapusu.Yawawalopoliti, wawukiti nawa pawawera wakomu, pota kumlaga muntu yoseri. <verse eid="1SA 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 30:3" />Dawudi na wantu wakuyi pawasokiti kumjini wawoniti lushi walulunguziya kayi wadala wawu na wanawawu wapalu na wadala woseri walopoluwa. <verse eid="1SA 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 30:4" />Dawudi na wantu wakuyi wanja kulira, walira mpaka waleweleka. <verse eid="1SA 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 30:5" />Na wadala wawiri wa Dawudi, weni ndo Ahinoamu kulawa Yezeeri na Abigaili mdala mkenja gwa Nabali, nawomberi waweriti walopoluwa vilaa. <verse eid="1SA 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 30:6" />Vinu Dawudi kaweriti muntabika nkulu, toziya wantu wakuyi waweriti na hinginika mumiyoyu kwakuhowiziya wana wawu, hangu wafiriti kumgumanga mabuhi. Kumbiti Dawudi kaligangamiziya mumoyu kwa kumlola Mtuwa Mlungu gwakuyi. <verse eid="1SA 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 30:7" />Dawudi kamgambira mtambika Abiatari mwana gwa Ahimeleki, “Gujegi nguwu ya kugibikira pashifuwa sha mtambika.” Abiatari kamjegera. <verse eid="1SA 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 30:8" />Dawudi kamluwa Mtuwa Mlungu shisoweru, “Hashi, lipinga ali niligenderi? Na hashi hanishibati?” Mtuwa Mlungu kamwankula, “Gushigenderi toziya hagushipati na kuwalopoziya yawalopolitwi awa.” <verse eid="1SA 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 30:9" />Hangu, Dawudi kawuka pamuhera na wantu miya sita yakaweriti nawa. Pawasokiti palushemba lwa Besori, wawawoniti wamu wa wantu yawaweriti walopolwa wawaleka palii. <verse eid="1SA 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 30:10" />Kumbiti Dawudi kendereyiti kushigendera shipinga shilii pakawera na wantu miya msheshi na wantu miya mbili wasigaliti palapalii toziya watokiti nentu wasinda kuloka lushemba alu. <verse eid="1SA 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 30:11" />Wantu walii yawaweriti na Dawudi wamwoniti muntu yumu Mmisri kundundu na womberi wamjega kwa Dawudi. Muntu ayu kaweriti keniliyi shoseri ama kulanda mashi kwa shaka sha mashaka matatu paliwala na pashiru. <verse eid="1SA 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 30:12" />Wampananiti shipandi sha libumunda na mashi kayi wampananiti libumunda lya tini na mikunguwi miwili ya zabibu ziyuma. Pakamaliliti kuliya, kapata likakala. <verse eid="1SA 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 30:13" />Dawudi kamkosiya, “Mtuwa gwaku ndo gaa? Na gulawa koshi?” Yomberi kamgambira, “Neni ndo mndemba Mmisri. Ndo ntumintumi gwa Mmaleki yumu. Mtuwa gwangu kandekiti kumbeli mashaka matatu gapititi toziya nweriti mlweri. <verse eid="1SA 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 30:14" />Twenga tukomangiti mji ya Wakeleti yayiwera uwega wa kusika mwa Yuda na ya lukolu lwa Wakereti tuguluziya motu mji gwa Sikilagi.” <verse eid="1SA 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 30:15" />Dawudi kamkosiya, “Hashi, guweza kunjega kulipinga lya walopola?” Mntemba kamwankula, “Payiwera gunapili kwa litawu lya Mtuwa Mlungu kuwera hapeni gundagi, pota kumbeziya kwa mtuwa gwangu, hanikujegi.” <verse eid="1SA 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 30:16" />Mntemba ulii kamlonguziyi Dawudi mpaka kulipinga lilii paliweriti. Pawasokiti aku wawawoniti walopola awa pawawera walipalasiya kila pahala tembera waweriti wankuliya na kulanda toziya lopola zyawalopoliti kulawa isi ya Wafilisti na Yuda ziweriti zivuwa nentu. <verse eid="1SA 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 30:17" />Dawudi kawakomangiti kwanjira mandawira mpaka lishaka lya pili paliwala. Kwahera mpalu yoseri yakalilopoliti ila hera wantemba mia msheshi wakweniti mungamiya na kutuga. <verse eid="1SA 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 30:18" />Dawudi kalopoliti kila shintu sha Waamaleki shawaweriti walopola, ata na wadala wakuyi wawili. <verse eid="1SA 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 30:19" />Kwahera shoseri shashagamiriti, shiweri shikulu ama shididiki, mwana mpalu ama mdala, Dawudi kashilopoliti. <verse eid="1SA 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 30:20" />Viraa Dawudi kaviwuziyiti vipinga vyoseri vya kondolu na ng'ombi na wantu wakuyi yawera wankulololera wankanyama awa pawawalonguziya kulongolu kwa wankanyama wamonga walii. Pawalonga, “Lopola azi za Dawudi.”<verse eid="1SA 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 30:21" />Dawudi kawawuyira wantu walii miya mbili walekitwi kulushemba lwa Besori toziya waweriti watoka kumfata. Wantu walii pawamwoniti Dawudi pamuhera na walii yawaweli pamuhera na yomberi, wagenda kumwanka. Dawudi pakasokiti pakwegera na wantu awa, kawalamusiya. <verse eid="1SA 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 30:22" />Kumbiti wantu woseri wagaziya na wandewu muwamu mwa wantu yawagenditi na Dawudi, walonga, “Hapeni tuwapanani wantu awa lopola zoseri zatuzilopoliti toziya wagenditi ndiri pamuhera na twenga. Ila wawatoli wadala wawu na wana wawu wagendi zawu.”<verse eid="1SA 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 30:23" />Dawudi kawagambira, “Ndala walongu wangu. Hapeni muwezi kutenda hangu kwa shilii Mtuwa Mlungu katupanana. Katulolera weri na katutenda tulikanki lipinga lyoseri lyaliziti kutukomanga. <verse eid="1SA 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 30:24" />Kwahera muntu yakafira kujimirana na maholu genu! Ulii yakagenditi kunkondu na yakasigaliti na visanga vyetu, kila muntu hakapananwi seemu yailinganira na wayaguyi.” <verse eid="1SA 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 30:25" />Kwanjira lishaka lilii Dawudi kaamuwiti ntambu ayi kuwera lagiru na litendeka mpaka leru muisi yoseri ya Israeli.<verse eid="1SA 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 30:26" />Dawudi pakawuyiti Sikilagi, kawajegara waganja wakuyi, weni ndo wazewi wa Yuda, seemu ya lopola pawalonga, “Niwajegera mafupu kulawa lopola za wankondu wa Mtuwa Mlungu.” <verse eid="1SA 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 30:27" />Mafupu aga gaweriti kwajili ya wenikaya wa Beteli na wenikaya wa Ramoti mu Negebu na wanikaya wa Yatiri, <verse eid="1SA 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 30:28" />wenikaya wa Aloeli na yawawera Sifumoti na wenikaya wa Eshitemoa, <verse eid="1SA 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 30:29" />wanikaya wa Rakali na wenikaya wa miji ya Wayerameeli na wenikaya wa miji ya Wakeni, <verse eid="1SA 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 30:30" />wenikaya wa Horima na wenikaya wa Borashani na wenikaya wa Ataki, <verse eid="1SA 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 30:31" />na wenikaya wa Hebroni. Dawudi kawajegiriti viraa wenikaya wa miji yoseri yeni yomberi na wantu wakuyi watyangiriti.<verse eid="1SA 30:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="1SA 31" />
  <para style="s">Kuhowa kwa Sauli na wana wakuyi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 10:1-12">1 Mirandu 10:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 31:1" />Su, Wafilisti walikomanga nkondu na Waisraeli, na Waisraeli wavuwa wahowiti Sauli na wana wakuyi na Waisraeli wamonga wawatiriti Wafilisti. <verse eid="1SA 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 31:2" />Wafilisti wamzyengeta Sauli na wana wakuyi, shakapanu wawalaga Yonatani na Abinadabu na Maliki Shua. <verse eid="1SA 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 31:3" />Nkondu iweriti nkulu nentu kwa Sauli. Waguma misali pawamwoniti wamtenda nentu. <verse eid="1SA 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 31:4" />Sauli pakamgambiriti muntu yakamjegeriti vintu vya kulikomangira, “Gusomoli ligumba lyaku gunsomi nfuwi, su wantu awa yawawingizitwi ndiri jadu nawiza kunsoma ligumba na kunjongera.” Kumbiti yakamjegiti vintu vya kulikomangira vya Sauli kajeriti ndiri toziya katiriti nentu. Hangu Sauli katoliti ligumba lyakuyi mweni na kuliguwira. <verse eid="1SA 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 31:5" />Shakapanu ulii yakajegiti vintu vya kulikomangira pakawoniti handa Sauli kahowa na yomberi viraa kaguwiriti ligumba lyakuyi, kahowa handa Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 31:6" />Hangu ndo Sauli ntambu yakahowiti na wana wakuyi watatu, viraa na muntu yakamjegiti vintu pamuhera na wantu wakuyi woseri mulishaka lilaa limu ali. <verse eid="1SA 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 31:7" />Na womberi yawaweriti uwega wa pili wa lulalanda na wamonga yawaweriti wa kwagulawa mshenji mwa lushemba Yoridani pawawoniti waisraeli watira na Sauli na wana wakuyi wahowa, wayihamiti miji yawu, watira. Wafilisti wagenda na kalikala mumiji ayi. <verse eid="1SA 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 31:8" />Shirawu yakuyi, Wafilisti pawagenditi kutola vintu vya awa yawahowiti wawoniti mitugulu ya Sauli na wana wakuyi kulugongu Giliboa. <verse eid="1SA 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 31:9" />Walikituliti singu ya Sauli na kumvula vintu vya kulikongira vyakuyi, shakapanu wawatumiti walagilagi muisi yawu yoseri ya Wafilisti kubwera visoweru kunumba za vinyagu vyawu na kwa wantu. <verse eid="1SA 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 31:10" />Vintu vyakuyi virii vya kulikomangira wavituliti mnumba mwa Maashitaroti, shakapanu wakongera nshimba yakuyi kushibambaza sha mji gwa Beti Sheani. <verse eid="1SA 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 31:11" />Kumbiti wenikaya wa mji gwa Yabeshi Gileadi pawapikiniriti Wafilisti ntambu yawamtendiriti Sauli, <verse eid="1SA 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 31:12" />makambaku woseri wawuka, wagenda mwanja pashiru poseri, wayiwusiya nshimba ya Sauli na nshimba za wana wakuyi kulawa kushibambaza sha Beti Sheani, wiza nazi mpaka Yabeshi na kuzilunguziya aku. <verse eid="1SA 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 31:13" />Shakapanu, wayitola vifupa yawu na kuyisira pasi pa mtera gwa mkwashu aku Yabeshi na womberi woya kuliya shiboga kwa mashaka saba.<verse eid="1SA 31:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 31" />
</usx>